rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If this card takes damage from multiple sources at once (for example if it is blocked by multiple creatures in combat), it only loses one counter.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If unpreventable damage is applied to this card, you still remove a counter even though the prevention fails.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Remove one counter each time it would be damaged. If it was going to take more than one point of damage, you prevent all the damage and still only remove one counter.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The damage prevention ability works even if it has no counters, as long as some effect keeps its toughness above zero.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It gets the bonus only once, not once per creature it blocks.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not modal. If the target changes from an artifact to an enchantment or vice versa, this still destroys it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'Gaining life when a creature enters the battlefield is optional.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can discard either one artifact card or two cards which may or may not be artifacts. If you really want to, you can discard two artifact cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': '{B/R}, {T}” is the same as saying “{B}, {T} or {R}, {T}.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Activating the last ability of Guardian Idol while it’s already a creature will override any effects that set its power or toughness to a specific value. Effects that modify power or toughness without setting them to a specific value will continue to apply.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Guardian Idol has any +1/+1 counters on it, those counters will remain on it after it stops being a creature. Those counters will have no effect as long as Guardian Idol isn’t a creature, but they will apply again if it later becomes a creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Bloodghast\'s landfall ability triggers only if it\'s already in your graveyard at the time a land enters the battlefield under your control."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sanguine Bond\'s ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it\'s 1 life from Soul Warden or 8 life from Tendrils of Corruption."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Sanguine Bond\'s ability will trigger twice and you may choose a different opponent for each trigger. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an ability triggers whenever an opponent loses life and causes you to gain life, such as the ability of Exquisite Blood, this will loop until either you win the game or a player takes an action to break the loop. If neither of these happen, the game ends in a draw.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and Sanguine Bond\\\'s ability triggers only once.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Even though Trumpet Blast affects only attacking creatures, the bonus will remain for the rest of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Only creatures that are attacking as Trumpet Blast resolves will receive the bonus. In other words, casting it before you\'ve declared attackers usually won\'t do anything."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad’s ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Lotus Cobra’s ability isn’t a mana ability. Opponents may respond to it before you have that mana.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability doesn’t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Lotus Cobra’s ability uses the stack and players may respond to it. It isn’t a mana ability because the event that causes it to trigger isn’t a mana ability.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad’s ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'All players get to see which card you chose at random.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you have multiple instant cards in your graveyard with the same name, and one of them is being targeted by another spell on the stack or is enchanted (with Spellweaver Volute, for example), you must differentiate them so you know which one (if any) is chosen at random. In that case, it may be better to use dice or another method that allows you to differentiate between the instant cards to choose one at random.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you have only one instant card in your graveyard as Surreal Memoir resolves, that’s the one you’ll return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you’re playing a format involving cards printed earlier than the _Urza’s Saga_ set, you may not reorder your graveyard. In this case, you need to be more careful when selecting an instant card at random, perhaps by using dice, writing the names of the instant cards on slips of paper and choosing one of them randomly, or carefully noting the existing graveyard order so you can reestablish it after performing the method suggested above, for example.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you’re playing a format involving only cards from the _Urza’s Saga_(TM) set and later, you may change the order of your graveyard at any time. That means the easiest way to choose an instant card at random from your graveyard is to take all the instant cards in your graveyard, turn them face down, shuffle them, and pick a card. Then you just put the rest back.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Surreal Memoir isn’t targeted. You don’t choose an instant card at random from your graveyard until it resolves. Once you randomly select a card, it’s too late for players to respond.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Distortion Strike doesn’t grant an ability to the targeted creature. Rather, it affects the game rules and states something that’s now true about that creature. The creature can’t be blocked even if it loses all abilities.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, anything that cares about your life total checks the life total of your team. For example, say that your team has 10 life and your opponent’s team has 11 life when you cast Survival Cache. You’ll gain 2 life, so your team’s life total becomes 12. Since your life total (12) is greater than an opponent’s life total (11), you’ll draw a card.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'You choose the color as Emerge Unscathed resolves. Once you choose a color, it’s too late for players to respond.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Kiln Fiend’s ability triggers and goes on the stack on top of it. The ability will resolve before the spell does.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The power of the targeted creature is checked both as you target it and as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Follow the instructions in the order listed on the card: if you target yourself, you’ll put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard and then draw a card.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the target player is an illegal target when Thought Scour tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t draw a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Pristine Talisman has a mana ability. Its ability doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'The number of creatures with defender you control is counted when the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'You must be able to target a creature with flying to cast Aerial Predation.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If the creature with flying is an illegal target when Aerial Predation tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t gain 2 life."}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'A creature with unleash can’t block if it has any +1/+1 counter on it, not just one put on it by the unleash ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Putting a +1/+1 counter on a creature with unleash that’s already blocking won’t remove it from combat. It will continue to block.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The unleash ability applies no matter where the creature is entering the battlefield from.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You make the choice to have the creature with unleash enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter or not as it’s entering the battlefield. At that point, it’s too late for a player to respond to the creature spell by trying to counter it, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Blood Baron of Vizkopa gets +6/+6 and has flying as long as your team has 30 or more life and an opposing team has 10 or less life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won\'t affect the copies."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "Spells cast from zones other than a player\'s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren\'t cast and won\'t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Spells cast from zones other than a player’s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren’t cast and won’t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You may choose new targets for any of the copies. You can choose differently for each copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can’t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Although Darksteel Axe has indestructible, it can still be put into the graveyard for other reasons. The most likely reason is if it\'s sacrificed."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Darksteel Axe itself has indestructible, not the creature it\'s equipping."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'A Curse spell targets the player it will enchant like any other Aura spell, and a Curse stays on the battlefield like any other Aura. If the enchanted player gains protection from the Curse’s color (or any other characteristic the Curse has), the Curse will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Curse is an enchantment type, not a creature type (or any other kind of subtype).'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Each of the Curses can be attached to any player, including the player who cast the Curse.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'The Curse subtype has no inherent rules meaning, but two cards in the Innistrad set (Bitterheart Witch and Witchbane Orb) refer to Curses.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'The ability won’t trigger when a creature attacks a planeswalker controlled by the enchanted player.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whether the other spell resolved. It could have been countered or, if you’ve somehow cast Illusory Angel as though it had flash, it could still be on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Rotfeaster Maggot’s ability is mandatory. If you are the only player with creature cards in your graveyard, you must target one of them.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any spell you cast that doesn\'t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won\'t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won\'t cause prowess to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Once it triggers, prowess isn\'t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "The cost to activate a creature\'s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature\'s outlast ability can\'t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Several creatures with outlast also grant an ability to creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them, including themselves. These counters could come from an outlast ability, but any +1/+1 counter on the creature will count.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The cost to activate a creature’s outlast ability includes the tap symbol ({T}). A creature’s outlast ability can’t be activated unless that creature has been under your control continuously since the beginning of your turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "A face-down creature has a mana value of 0. However, its mana value changes when it\'s turned face up. Thus, if a creature is turned face up in response to being targeted by Noxious Dragon\'s ability, it may become an illegal target."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Prowess triggers only once for any spell, even if that spell has multiple types.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Dragonlord\'s Servant can\'t reduce the colored mana requirement of a Dragon spell you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If there are any additional costs to cast a Dragon spell, apply those before applying Dragonlord\'s Servant and any other cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'The ability can apply to alternative costs to cast a Dragon spell.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'A Monument can’t attack on the turn it enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Activating the last ability of a Monument while it’s already a creature will override any effects that set its power or toughness to a specific value. Effects that modify power or toughness without directly setting them to a specific value will continue to apply.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Each Monument is colorless, although the last ability will make each of them two colors until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If a Monument has any +1/+1 counters on it, those counters will remain on the permanent after it stops being a creature. Those counters will have no effect as long as the Monument isn’t a creature, but they will apply again if the Monument later becomes a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'As long as you cast a spell with rebound from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost or an alternative cost you were permitted to pay.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions, such as “Cast [this spell] only during combat,” must be followed.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Casting the card again due to the delayed triggered ability is optional. If you choose not to cast the card, or if you can’t (perhaps because there are no legal targets available), the card will stay exiled. You won’t get another chance to cast it on a future turn.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If a replacement effect (such as the one created by Rest in Peace) would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere other than into your graveyard as it resolves, you can choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (either because another spell or ability counters it or because all its targets are illegal as it tries to resolve), none of its effects will happen, including rebound. The spell will be put into its owner’s graveyard and you won’t get to cast it again on your next turn.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to its owner’s graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from any zone other than your hand (including your opponent’s hand), rebound will have no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Great Teacher’s Decree affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'As long as you cast a spell with rebound from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost or an alternative cost you were permitted to pay.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions, such as “Cast [this spell] only during combat,” must be followed.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Casting the card again due to the delayed triggered ability is optional. If you choose not to cast the card, or if you can’t (perhaps because there are no legal targets available), the card will stay exiled. You won’t get another chance to cast it on a future turn.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If a replacement effect (such as the one created by Rest in Peace) would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere other than into your graveyard as it resolves, you can choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (either because another spell or ability counters it or because all its targets are illegal as it tries to resolve), none of its effects will happen, including rebound. The spell will be put into its owner’s graveyard and you won’t get to cast it again on your next turn.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to its owner’s graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from any zone other than your hand (including your opponent’s hand), rebound will have no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Ojutai’s Breath can target a creature that’s already tapped. It still won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Draconic Roar targets only the creature, not its controller. If that creature becomes an illegal target before Draconic Roar resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No damage is dealt.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If one of these spells is copied, the controller of the copy will get the “Dragon bonus” only if a Dragon card was revealed as an additional cost. The copy wasn’t cast, so whether you controlled a Dragon won’t matter.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If you don’t reveal a Dragon card from your hand, you must control a Dragon as you are finished casting the spell to get the bonus. For example, if you lose control of your only Dragon while casting the spell (because, for example, you sacrificed it to activate a mana ability), you won’t get the bonus.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'You can’t reveal more than one Dragon card to multiply the bonus. There is also no additional benefit for both revealing a Dragon card as an additional cost and controlling a Dragon as you cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If one of these spells is copied, the controller of the copy will get the “Dragon bonus” only if a Dragon card was revealed as an additional cost. The copy wasn’t cast, so whether you controlled a Dragon won’t matter.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'If you don’t reveal a Dragon card from your hand, you must control a Dragon as you are finished casting the spell to get the bonus. For example, if you lose control of your only Dragon while casting the spell (because, for example, you sacrificed it to activate a mana ability), you won’t get the bonus.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'You can’t reveal more than one Dragon card to multiply the bonus. There is also no additional benefit for both revealing a Dragon card as an additional cost and controlling a Dragon as you cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'You may cast Foul-Tongue Invocation targeting a player who controls no creatures. If you qualify for the “Dragon bonus,” you’ll just gain 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Scion of Ugin is colorless. It isn’t monocolored, nor is it an artifact.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Any spell you cast that doesn’t have the type creature will cause prowess to trigger. If a spell has multiple types, and one of those types is creature (such as an artifact creature), casting it won’t cause prowess to trigger. Playing a land also won’t cause prowess to trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Once it triggers, prowess isn’t connected to the spell that caused it to trigger. If that spell is countered, prowess will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Prowess goes on the stack on top of the spell that caused it to trigger. It will resolve before that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Claustrophobia can target and enchant a tapped or untapped creature.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The enchanted creature can still be untapped in other ways. Claustrophobia will remain attached, and the creature will continue to not untap during its controller’s untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a creature with renown deals combat damage to its controller because that damage was redirected, renown will trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If a renown ability triggers, but the creature leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, the creature doesn’t become renowned. Any ability that triggers “whenever a creature becomes renowned” won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Renown won’t trigger when a creature deals combat damage to a planeswalker or another creature. It also won’t trigger when a creature deals noncombat damage to a player.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Battle-Rattle Shaman\'s ability triggers when the beginning of combat step starts during each of your turns. It resolves before you declare attackers."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes your turn to have multiple combat phases, Battle Rattle Shaman\'s ability triggers during each of them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "A pile can have no cards in it. In this case, you\'ll choose whether to put all the revealed cards into your hand or into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "In multiplayer games, you choose an opponent to separate the cards when the ability resolves. This doesn\'t target that opponent. Because the cards are revealed, all players may see the cards and offer opinions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You (not your opponent) choose which pile to put into your hand and which to put into your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Abyssal Persecutor won\'t preclude an opponent\'s life total from reaching 0 or less. It will just preclude that player from losing the game as a result."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'Effects that say the game is a draw, such as the _Legends_(TM) card Divine Intervention, are not affected by Abyssal Persecutor.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Even though your opponents can\'t lose the game, a player can\'t pay an amount of life that\'s greater than their life total. If a player\'s life total is 0 or less, that player can\'t pay life at all, with one exception: a player may always pay 0 life."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If Abyssal Persecutor leaves the battlefield while an opponent has 0 or less life, that opponent will lose the game as a state-based action. No player can respond between the time Abyssal Persecutor leaves the battlefield and the time that player loses the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "No game effect can cause you to win the game or cause any opponent to lose the game while you control Abyssal Persecutor. It doesn\'t matter whether an opponent has 0 or less life, an opponent is forced to draw a card while their library is empty, an opponent has ten or more poison counters, an opponent is dealt combat damage by Phage the Untouchable, you control Felidar Sovereign and have 40 or more life, or so on. You keep playing."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Other circumstances can still cause an opponent to lose the game, however. An opponent will lose a game if they concede, if that player is penalized with a Game Loss or a Match Loss during a sanctioned tournament due to a DCI rules infraction, or if that player\'s Magic Online® game clock runs out of time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Creatures you control that have +1/+1 counters put on them after Inspiring Call resolves won\'t gain indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'Once a creature gains indestructible, it will have it for the turn, even if it loses all its +1/+1 counters.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Fireball\'s damage is divided as Fireball resolves, not as it\'s cast, because there are no choices involved. The division involves only targets that are still legal as Fireball resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'For example, if X is 5 and you choose three target creatures, Fireball has a total cost of {7}{R} (even though its mana cost is just {5}{R} and its mana value is 6). If those creatures are all still legal targets as Fireball resolves, it deals 1 damage to each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You can target more than X creatures. However, if the number of legal targets at the time Fireball resolves is greater than X, none of them will be dealt any damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You may cast Fireball with zero targets, regardless of the value chosen for X. If you do so, it will not be a targeted spell, and no damage will actually be dealt when it resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If Electrolyze targets two creatures and one becomes an illegal target, the remaining target is dealt 1 damage, not 2. You\'ll still draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If all chosen targets are illegal as Electrolyze tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt and you won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'You divide the damage as you cast Electrolyze, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. In other words, as you cast Electrolyze, you choose whether to have it deal 2 damage to a single target, or deal 1 damage to each of two targets.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If Heroes\' Bane\'s power is less than 0 when its second ability resolves, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined using the power of Heroes\' Bane when the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If Vorinclex leaves the battlefield after its second ability has triggered, that ability still resolves and the affected land won\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a land you control produces multiple mana of more than one type, Vorinclex\'s first triggered ability adds one mana of only one of those types. You choose which of those types it adds."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a Dragon entering the battlefield causes Scourge of Valkas\'s ability to trigger but leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, that Dragon still deals damage."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'The amount of damage dealt by the Dragon that entered the battlefield is based on the number of Dragons you control when the ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a creature an opponent controls enters the battlefield at the same time that Urabrask the Hidden enters the battlefield under your control, Urabrask\'s effect doesn\'t apply to your opponent\'s creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Urabrask the Hidden gives itself haste while it\'s on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a player has more cards in their hand than their maximum hand size during the cleanup step of that player\'s turn, that player discards until they have that many cards. A player\'s maximum hand size isn\'t checked at any time other than their own cleanup step."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Jin-Gitaxias doesn\'t affect the maximum hand size of its controller. Because the cleanup step is after the end step, its controller may have to discard some of the cards that were just drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Unless another spell or ability is affecting your opponent\'s maximum hand size, Jin-Gitaxias\'s ability will result in your opponent having a maximum hand size of zero. They will discard each card from their hand during their cleanup step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a second Elesh Norn, Grand Cenobite comes under your control, you\'ll put one into its owner\'s graveyard due to the “legend rule” at the same time that any of your opponents\' creatures getting -4/-4 are put into their owner\'s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Obstinate Baloth, and both Obstinate Baloth\'s ability and another ability (such as that of an opponent\'s Leyline of the Void) instruct you to put Obstinate Baloth somewhere else instead of putting it into your graveyard, you choose which one to apply."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If you discard Obstinate Baloth and put it onto the battlefield, you\'ve still discarded it. Abilities that trigger when you discard a card (such as that of Raiders\' Wake) will still trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you discard Obstinate Baloth and put it onto the battlefield, you\'ve still discarded it. Abilities that trigger when you discard a card will still trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If another triggered ability during your upkeep causes you to sacrifice a creature, such as that of Lord of the Pit, you won\'t be able to target it with Sheoldred\'s triggered ability as that ability is put on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, the last ability will trigger twice at the beginning of the opposing team\'s upkeep, once for each player on that team. Each player sacrifices only a creature they control."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Swampwalk is a keyword ability that means “This creature can\'t be blocked if defending player controls a Swamp.” Most nonbasic lands don\'t have basic land types, even if they produce colored mana. For example, Graven Cairns is neither a Swamp nor a Mountain, while Blood Crypt is both."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "The opponent whose upkeep it is chooses a creature to sacrifice when Sheoldred\'s second triggered ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures or players are illegal targets as Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies and the damage that would have been dealt to the illegal targets is lost. It won\'t be dealt instead to a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability has and how the damage is divided as you put the ability onto the stack. Each target must receive at least 1 damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If the chosen target is illegal when Lightning Helix tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t gain 3 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If you must sacrifice a creature to pay a casting or activation cost that also includes mana, such as that of Bubbling Cauldron\'s abilities, you may put a -0/-1 counter on Wall of Roots to make its toughness 0 and then sacrifice it to pay that cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Keiga\'s effect lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t wear off during the cleanup step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Nimbus Maze\'s last two abilities check the subtypes of lands you control, not their names. You can activate the appropriate abilities as long as you control a land with the corresponding subtype, Plains or Island. Most nonbasic lands don\'t have basic land types, even if they produce colored mana. For example, Nimbus Maze itself is neither a Plains nor an Island, while Hallowed Fountain is both."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Once your life total is 0, you can\'t pay any more life, even if you\'ve somehow not lost the game yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Overgrown Battlement\'s last ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to (such as by removing creatures with defender you control)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "River of Tears produces {B} only after you\'ve played a land, not after you\'ve put a land onto the battlefield (such as with Evolving Wilds)."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'The turn you play River of Tears, it will produce {B} when tapped for mana.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Whether you control a creature with a +1/+1 counter on it is checked only when Chronicler of Heroes\'s ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t activate Tavern Swindler\'s ability if your life total is less than 3. You can activate it if your life total is exactly 3, but it\'s probably a bad idea. You\'ll lose the game before the ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'A creature dealt damage by Pillar of Flame that dies this turn will be exiled even if it wasn’t the target of Pillar of Flame (because the damage was redirected somehow). If the target creature isn’t dealt damage (most likely because the damage was prevented), it won’t be exiled if it dies that turn.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'A creature dealt damage by Pillar of Flame will be exiled no matter why the creature would die that turn. It could have its toughness reduced to 0 or less or be destroyed by another spell or ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'A nonland permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Genesis Hydra\'s first ability will resolve before Genesis Hydra does. Notably, if you put an Aura card onto the battlefield this way, it can\'t enchant Genesis Hydra."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If "the rest" is zero cards, either because X was 0 or because X was 1 and that card was put onto the battlefield, the library is still shuffled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If you have fewer than X cards in your library, you reveal all of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura onto the battlefield this way, you choose what it enchants as it enters the battlefield. This doesn\'t target any permanent or player, but it must be able to enchant that permanent or player. For example, you could put a green Aura onto the battlefield enchanting a creature with hexproof controlled by an opponent, but not one with protection from green."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "All of the permanents put onto the battlefield this way enter at the same time. If any have triggered abilities that trigger on something else entering the battlefield, they\'ll see each other."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a card in your library has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0. Such cards can always be put onto the battlefield with Genesis Wave."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If you have fewer than X cards in your library, you reveal all of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to put permanent cards revealed this way onto the battlefield if you choose not to, regardless of their mana values."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'A “cost that contains {X}” may be a spell’s total cost, an activated ability’s cost, a suspend cost, or a cost you’re asked to pay as part of the resolution of a spell or ability (such as Condescend). A spell’s total cost includes either its mana cost (printed in the upper right corner) or its alternative cost (such as flashback), as well as any additional costs (such as kicker). If it’s something you can spend mana on, it’s a cost. If that cost includes the {X} symbol in it, you can spend mana generated by Rosheen on that cost.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You can spend mana generated by Rosheen on a cost that includes {X} even if you’ve chosen an X of 0, or if the card specifies that you can spend only colored mana on X. (You’ll have to spend Rosheen’s mana on a different part of that cost, of course.)'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You can spend mana generated by Rosheen on any part of a cost that contains {X}. You’re not limited to spending it only on the {X} part.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You don’t have to spend all four mana on the same cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'After you discard your hand and the number of creatures each opponent must sacrifice has been determined, each opponent in turn order, starting with the player whose turn it is if that player is your opponent, chooses which creatures they will sacrifice, then all the chosen creatures are all sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Malfegor’s ability is not optional. You must discard your entire hand no matter how many creatures your opponents control.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'All of the nontoken creatures you exiled return to the battlefield when Day of the Dragons leaves the battlefield, even if some or all of the Dragon tokens had already left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Day of the Dragons leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and you’ll sacrifice any Dragons you already control. Then its first ability will resolve and exile your creatures forever, leaving you with that many Dragon tokens.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Token creatures will count to determine how many Dragon tokens you create, but they won’t be returned to the battlefield when Day of the Dragons leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'All players get to see which card you chose at random as it’s returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Because the first ability doesn’t target the instant or sorcery card, any instants or sorceries put into your graveyard in response to that ability may be returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The instant or sorcery card returned to your hand is chosen at random as Charmbreaker Devils’s first ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won’t yet know what card will be returned.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat. There\\\'s no such thing as an attacking creature outside of the combat phase.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Angelic Accord’s ability checks how much life you’ve gained during the turn, not what your life total is compared to what it was when the turn began. For example, if you start the turn at 10 life, gain 6 life during the turn, then lose 6 life later that turn, the ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you haven’t gained 4 or more life during the turn when the end step begins, the ability won’t trigger at all. Gaining life during the end step won’t cause the ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate isn’t considered, even though it causes your team’s life total to increase.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'As blockers are declared, any creature that’s tapped or affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, no player is forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t block if that cost isn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Lure doesn’t give any creatures the ability to block the target creature. It just forces those creatures that are already able to block the creature to do so.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Assault Formation’s first ability doesn’t actually change any creature’s power. It changes only the amount of combat damage it assigns. All other rules and effects that check power or toughness use the real values. For example, Hunt the Weak won’t cause a creature to fight with its toughness.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'For example, a 2/3 creature will assign 3 combat damage rather than 2.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Creatures may be dealt damage greater than their toughness. For example, if a source deals 5 damage to Illusory Ambusher, you’ll draw five cards.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Illusory Ambusher blocks a creature with trample, that creature’s controller can assign any amount of damage from 1 to that creature’s power to Illusory Ambusher. Excess damage doesn’t have to be assigned to the defending player.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Damage dealt to an opponent usually causes that opponent to lose life. An opponent paying life also causes loss of life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Diminish overwrites all previous effects that set the target creature’s power and toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its power or toughness to specific values that start to apply after Diminish resolves will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Effects that modify the target creature’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Elesh Norn, Grand Cenobite or prowess, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters).'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Each time Vizkopa Guildmage’s second ability resolves, a delayed triggered ability is created. Whenever you gain life that turn, each of those abilities will trigger. For example, if you activate the second ability twice, let those abilities resolve, then gain 2 life, each opponent will lose a total of 4 life.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Vizkopa Guildmage’s delayed triggered ability causes the opposing team to lose twice the life you gained.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Fog Bank’s prevention effect isn’t considered while assigning combat damage from a creature with trample. For example, if it blocks a 5/5 creature with trample, that creature’s controller must assign 2 of that creature’s combat damage to Fog Bank and the remainder can be assigned to the defending player or planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Hoarding Dragon’s two abilities are linked. The second ability refers only to the card exiled by that Hoarding Dragon’s first ability. In other words, each Dragon has its own hoard.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Hoarding Dragon dies before its first ability resolves, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve. If you choose to exile an artifact card from your library, it will be exiled indefinitely.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The artifact card you find is exiled face up. All players can see what it is.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Hypersonic Dragon’s last ability applies to sorcery cards in any zone, provided something is allowing you to cast them. For example, you could cast a sorcery with flashback as though it had flash.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Hypersonic Dragon’s last ability has no effect on abilities that you can activate “any time you could cast a sorcery.”'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Aether Vial leaves the battlefield while its second ability is on the stack, use its last known number of charge counters to determine what you may put from your hand onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s hand has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Blizzard Specter’s first mode is chosen, the player who was dealt damage chooses the permanent to return to hand when the ability resolves. A permanent with hexproof or protection from black may be chosen this way.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You choose the mode when you put Blizzard Specter’s triggered ability on the stack. Blizzard Specter’s second mode may be chosen even if the player’s hand is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Firemane Angel is put into your graveyard from the battlefield or returned from your graveyard to the battlefield during your upkeep before its triggered ability resolves, you won’t gain 1 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Jace’s Phantasm is dealt lethal damage at the same time as an opponent’s creature, and that creature will become that opponent’s tenth card in their graveyard, Jace’s Phantasm will be destroyed before it gets +4/+4. This is because all creatures that have been dealt lethal damage are destroyed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, a single opponent must have ten or more cards in their graveyard for the bonus to apply, although this opponent may change over the course of the game. You don’t have to pick a single opponent; the ability will monitor each opponent’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The last ability of Jace’s Phantasm constantly monitors each opponent’s graveyard to see if the bonus applies. If the stated condition becomes no longer true, the bonus immediately stops applying.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Lord of the Pit has gained lifelink, being dealt 7 damage by it doesn’t cause your life total to change, even though you gain and lose life. If your life total is less than 7, you won’t lose the game.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you control any other creatures as Lord of the Pit’s triggered ability resolves, you must sacrifice one. You can’t choose to be dealt 7 damage instead.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you have two Lords of the Pit, you can sacrifice them to each other.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Serra Ascendant is dealt damage at the same time that you gain life (most likely because it dealt combat damage to a creature blocking or blocked by it), and your life total becomes 30 or greater, apply its last effect before considering whether or not the damage dealt to it is lethal.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, anything that cares about your life total checks your team’s life total. Serra Ascendant gets +5/+5 and has flying as long as your team has 30 or more life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Sultai Flayer dies, and its toughness is still 4 or greater, its own ability will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Wight of Precinct Six is dealt lethal damage at the same time as a creature an opponent controls, they’re destroyed at the same time. It won’t get an additional +1/+1 from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Wight of Precinct Six’s ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield. In all other zones, it’s a 1/1 creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a Dragon entering the battlefield causes Dragon Tempest’s second ability to trigger but leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, that Dragon still deals damage.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The amount of damage dealt by the Dragon that entered the battlefield is based on the number of Dragons you control when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The two abilities aren’t mutually exclusive. If a Dragon with flying (which is most of them) enters the battlefield under your control, both abilities will trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a basic land you control gains another basic land type or gains another ability that lets it produce mana, consider those effects when determining what colors of mana that land can produce.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Colorless is a type but not a color.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a creature enters the battlefield attacking after attacking creatures have been declared, the ability won’t trigger again because you didn’t declare that creature as an attacking creature. However, if such a creature enters the battlefield before the ability resolves, it will be counted when determining how much life is gained.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a creature you control is dealt damage at the same time that you gain life (most likely because a source you control with lifelink deals damage at the same time), and your life total becomes greater than or equal to your starting life total, apply Path of Bravery’s effect before considering whether or not the damage dealt to that creature is lethal.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Path of Bravery’s triggered ability triggers only once, after attacking creatures are declared. For example, if you attack with five creatures, you’ll gain 5 life as a single event.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Your starting life total is the life total you began the game with. For most two-player formats, this is 20. For Two-Headed Giant, it’s the life total your team started with, usually 30. In Commander games, your starting life total is 40.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with twice that many instead.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you control two Corpsejack Menaces, the number of +1/+1 counters put on a creature is four times the original number. Three Corpsejack Menaces multiplies the original number by eight, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a discarded card isn’t put into your graveyard (due to an effect such as that of Obstinate Baloth) or leaves your graveyard (perhaps because another effect returned it to your hand), it won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you discard a card with madness and wish to cast it, Necropotence’s ability won’t exile that card. If you don’t wish to cast it, you choose whether it ends up exiled or in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Necropotence’s last ability creates a delayed triggered ability that will put the exiled card into your hand. That ability still triggers even if Necropotence is removed from the battlefield before your end step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a permanent spell is chosen as the source of damage, Burrenton Forge-Tender’s prevention effect continues to apply for the rest of the turn to the permanent that spell becomes once it has entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the red source you chose changes colors before it deals damage, the damage-prevention effect doesn’t apply.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The last ability of Burrenton Forge-Tender doesn’t target anything. You choose a source of damage as the ability resolves, if able. You can activate it even if there is no source to choose.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a permanent won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step, that effect waits to apply until its controller has an untap step that isn’t skipped.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If all of the permanents targeted by Yosei’s ability become illegal targets, nothing becomes tapped, but the target player still skips their untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If any of the targets of Yosei’s ability are illegal, they won’t be tapped.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If more than one effect instructs a player to skip their next untap step, such as if Yosei dies more than once in a turn, that player skips that many untap steps. This is different from effects that state that something doesn’t untap during an untap step.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the player becomes an illegal target, the target permanents are tapped, but the player doesn’t skip their untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a second Night of Souls’ Betrayal comes under your control, you’ll put one into its owner’s graveyard due to the “legend rule” at the same time that any creatures getting -2/-2 are put into their owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If each player controls a Consecrated Sphinx, their abilities will cause each other to trigger until one player chooses not to draw cards.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The ability triggers once for each card an opponent draws. You choose whether to draw two cards as each of those abilities resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You may either draw two cards or not draw at all. You can’t choose to draw only one card.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If some of the creatures are illegal targets as Jugan’s triggered ability tries to resolve, the original distribution of counters still applies and the counters that would have been put on the illegal targets are lost. They won’t be put instead on a legal target.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You choose how many targets Jugan’s triggered ability has and how the counters are distributed as you put the ability onto the stack. Each target must receive at least one counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when Grisly Spectacle tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. The creature’s controller won’t put any cards into their graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Use the creature’s power the last time it was on the battlefield to determine how many cards its controller puts into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the creature is an illegal target when Guided Strike tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the damage that would be dealt to a creature with flying is prevented, that creature will still be tapped. If that damage is redirected to another creature, the creature with flying will be tapped, not necessarily the creature that ultimately was dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Thundermaw Hellkite will deal 1 damage to each creature with flying your opponents control whether those creatures are tapped or untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is dealt lethal damage at the same time as a creature an opponent controls, they’re destroyed at the same time. It won’t receive a +1/+1 counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the equipped creature is attacking a planeswalker, the controller of the planeswalker is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The land card is counted when calculating the bonus, and it will be put into the graveyard with the other revealed cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the target player has no land cards in their library, all cards from that library will be revealed and put into their graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If the target would be dealt damage by multiple sources at once, that player or that permanent’s controller chooses one of those sources at the time damage would be dealt, and 1 of that damage from that source is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If there are no legal targets to choose, perhaps because all your opponents have hexproof, the ability is removed from the stack with no effect. You won’t draw a card. This is also true if the target opponent becomes an illegal target in response to the ability.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The opponent chooses whether they sacrifice a creature, pays 3 life, or allows you to draw a card. That player can’t make an impossible choice, such as sacrificing a creature while they control no creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If you cast Amass the Components with fewer than three cards in your library, you’ll draw the remaining cards in your library, put a card from your hand on the bottom of your library, then lose the game for drawing a card from a library with no cards in it the next time state-based actions are performed.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Look at both chosen modes to determine how many targets Cryptic Command has, if any. If it has at least one target, and all its targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, then it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. For example, if you choose the second and fourth modes, and the permanent is an illegal target when Cryptic Command tries to resolve, you won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You choose both modes as you cast Cryptic Command. You must choose two different modes.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Mark of Mutiny can target any creature, even one that you already control or that is already untapped.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter remains on the creature after the control-changing effect ends.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Once Elusive Spellfist has been blocked, causing its ability to trigger won’t change or undo that block.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The cards in your hand are exiled for the rest of the game; they aren’t shuffled back into your library if you take another mulligan. Cards exiled are always face up unless the effect that exiled them says they aren’t. Be sure to return those cards to your deck for your next game.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Unlike a normal mulligan, Serum Powder lets you draw the same number of cards that were in your hand, not one less. If you have already taken one mulligan and your hand contains six cards including a Serum Powder, you can choose to exile those six cards and draw six new cards.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You can use Serum Powder’s second ability only while it’s in your hand. If this card is in your hand, you can choose either to mulligan or to use Serum Powder’s ability. Using the ability doesn’t prevent you from taking further mulligans, and taking a mulligan doesn’t prevent you from using a Serum Powder’s ability if you happen to draw one in your new hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The loss of life isn’t a cost. If the target creature is an illegal target when Ulcerate tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t lose any life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The second ability of Bladewing’s Thrall triggers even if a Dragon enters the battlefield under an opponent’s control. The owner of Bladewing’s Thrall, not the controller of that Dragon, will control Bladewing’s Thrall.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Whether you control a creature named Bogbrew Witch is checked only as the triggered ability resolves. How the target creature is affected won’t change if you gain or lose control of all your Bogbrew Witches later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'While resolving the triggered ability of Skywise Teachings, you can’t pay {1}{U} multiple times to create more tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You don’t have to declare which card you’re searching for when you activate Bogbrew Witch’s ability. You may find either while you’re searching.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Cephalid Broker’s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You may choose Timberland Guide as the target of its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You may find any land cards, not just basic land cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You must be able to target another spell to cast Condescend. Condescend can’t target itself.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You scry 2 even if the spell’s controller pays {X}.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'If either target is an illegal target as Hunt the Weak resolves, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If the creature you control is an illegal target as Hunt the Weak tries to resolve, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on it. If that creature is a legal target but the other creature isn\'t, you\'ll still put the counter on the creature you control."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Hunt the Weak unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Guttersnipe\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Guttersnipe\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must discard exactly one card to cast Tormenting Voice; you can’t cast it without discarding a card, and you can’t discard additional cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker or put onto the battlefield attacking during a turn’s combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you cast Wing Shards after combat damage has been dealt, only creatures that survived combat can be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Storm counts spells cast before the spell with storm was cast. Spells cast after the spell with storm was cast but before the storm ability resolves aren’t counted.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copies storm creates are created on the stack, so they’re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as storm) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The storm ability and the copies it creates all resolve before the spell with storm. They resolve even if the spell with storm is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Wing Shards doesn’t target the creature to be sacrificed. The target player chooses the creature as it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Frost Lynx’s triggered ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A planeswalker with indestructible still loses loyalty as it\'s dealt damage. It is put into its owner\'s graveyard if its loyalty becomes 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control may become lethal if Avacyn leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If each creature the defending player controls can\'t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then the affected creature isn\'t blocked. If there\'s a cost associated with blocking the affected creature, the defending player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to be blocked in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Only one creature is required to block the affected creature. Other creatures may also block it and are free to block other creatures or not block at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, the ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature you control is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won\'t receive a counter from Archangel of Thune\'s ability in time to save it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'You lose 2 life even if the target player has no nonland cards in their hand to discard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Wildsize tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target spell is an illegal target by the time Mana Drain tries to resolve, Mana Drain doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t add mana at the beginning of your next main phase. If the target is legal but not countered (most likely because an effect says that the spell can\'t be countered), you do add mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Mana Drain\'s delayed triggered ability will usually trigger at the beginning of your precombat main phase. However, if you cast Mana Drain during your precombat main phase or during your combat phase, its delayed triggered ability will trigger at the beginning of that turn\'s postcombat main phase."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "To draw cards equal to the difference, first determine how many cards you\'ll draw, then draw that many cards, as modified by replacement effects. For example, if you have two cards in hand and the chosen opponent has five, Thought Reflection will cause you to draw six cards instead of three."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose an opponent while Sandstone Oracle\'s ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you make this choice and the time you draw cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each of the chosen modes happens sequentially. If a permanent has an ability that triggers whenever it or another permanent is destroyed, it will see permanents destroyed at the same time as it or before it, but not permanents destroyed by later modes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If a card is exiled "until" another permanent leaves the battlefield, the exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after that permanent leaves the battlefield during Austere Command\\\'s resolution, and it may be destroyed by a later mode.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If the first and last modes are chosen, an artifact creature with mana value 4 or greater will have to be regenerated twice to survive. This is because the modes happen sequentially, and the regeneration "shield" is used up by the first one. The same is true with any other combination of modes that covers one permanent twice.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Creatures don\'t necessarily have to be dealt lethal damage by Anger of the Gods to be exiled. After being dealt damage, if they would die for any reason that turn, they\'ll be exiled instead."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When an effect returns the exiled card “under your control,” you control it indefinitely after that. If you had temporarily gained control of a creature, it won\'t return to its previous controller. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, a creature you took with Restoration Angel\'s effect is exiled."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature card will also work.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Kiki-Jiki’s ability creates multiple tokens due to a replacement effect (such as the one Doubling Season creates), you’ll sacrifice each of them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a copied creature is a token that isn’t a copy of something else, the copy copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a copied creature is copying something else, the token you create will use the copiable values of the target creature. In most cases, it will just be a copy of whatever that creature is copying.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of, or enters the battlefield as a copy of, the token, that creature will copy the creature card the token is copying, except it will also have haste. However, you won’t sacrifice the new copy at the beginning of the next end step.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (except that the copy also has haste) and nothing else (unless it’s copying a creature that’s a token or that’s copying something else; see below). It doesn’t copy whether the creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on. Most notably, if the target creature isn’t normally a creature, the copy won’t be a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Ajani’s Pridemate’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Ajani’s Pridemate is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Paradise Plume or 2 life from Mycologist.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Magus of the Moon loses its abilities, it continues to turn nonbasic lands into Mountains. This is because effects that change subtypes are applied before considering effects that remove abilities, regardless of the order in which those effects started.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a nonbasic land has an ability that causes it to enter the battlefield tapped, it will lose that ability before it can apply. The same is also true of any other abilities that modify how a land enters the battlefield or apply “as” a land enters the battlefield, such as that of Vesuva or Cavern of Souls.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a nonbasic land has an ability that triggers “when” it enters the battlefield, it will lose that ability before it can trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Magus of the Moon doesn’t affect names or supertypes. It won’t turn any land into a basic land or remove the legendary supertype from a legendary land, and the lands won’t be named “Mountain.”'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Nonbasic lands lose any other land types and abilities they had. They gain the land type Mountain and gain the ability “{T}: Add {R}.”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Repeal tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a spell on the stack has split second while you control Teferi, you can’t suspend creature cards since split second stops you from casting them, even though suspending them is a special action.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a spell or ability lets an opponent cast a spell as part of its effect (such as suspend and rebound do), that opponent can’t cast that spell since the resolving ability is still on the stack. This is true even if the spell is an instant.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If an effect allows an opponent to cast spells any time they could cast an instant (for example, if your opponent also controls Teferi), the restriction of Teferi’s last ability takes precedence over that permission.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Teferi’s last ability means that in order for an opponent to cast a spell, it must be that opponent’s turn, during a main phase, and the stack must be empty. This is true even if a rule or effect allows a sorcery to be cast at another time.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'While you control Teferi, you may exile creature cards in your hand with suspend any time you could cast an instant.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Nature’s Claim tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. No player gains 4 life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does gain 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Bewilder tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you control any tapped lands immediately after Nantuko Shaman enters the battlefield, its ability doesn’t trigger at all. If you control any tapped lands as the ability resolves, you don’t draw a card. Your lands could become tapped and then untapped again in between, however.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Knight of the Reliquary’s first ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield. In all other zones, it’s a 2/2 creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don\'t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it\'s on the stack)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A creature cast using suspend will enter the battlefield with haste. It will have haste until another player gains control of it. (In some rare cases, another player may gain control of the creature spell itself. If this happens, the creature won’t enter the battlefield with haste.)'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Activating the regeneration ability creates a replacement effect that acts like a shield, replacing the next time Spiritmonger would be destroyed that turn. This shield works against effects that try to destroy Spiritmonger or lethal damage that would be dealt to Spiritmonger.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Spiritmonger can regenerate even if it isn’t in combat, it’s already tapped, or it’s undamaged.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Spiritmonger’s last ability causes it to become only the chosen color. It will no longer be the colors it was previously.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can activate the regeneration ability even if Spiritmonger isn’t at risk of being destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]"]
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'ただれたイモリ', 'text': 'ただれたイモリが死亡したとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。あなたが「泥沼煎じの魔女」という名前のクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、それは代わりに－４/－４の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — サラマンダー', 'flavor': 'その背中は魔女の大釜のように煮え立ち、それとまったく同程度の悪臭を放つ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438905&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c61dccf-a643-471a-96bf-03dd953ba366', 'multiverseId': 438905}, 'multiverseid': 438905}, {'name': '腐臭水蝾', 'text': '当腐臭水蝾死去时，目标由对手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。如果你操控名称为沼炼巫师的生物，则改为该生物得-4/-4。', 'type': '生物～火蜥蜴', 'flavor': '它的背就像女巫的鼎镬般起泡，并发出恶臭。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439154&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1673a5d2-0110-421e-b38f-2963219f8c13', 'multiverseId': 439154}, 'multiverseid': 439154}]", "[{'name': 'どぶ潜み', 'text': 'あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、どぶ潜みは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン', 'flavor': '「新しいオモチャを見つけたのさ。遊んでみるか？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438946&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b7a81c0-7f3c-42d6-a09e-b47150eb2b35', 'multiverseId': 438946}, 'multiverseid': 438946}, {'name': '贫窟伏击客', 'text': '每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，贫窟伏击客向每位对手各造成2点伤害。', 'type': '生物～鬼怪／祭师', 'flavor': '「我发现一件新玩具。一起玩吗？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439195&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f60a4fa-63cc-4608-b21a-722d9b7e8f3c', 'multiverseId': 439195}, 'multiverseid': 439195}]", "[{'name': 'ひずみの一撃', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに、このターン、それはブロックされない。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438867&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d739ec3-eb60-4d19-8991-5d8cc915ee8b', 'multiverseId': 438867}, 'multiverseid': 438867}, {'name': '曲身进击', 'text': '目标生物得+1/+0直到回合结束，且本回合不能被阻挡。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439116&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a7ae7d7-2fcf-4fb3-93cd-7b55fa2277f3', 'multiverseId': 439116}, 'multiverseid': 439116}]", "[{'name': 'ゆらめく岩屋', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'せわしない世界を捨て秘密の静寂の地を探し求める者には、莫大な富が待っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439063&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd02de2a0-d13b-4c93-8154-b5d2a5152828', 'multiverseId': 439063}, 'multiverseid': 439063}, {'name': '闪烁石室', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '数不清的财富等待着抛弃繁华世界，寻找僻静之处的人。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439312&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d72f989-1c71-497f-b6f7-e6b620743512', 'multiverseId': 439312}, 'multiverseid': 439312}]", "[{'name': 'よろめきショック', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。よろめきショックはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438962&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abcd49b5-e17b-4d41-9135-830e3eb20a01', 'multiverseId': 438962}, 'multiverseid': 438962}, {'name': '撼动击', 'text': '撼动击对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439211&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd14f0d9-e762-441c-be91-9443affe7028', 'multiverseId': 439211}, 'multiverseid': 439211}]", "[{'name': 'アイノクの盟族', 'text': '長久{1}{W}（{1}{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ先制攻撃を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猟犬・兵士', 'flavor': '「家族や倒れた者たちのため、この戦線を維持せよ！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438819&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98ba7536-fee0-45c0-bdf5-327351c0134a', 'multiverseId': 438819}, 'multiverseid': 438819}, {'name': '义缘犬人', 'text': '延生{1}{W}（{1}{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有先攻异能。', 'type': '生物～猎犬／士兵', 'flavor': '「坚守战线，为了家族和逝者！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439068&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd2d2c55-fdd4-4331-89f5-18081a610054', 'multiverseId': 439068}, 'multiverseid': 439068}]", "[{'name': 'アジャニの群れ仲間', 'text': 'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたはアジャニの群れ仲間の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置いてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士', 'flavor': '「我らのうちいずれかが繁栄する時、群れも繁栄する。」 ――黄金のたてがみのジャザル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438820&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bb2a0b6-5ec5-4b86-8868-7c7c40714286', 'multiverseId': 438820}, 'multiverseid': 438820}, {'name': '阿耶尼的群伴', 'text': '每当你获得生命时，你可以在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～猫／士兵', 'flavor': '「只要一个享福，整群都能享福。」 ～金鬃贾佐', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439069&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a76ca75-48eb-4327-9349-58063f2913ff', 'multiverseId': 439069}, 'multiverseid': 439069}]", "[{'name': 'アゾリウスの大法官庁', 'text': 'アゾリウスの大法官庁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアゾリウスの大法官庁が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439047&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f91b8cef-a71f-49fe-96d6-d9d9165a10bb', 'multiverseId': 439047}, 'multiverseid': 439047}, {'name': '俄佐立衡平法院', 'text': '俄佐立衡平法院须横置进战场。\\n当俄佐立衡平法院进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{U}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439296&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bae0e8e-00ef-4c8d-ae03-07b53e9eaf64', 'multiverseId': 439296}, 'multiverseid': 439296}]", "[{'name': 'アゾリウスの魔除け', 'text': '以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは絆魂を得る。\\n• カードを１枚引く。\\n• 攻撃クリーチャー１体かブロック・クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439007&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e017cccf-9778-4646-ba1c-8ed276c2ac28', 'multiverseId': 439007}, 'multiverseid': 439007}, {'name': '俄佐立护符', 'text': '选择一项～\\n•由你操控的生物获得系命异能直到回合结束。\\n•抓一张牌。\\n•将目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物置于其拥有者的牌库顶。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439256&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ef872dd-a620-421f-a2f5-bd4c2f761407', 'multiverseId': 439256}, 'multiverseid': 439256}]", "[{'name': 'アブザンの戦僧侶', 'text': '長久{W}（{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ絆魂を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': '「私が歩むすべての場所は、祖先も一緒に歩む。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438817&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a0eec81-e7e4-40ed-82a2-c43b598cd23d', 'multiverseId': 438817}, 'multiverseid': 438817}, {'name': '阿布赞战斗僧侣', 'text': '延生{W}（{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有系命异能。', 'type': '生物～人类／僧侣', 'flavor': '「不论我去向何方，先祖都与我同在。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439066&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b0be559-4986-42db-933c-50c624d80fc0', 'multiverseId': 439066}, 'multiverseid': 439066}]", "[{'name': 'アブザンの鷹匠', 'text': '長久{W}（{W}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ飛行を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '砂丘群を越えるのに最も速い手段は、上から行くことだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438818&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29a5f322-2875-4152-97e7-d1e0cea23d34', 'multiverseId': 438818}, 'multiverseid': 438818}, {'name': '阿布赞训隼兵', 'text': '延生{W}（{W}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有飞行异能。', 'type': '生物～人类／士兵', 'flavor': '横跨沙丘的捷径在空中。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439067&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55abf55d-374c-4c4e-b840-6f1d6a359100', 'multiverseId': 439067}, 'multiverseid': 439067}]", "[{'name': 'イオナの裁き', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '天使の眼差しの下では、恐れ無く立てるは正義のみである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438840&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34af5e72-0bdd-4f22-958b-a167c57802fd', 'multiverseId': 438840}, 'multiverseid': 438840}, {'name': '艾欧娜的裁决', 'text': '放逐目标生物或结界。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '在天使的凝视之下，只有义人才能挺立不惧。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439089&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5670aa41-cbe2-437f-be76-1be5dd5d61b6', 'multiverseId': 439089}, 'multiverseid': 439089}]", "[{'name': 'イゼットの煮沸場', 'text': 'イゼットの煮沸場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nイゼットの煮沸場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439056&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53c4d6c2-ff63-477e-9018-28b00e67c4d2', 'multiverseId': 439056}, 'multiverseid': 439056}, {'name': '伊捷炼炉厂', 'text': '伊捷炼炉厂须横置进战场。\\n当伊捷炼炉厂进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439305&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5e95669-c8a5-46d3-a146-8fce115c8f7e', 'multiverseId': 439305}, 'multiverseid': 439305}]", "[{'name': 'ウギンの末裔', 'text': '飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・スピリット', 'flavor': 'ゼンディカーの面晶体の破片からサルカンが作りだした石と魔法の繭に包まれ、数百年の間ウギンは眠り続けた。ウギンが眠る間、その幽体の守護者たちは彼を護りつづけていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438816&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c8008f6-5cbe-4662-ae91-44d76435a1a7', 'multiverseId': 438816}, 'multiverseid': 438816}, {'name': '乌金后裔', 'text': '飞行', 'type': '生物～龙／精怪', 'flavor': '乌金闭关于萨坎用赞迪卡晶石碎片创造出的魔法石茧阵中，沉眠达数百年之久。这段期间内，他的幽灵护卫依然忠于职守，毫不懈怠。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439065&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ecf70e5-21b4-4f50-b80e-400ce62460e2', 'multiverseId': 439065}, 'multiverseid': 439065}]", "[{'name': 'ウスーンのスフィンクス', 'text': '飛行\\nウスーンのスフィンクスが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚公開する。対戦相手１人は、それらのカードを２つの束に分ける。一方の束をあなたの手札に加え、もう一方をあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スフィンクス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438889&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'baea7007-2900-48ba-9695-7eecead00ab8', 'multiverseId': 438889}, 'multiverseid': 438889}, {'name': '乌屯史芬斯', 'text': '飞行\\n当乌屯史芬斯进战场时，展示你牌库顶的五张牌。由任一对手将它们分成两堆。将其中一堆置于你手上，另一堆置入你的坟墓场。', 'type': '生物～史芬斯', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439138&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '417b0c7c-7b3c-4ac5-bada-b0662371971b', 'multiverseId': 439138}, 'multiverseid': 439138}]", "[{'name': 'エメリアの天使', 'text': '飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '地が震えるとき、空は溢れ返る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438835&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c672ab5-1016-441f-9e06-b0f1b88f4f31', 'multiverseId': 438835}, 'multiverseid': 438835}, {'name': '伊美黎天使', 'text': '飞行\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物。', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': '当大地颤动，天空便将充溢。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439084&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8846beb3-0c1c-4032-b4d6-53fccaeb0594', 'multiverseId': 439084}, 'multiverseid': 439084}]", "[{'name': 'オジュタイの学徒', 'text': 'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': '「人の悟りの境地は、闇夜に光る蛍である。龍の悟りの境地は、すべての闇を打ち消す標である。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438848&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cf1a8c4-9bf7-400f-8bd7-5c25427dd039', 'multiverseId': 438848}, 'multiverseid': 438848}, {'name': '欧祝泰的学僧', 'text': '每当你施放非生物咒语时，你获得2点生命。', 'type': '生物～人类／修行僧', 'flavor': '「人世间的启悟不过是夜空中转瞬即逝的点滴萤火。而龙族的启悟就像那驱散一切黑暗的明亮信标。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439097&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '004401d5-ee8b-4b39-b37f-999477e834d7', 'multiverseId': 439097}, 'multiverseid': 439097}]", "[{'name': 'オジュタイの息吹', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。それは、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438883&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d941aa8-4922-4274-aa0e-529f4d3c7244', 'multiverseId': 438883}, 'multiverseid': 438883}, {'name': '欧祝泰的吐息', 'text': '横置目标生物。它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439132&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2600ac61-f3b3-47c1-b554-1c363ed88f60', 'multiverseId': 439132}, 'multiverseid': 439132}]", "[{'name': 'オルゾフの聖堂', 'text': 'オルゾフの聖堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nオルゾフの聖堂が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439058&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15c0ac44-48c7-4a0a-a041-332c3a366f27', 'multiverseId': 439058}, 'multiverseid': 439058}, {'name': '欧佐夫大殿', 'text': '欧佐夫大殿须横置进战场。\\n当欧佐夫大殿进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{B}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439307&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76616a1c-d1d8-41ab-8756-4f5a2a49c2ed', 'multiverseId': 439307}, 'multiverseid': 439307}]", "[{'name': 'オーリオックのチャンピオン', 'text': 'プロテクション（黒）、プロテクション（赤）\\n他のクリーチャーが１体戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': 'ミラディンの最も深い洞窟には、最も明るい希望が隠れている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438824&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17856bfd-e7d7-45c2-bbfc-567bd14d2c15', 'multiverseId': 438824}, 'multiverseid': 438824}, {'name': '欧瑞克斗士', 'text': '反黑保护，反红保护\\n每当另一个生物进战场时，你可以获得1点生命。', 'type': '生物～人类／僧侣', 'flavor': '秘罗地最深邃的洞窟内藏有它最纯净的希望。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439073&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4de39e8-54d8-4d4c-baaa-0e81a21b1746', 'multiverseId': 439073}, 'multiverseid': 439073}]", "[{'name': 'キヅタの精霊', 'text': 'キヅタの精霊は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': 'ケンタウルスの庭園では、訪れた旅行者が樹木の見事な装飾刈り込みに感心している間に、いつの間にか永遠に姿を消してしまうことがよくあった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438985&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90b78f94-b220-4c00-a18d-e698ccd7cd03', 'multiverseId': 438985}, 'multiverseid': 438985}, {'name': '长春藤元素', 'text': '长春藤元素进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '在半人马的花园中，访客常会在欣赏精致的造型树木时神秘失踪。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439234&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3231b017-4750-493c-b3ac-4d88953fa6a3', 'multiverseId': 439234}, 'multiverseid': 439234}]", "[{'name': 'グルールの芝地', 'text': 'グルールの芝地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nグルールの芝地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439054&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25f66982-e8a8-4b8e-8efb-2030fce8f404', 'multiverseId': 439054}, 'multiverseid': 439054}, {'name': '古鲁地盘', 'text': '古鲁地盘须横置进战场。\\n当古鲁地盘进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{G}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439303&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f80e0a3-3a2a-42b7-91b3-31e878fae52f', 'multiverseId': 439303}, 'multiverseid': 439303}]", "[{'name': 'ケルドの矛槍兵', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n待機４―{R}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{R}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを４個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。これは速攻を持つ。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438950&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26df5e02-703d-44b4-b717-aa381e5ce9ee', 'multiverseId': 438950}, 'multiverseid': 438950}, {'name': '凯尔顿长戟兵', 'text': '先攻\\n延缓4～{R}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{R}并将它放逐，且上面有四个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，则施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。它具有敏捷。）', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439199&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6733f76a-fe79-40da-93e4-c16a8e1f488e', 'multiverseId': 439199}, 'multiverseid': 439199}]", "[{'name': 'コラガンの碑', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{R}を加える。\\n{4}{B}{R}：ターン終了時まで、コラガンの碑は飛行を持ち黒であり赤である４/４のドラゴン・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'コラガンは定住する本拠地を持っていないが、その使徒らは遺物を残して彼女が征服した土地であることを記していく。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439032&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fa335b5-b496-444e-a245-361a8e13bae0', 'multiverseId': 439032}, 'multiverseid': 439032}, {'name': '寇安甘纪念碑', 'text': '{T}：加{B}或{R}到你的法术力池中。\\n{4}{B}{R}：直到回合结束，寇安甘纪念碑成为4/4，黑红双色，具飞行异能的龙神器生物。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '寇安甘居无定所，但她曾征服之地都有信徒留下的遗迹以资证明。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439281&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9494bc2-8bb9-42cd-90b9-0f761c5c9593', 'multiverseId': 439281}, 'multiverseid': 439281}]", "[{'name': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場', 'text': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nゴルガリの腐敗農場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439051&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96930e4d-0706-431a-ad18-b05838657f3a', 'multiverseId': 439051}, 'multiverseid': 439051}, {'name': '葛加理腐尸农场', 'text': '葛加理腐尸农场须横置进战场。\\n当葛加理腐尸农场进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{B}{G}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439300&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6a702cb-6c36-43a0-9d2f-2e0218bc0e3a', 'multiverseId': 439300}, 'multiverseid': 439300}]", "[{'name': 'ザルファーの魔道士、テフェリー', 'text': '瞬速\\nあなたがオーナーであり戦場に無いクリーチャー・カードは瞬速を持つ。\\n各対戦相手はそれぞれ、自分がソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ呪文を唱えられる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': 'この次元を救うため、彼はそれ以外のすべての次元を捨てねばならない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438890&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de7079fe-9548-436d-a7e9-3688b9e03938', 'multiverseId': 438890}, 'multiverseid': 438890}, {'name': '赛费尔法师泰菲力', 'text': '闪现\\n由你拥有且不在战场上的生物牌具有闪现异能。\\n每位对手只可以于其能施放法术的时机下施放咒语。', 'type': '传奇生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '为了拯救此时空，他必须将其他的全抛下。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439139&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '820a2ee4-6395-4edd-b4b8-05f5071eeef3', 'multiverseId': 439139}, 'multiverseid': 439139}]", "[{'name': 'シミックの成長室', 'text': 'シミックの成長室はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nシミックの成長室が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439064&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '423b6523-b6a6-4100-8aab-91120bff12a1', 'multiverseId': 439064}, 'multiverseid': 439064}, {'name': '析米克生长室', 'text': '析米克生长室须横置进战场。\\n当析米克生长室进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{G}{U}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439313&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3db5007c-2225-44b4-9e08-c91cb9073fcd', 'multiverseId': 439313}, 'multiverseid': 439313}]", "[{'name': 'シミックの空呑み', 'text': '飛行、トランプル\\n被覆（このクリーチャーは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — リバイアサン', 'flavor': '「我々は自然における種族の欠点を排除し、我々自身が設計した能力と入れ替えたのだ。」 ――モミール・ヴィグ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439023&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5280cd0-1d99-425e-b120-56b5d2ddaa6b', 'multiverseId': 439023}, 'multiverseid': 439023}, {'name': '析米克蔽空霸', 'text': '飞行，践踏\\n帷幕（此生物不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）', 'type': '生物～海怪', 'flavor': '「我们已摒除此物种的自然缺陷，并以独家研发的长处来取代。」 ～莫秘维', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439272&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c029b57f-79f2-4019-8a0e-b5e7ed27d685', 'multiverseId': 439272}, 'multiverseid': 439272}]", "[{'name': 'ジェイスの幻', 'text': '飛行\\nいずれかの対戦相手の墓地にカードが10枚以上あるかぎり、ジェイスの幻は＋４/＋４の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — イリュージョン', 'flavor': 'イクオティのあいまいな記憶の中に、ジェイスは改良するいい考えを見つけた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438875&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94fe7aba-0044-4297-a1d5-df6275825b09', 'multiverseId': 438875}, 'multiverseid': 438875}, {'name': '杰斯的幻象', 'text': '飞行\\n只要某对手的坟墓场中有十张或更多牌，杰斯的幻象便得+4/+4。', 'type': '生物～虚影', 'flavor': '在对伊夸塔纳居民的概略回忆中，杰斯找到足以改进利用的灵感。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439124&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e1303e0-f60c-45cb-b567-65197a096d71', 'multiverseId': 439124}, 'multiverseid': 439124}]", "[{'name': 'ジェスの盗人', 'text': '果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nジェスの盗人がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': '「ちょっとくらい刺激がないと、脱出の醍醐味がないと思わない？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438876&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bb6562c-f30c-4083-bc1e-783cbc0b9a69', 'multiverseId': 438876}, 'multiverseid': 438876}, {'name': '介斯盗贼', 'text': '灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\\n每当介斯盗贼对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～人类／浪客', 'flavor': '「如果一点危险都没有，逃跑还有什么乐趣可言？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439125&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03cf9d21-941b-404d-b107-dbae8a447516', 'multiverseId': 439125}, 'multiverseid': 439125}]", "[{'name': 'ジャディの横枝', 'text': '防衛\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 植物', 'flavor': 'ムラーサでは、木々も木々を育む。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438986&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f614152d-3141-424a-8396-9c8d8e0eef7b', 'multiverseId': 438986}, 'multiverseid': 438986}, {'name': '贾笛旁枝灵', 'text': '守军\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你获得1点生命。', 'type': '生物～植物', 'flavor': '在姆拉撒，就连树也能生出树来。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439235&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d9f6797-e9c1-413d-a81b-c2fa65f94dd7', 'multiverseId': 439235}, 'multiverseid': 439235}]", "[{'name': 'ジャングルの障壁', 'text': '防衛\\nジャングルの障壁が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 植物・壁', 'flavor': '生きている柵が守る静かな空き地には、自然界のかけがえのない秘密が守られている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439017&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0738a60d-ac90-49cd-b0c2-29f024723090', 'multiverseId': 439017}, 'multiverseid': 439017}, {'name': '丛林屏障', 'text': '守军\\n当丛林屏障进战场时，抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～植物／墙', 'flavor': '在由生体围栏守卫的静谧空地中，自然世界守护着其最珍贵的秘密。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439266&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b5535ba-3ee8-4c49-a22e-681358d69327', 'multiverseId': 439266}, 'multiverseid': 439266}]", "[{'name': 'スゥルタイの剥ぎ取り', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていてタフネスが４以上のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたは４点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ナーガ・シャーマン', 'flavor': '「屍術士よ、遺体の方はくれてやる。私が欲しいのは表皮だけだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439001&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3624fd68-fe33-4b0d-a6be-bda91368bfb1', 'multiverseId': 439001}, 'multiverseid': 439001}, {'name': '苏勒台剥皮师', 'text': '每当一个由你操控且防御力等于或大于4的生物死去时，你获得4点生命。', 'type': '生物～那伽／祭师', 'flavor': '「你可以拿走尸体，死灵术士。我只要皮。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439250&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35d1ee6c-5664-4fe4-b5e4-88d322d18f23', 'multiverseId': 439250}, 'multiverseid': 439250}]", "[{'name': 'スランの発電機', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}{C}{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'ウルザのメタスランの子供たちは、効果的に連結された機械システムによって受精され、産み落とされ、養育されていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439045&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bed505a-6d19-465c-b5fd-1ae6a8b4cc5e', 'multiverseId': 439045}, 'multiverseid': 439045}, {'name': '索蓝发电机', 'text': '{T}：加{C}{C}{C}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '克撒的仿索蓝族裔是由一套整合的机械系统孕育、产出、教养。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439294&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a7b58f9-e109-40ca-a0ee-b4cf77d093d1', 'multiverseId': 439294}, 'multiverseid': 439294}]", "[{'name': 'セファリッドの仲介人', 'text': '{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚引き、その後カード２枚を捨てる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — セファリッド', 'flavor': 'セファリッドはアイデアの無料交換ということに重きを置いている。ただし「無料」という点は無視するんだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438859&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fc44c7f-fe50-4338-bc5a-2723af4b8d84', 'multiverseId': 438859}, 'multiverseid': 438859}, {'name': '章人掮客', 'text': '{T}：目标牌手抓两张牌，然后弃两张牌。', 'type': '生物～章人', 'flavor': '章人尊重思想的自由交易，但这当然不是免费的。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439108&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a41718d0-83f8-4c4f-92a5-e7c44fa1516a', 'multiverseId': 439108}, 'multiverseid': 439108}]", "[{'name': 'セラの天使', 'text': '飛行、警戒', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '光に従え。光無くば、彼女に従え。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438845&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1ab2d49-5814-4846-9007-4fa53bce68dd', 'multiverseId': 438845}, 'multiverseid': 438845}, {'name': '撒拉天使', 'text': '飞行，警戒', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': '跟随明光。若置身黑暗，就跟随她。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439094&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b554de6-c974-48e3-8c6b-24a9c90f3653', 'multiverseId': 439094}, 'multiverseid': 439094}]", "[{'name': 'セラの高位僧', 'text': '絆魂\\nあなたのライフが30点以上であるかぎり、セラの高位僧は＋５/＋５の修整を受けるとともに飛行を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': 'セラへの信仰それ自体が見返りです。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438846&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acbcd12b-13f8-444c-b6b1-24ba05290d75', 'multiverseId': 438846}, 'multiverseid': 438846}, {'name': '撒拉入圣僧', 'text': '系命\\n只要你的总生命为30或更多，撒拉入圣僧便得+5/+5且具有飞行异能。', 'type': '生物～人类／修行僧', 'flavor': '信仰撒拉本身即是回报。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439095&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '729393f4-8d42-4b83-bf5a-d98db512fcea', 'multiverseId': 439095}, 'multiverseid': 439095}]", "[{'name': 'セレズニアの聖域', 'text': 'セレズニアの聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nセレズニアの聖域が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439062&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d2f22f8-00f3-4ea4-8460-d4000a080db9', 'multiverseId': 439062}, 'multiverseid': 439062}, {'name': '瑟雷尼亚圣殿', 'text': '瑟雷尼亚圣殿须横置进战场。\\n当瑟雷尼亚圣殿进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{G}{W}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439311&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8a150f0-9ab4-4042-bf03-ed567830e841', 'multiverseId': 439311}, 'multiverseid': 439311}]", "[{'name': 'ダークウッドのベイロス', 'text': '待機５―{G}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{G}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを５個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。これは速攻を持つ。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438975&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b181796-6dfd-4af5-a2d9-0a9c90e32605', 'multiverseId': 438975}, 'multiverseid': 438975}, {'name': '碻林巴洛西', 'text': '延缓5～{G}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{G}并将它放逐，且上面有五个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，则施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。它具有敏捷。）', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439224&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee3977e0-7467-4d70-ab71-5f3322c98f5f', 'multiverseId': 439224}, 'multiverseid': 439224}]", "[{'name': 'ダークスティールの斧', 'text': '破壊不能\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備{2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': '見た目より重く、扱うに難く、確実に耐える。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439029&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c870231-a9f7-4dce-bff8-9910afc1d432', 'multiverseId': 439029}, 'multiverseid': 439029}, {'name': '玄铁斧', 'text': '不灭\\n佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n佩带{2}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': '拿起来比外表更重，挥动需要技巧，且保证耐用。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439278&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e6bf74b-72a9-4b8b-865a-22559debfc30', 'multiverseId': 439278}, 'multiverseid': 439278}]", "[{'name': 'チャネル', 'text': 'ターン終了時まで、あなたがマナ能力を起動できるときならいつでも、あなたは１点のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '魔道士によっては、生の意味より残りの量が重要である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438972&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d06def3-a555-4bcb-80b9-6a710d7e2903', 'multiverseId': 438972}, 'multiverseid': 438972}, {'name': '魔力通道', 'text': '如果你处于能够起动法术力异能的时机，你可以支付1点生命。如果你如此作，则加等量的{C}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '对某些法师而言，比起生命的意义，他们更关心气数还剩多少。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439221&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a71df32-8114-48dc-bb35-413d6b16c1fb', 'multiverseId': 439221}, 'multiverseid': 439221}]", "[{'name': 'ツキノテブクロのエキス', 'text': 'ツキノテブクロのエキスを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ツキノテブクロのエキスはそれに２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '薄めたツキノテブクロは生物の組織をえぐる。煮詰めれば、一滴で巨人をも殺す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439037&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ed8f352-232b-47a7-ac14-a3711bbc320d', 'multiverseId': 439037}, 'multiverseid': 439037}, {'name': '月地黄精粹', 'text': '牺牲月地黄精粹：它对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '若经稀释，月地黄可以侵蚀生体组织。若经萃取，只须一滴便可毒杀巨人。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439286&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f70b83ed-6c50-4e90-9d29-efdeeba2c311', 'multiverseId': 439286}, 'multiverseid': 439286}]", "[{'name': 'テューンの大天使', 'text': '飛行、絆魂\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '邪鬼にも悪夢は訪れる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438823&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41ba0e9c-12e8-4428-bbc6-01e4bacda51c', 'multiverseId': 438823}, 'multiverseid': 438823}, {'name': '图恩大天使', 'text': '飞行，系命\\n每当你获得生命时，在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': '即使是邪恶之徒也有噩梦。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439072&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8388e5b-777b-4b8e-9488-a960a2e47995', 'multiverseId': 439072}, 'multiverseid': 439072}]", "[{'name': 'ディミーアの水路', 'text': 'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439049&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd235b28-54d7-48c6-b152-28b2f3a03686', 'multiverseId': 439049}, 'multiverseid': 439049}, {'name': '底密尔下水道', 'text': '底密尔下水道须横置进战场。\\n当底密尔下水道进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{B}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439298&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30eef897-6db9-49d9-ab07-7d5653541752', 'multiverseId': 439298}, 'multiverseid': 439298}]", "[{'name': 'トーパの自由刃', 'text': '警戒\\n高名１（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これが高名でない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。これは高名になる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '「傷跡こそが私の印章。お前が亡き後もずっと、誇りを持ってこの身に刻み付けておく。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438852&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de3660bb-56e8-4da4-b8d7-6e6c66bd95ac', 'multiverseId': 438852}, 'multiverseid': 438852}, {'name': '托帕助剑人', 'text': '警戒\\n铭勇1（当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若它未铭勇，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且它已铭勇。）', 'type': '生物～人类／士兵', 'flavor': '「伤痕就是我的印记。击败你后我会一直自豪地戴着这些荣耀。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439101&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6310716-5409-461c-ae11-3b6d931f4117', 'multiverseId': 439101}, 'multiverseid': 439101}]", "[{'name': 'ドラゴンの卵', 'text': '防衛\\nドラゴンの卵が死亡したとき、飛行を持つ赤の２/２のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。それは「{R}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': 'ドラゴンの巣穴には雛を卵から呼び出すための宝物が詰まっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438939&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88dc6740-7b34-4ff0-a28d-38e89c7c2140', 'multiverseId': 438939}, 'multiverseid': 438939}, {'name': '龙卵', 'text': '守军\\n当龙卵死去时，派出一个2/2红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物。它具有「{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。」', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': '巨龙出生的巢穴里散落着宝物，用以诱使幼龙破卵而出。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439188&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63c50884-6255-4bdf-88e0-1c6c479bf2a0', 'multiverseId': 439188}, 'multiverseid': 439188}]", "[{'name': 'ドラゴンの日', 'text': 'ドラゴンの日が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーをすべて追放する。その後その総数に等しい数の、飛行を持つ赤の５/５のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\nドラゴンの日が戦場を離れたとき、あなたがコントロールしているドラゴンをすべて生け贄に捧げる。その後これにより追放されたカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438864&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '754fa275-5a24-4093-8208-797405a9935a', 'multiverseId': 438864}, 'multiverseid': 438864}, {'name': '诸龙时光', 'text': '当诸龙时光进战场时，放逐所有由你操控的生物。然后派出等量的5/5红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物。\\n当诸龙时光离开战场时，牺牲所有由你操控的龙。然后将所放逐的牌在你的操控下移回战场。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439113&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0109ef9b-303b-4ac6-8de6-a6b18b58d4cb', 'multiverseId': 439113}, 'multiverseid': 439113}]", "[{'name': 'ナントゥーコのシャーマン', 'text': 'ナントゥーコのシャーマンが戦場に出たとき、あなたがタップ状態の土地をコントロールしていない場合、カードを１枚引く。\\n待機１―{2}{G}{G}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{2}{G}{G}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを１個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。これは速攻を持つ。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438991&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd658f1b-1b79-4a0b-abc9-99d5ee44ebb8', 'multiverseId': 438991}, 'multiverseid': 438991}, {'name': '螳人祭师', 'text': '当螳人祭师进战场时，若你未操控已横置的地，则抓一张牌\\n延缓1～{2}{G}{G}（除了从你手上使用此牌，你可以支付{2}{G}{G}并将它放逐，且上面有一个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，则施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。它具有敏捷。）', 'type': '生物～昆虫／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439240&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04b8b945-0aa9-4f38-9c89-2ce2ba64fa53', 'multiverseId': 439240}, 'multiverseid': 439240}]", "[{'name': 'ネクロポーテンス', 'text': 'あなたのドロー・ステップを飛ばす。\\nあなたがカードを１枚捨てるたび、あなたの墓地からそのカードを追放する。\\n１点のライフを支払う：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを裏向きに追放する。次のあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438913&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '625a065b-36c0-4302-af51-48d862273454', 'multiverseId': 438913}, 'multiverseid': 438913}, {'name': '死冥权能', 'text': '略过你的抓牌步骤。\\n每当你弃一张牌时，将该牌从你的坟墓场放逐。\\n支付1点生命：牌面朝下地放逐你的牌库顶牌。在你的下一个结束步骤开始时，将该牌置于你手上。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439162&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c2fe66a-1340-41d0-89c6-08c292d34e32', 'multiverseId': 439162}, 'multiverseid': 439162}]", "[{'name': 'バーラ・ゲドの蠍', 'text': 'バーラ・ゲドの蠍が戦場に出たとき、パワーが１以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蠍', 'flavor': '素早く致命的で、好物は弱く衰えた者だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438894&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f58bbac0-7984-4646-a0d6-60464b3c51cf', 'multiverseId': 438894}, 'multiverseid': 438894}, {'name': '巴勒格蝎子', 'text': '当巴勒格蝎子进战场时，你可以消灭目标力量等于或小于1的生物。', 'type': '生物～蝎子', 'flavor': '速度快且致命，又爱盯上弱小且体虚者。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439143&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '794b9101-f765-4773-b2b0-33f8ec97d35e', 'multiverseId': 439143}, 'multiverseid': 439143}]", "[{'name': 'パラジウムのマイア', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マイア', 'flavor': 'マイアは空僻地のようなものだ。それは素晴らしい創造を成すための真っ白なキャンバスなのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439039&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3ff4c3f-e2b4-4b39-b694-497ccc682c21', 'multiverseId': 439039}, 'multiverseid': 439039}, {'name': '钯秘耳', 'text': '{T}：加{C}{C}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '神器生物～秘耳', 'flavor': '此秘耳一如烁光荒野：一片空白的画布，却将用来建构伟大的造物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439288&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f26335ee-567e-41f3-ab35-ff6b80d236f0', 'multiverseId': 439288}, 'multiverseid': 439288}]", "[{'name': 'ファイレクシアの憤怒鬼', 'text': 'ファイレクシアの憤怒鬼が戦場に出たとき、あなたはカードを１枚引き、あなたは１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ホラー', 'flavor': '「多くの世界がファイレクシアの前に屈するだろう。ミラディンも単に始めの一つに過ぎぬ。」 ――囁く者、シェオルドレッド', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438917&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '527a50e5-7169-44c7-91de-4529dd454a60', 'multiverseId': 438917}, 'multiverseid': 438917}, {'name': '非瑞克西亚狂怒兽', 'text': '当非瑞克西亚狂怒兽进战场时，你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。', 'type': '生物～惊惧兽', 'flavor': '「我相信许多世界都将臣服于非瑞克西亚。秘罗地只不过是第一个。」 ～细语者希欧蕊', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439166&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2506b8b0-ff27-4941-9411-ac55511efac7', 'multiverseId': 439166}, 'multiverseid': 439166}]", "[{'name': 'ブレンタンの炉の世話人', 'text': 'プロテクション（赤）\\nブレンタンの炉の世話人を生け贄に捧げる：赤の発生源１つを選ぶ。このターン、その選ばれた発生源が与えるダメージをすべて軽減する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — キスキン・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「私たちは鍛冶屋の小村の者です。炉の炎は、冬の寒い夜の小さな火のように居心地がいいものですよ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438829&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '403ed8ff-7b09-42c0-b485-b0d10d83fe18', 'multiverseId': 438829}, 'multiverseid': 438829}, {'name': '布连屯守炉师', 'text': '反红保护\\n牺牲布连屯守炉师：选择一个红色来源。于本回合中，防止该来源将造成的所有伤害。', 'type': '生物～洁英／法术师', 'flavor': '「这小村住的都是铁匠。锻冶炉对我们来说，就像凉冬午后的小火堆一样舒服。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439078&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55fd1e10-a363-4244-b71a-7b0a6797dd88', 'multiverseId': 439078}, 'multiverseid': 439078}]", "[{'name': 'ボガーダンのヘルカイト', 'text': '瞬速\\n飛行\\nボガーダンのヘルカイトが戦場に出たとき、望む数のクリーチャーやプレイヤーを対象とする。ボガーダンのヘルカイトはそれらに５点のダメージをあなたの望むように分割して与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438933&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd10a6d02-8cb8-4fd0-aec2-4e85077f46a1', 'multiverseId': 438933}, 'multiverseid': 438933}, {'name': '博卡登残虐者', 'text': '闪现\\n飞行\\n当博卡登残虐者进战场时，它对任意数量的目标生物和／或牌手造成共5点伤害，你可以任意分配。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439182&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '461e26ac-c904-496f-b495-5262828c34a4', 'multiverseId': 439182}, 'multiverseid': 439182}]", "[{'name': 'ボロスの駐屯地', 'text': 'ボロスの駐屯地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボロスの駐屯地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439048&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00943bf6-abb7-4c07-8cdf-52327a1283a2', 'multiverseId': 439048}, 'multiverseid': 439048}, {'name': '波洛斯驻防地', 'text': '波洛斯驻防地须横置进战场。\\n当波洛斯驻防地进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{W}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439297&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6feb17a8-6c86-4cf8-9dea-7b0a6c14a61a', 'multiverseId': 439297}, 'multiverseid': 439297}]", "[{'name': 'マナキン人形', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '「工匠は毎晩、その小さな人形を引き出しに入れて鍵をかけた。毎朝目覚めると、それは安っぽい宝石を手にたたずんでいるのだった。」 ――「工匠の見習い」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439033&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a5793d1-bbac-4559-9856-2e5e8cca9a42', 'multiverseId': 439033}, 'multiverseid': 439033}, {'name': '魔力人偶', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '「每天晚上睡前，神器师都会将这小人偶收进抽屉并上好锁。每天早上醒后，她都会看到它拿着不同的东西等在身边。」 ～《神器师学徒》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439282&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f66ddce-3c23-4363-8d1c-5756b37ea748', 'multiverseId': 439282}, 'multiverseid': 439282}]", "[{'name': 'マナ吸収', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。あなたの次のメイン・フェイズの開始時に、あなたのマナ・プールに、その呪文の点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数の{C}を加える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '熱意は準備にしかず。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438880&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3a3a83e-e303-4b9a-8624-b485d3d35f4f', 'multiverseId': 438880}, 'multiverseid': 438880}, {'name': '汲取魔力', 'text': '反击目标咒语。在你的下一个行动阶段开始时，加若干{C}到你的法术力池中，其数量等同于该咒语的总法术力费用。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '万丈激情难敌万全之策。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439129&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d348651-a91c-41fc-b00e-410e371fc099', 'multiverseId': 439129}, 'multiverseid': 439129}]", "[{'name': 'マナ漏出', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'どんな計画でも、敵よりも自分の方がよく知っていると思うことが致命的な欠陥となる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438881&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cfebc66-116c-40dd-9691-7a43e1b520ea', 'multiverseId': 438881}, 'multiverseid': 438881}, {'name': '魔力流失', 'text': '除非目标咒语的操控者支付{3}，否则反击之。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '任何计划中最大的漏洞，即是假设你所知道的比敌人多。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439130&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '350100b4-4a0b-427e-ad73-dd59187d3e44', 'multiverseId': 439130}, 'multiverseid': 439130}]", "[{'name': 'マハモティ・ジン', 'text': '飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン', 'flavor': 'マハモティ・ジンは大気の精霊たちの中でも高貴な血筋につながり、風の翼で空を駆ける。彼は計略と詐術の名手であり、戦場はもちろん、賭博場においても危険な存在となる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438879&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49f3f93b-1f18-4baa-a206-24d86566f042', 'multiverseId': 438879}, 'multiverseid': 438879}, {'name': '神灯巨灵', 'text': '飞行', 'type': '生物～巨灵', 'flavor': '神灯巨灵乘着风的翅膀，拥有大气精怪中的高贵血统。他是诡计与误导的专家，不论身处赌场或战场都是一等高手。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439128&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b74b106-9cc9-47b0-bd2c-41e08ada79ed', 'multiverseId': 439128}, 'multiverseid': 439128}]", "[{'name': 'マルフェゴール', 'text': '飛行\\nマルフェゴールが戦場に出たとき、あなたの手札を捨てる。各対戦相手はそれぞれ、これにより捨てられたカード１枚につきクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — デーモン・ドラゴン', 'flavor': '悪魔は信頼されず、ドラゴンは支配されない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439020&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aee5a076-f581-4d95-aeea-6127f4d0ad3a', 'multiverseId': 439020}, 'multiverseid': 439020}, {'name': '墨非葛', 'text': '飞行\\n当墨非葛进战场时，弃掉你的手牌。每以此法弃掉一张牌，每位对手便各牺牲一个生物。', 'type': '传奇生物～恶魔／龙', 'flavor': '不可信任的恶魔，不愿听令的巨龙。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439269&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b702df6-12b2-4f73-addd-53bbe3dd91c3', 'multiverseId': 439269}, 'multiverseid': 439269}]", "[{'name': 'マー＝エクの夜刃', 'text': '長久{B}（{B}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ接死を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — オーク・暗殺者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438912&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6754f851-8da3-4ce8-ac7d-a94364272202', 'multiverseId': 438912}, 'multiverseid': 438912}, {'name': '莫克夜刃手', 'text': '延生{B}（{B}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有死触异能。', 'type': '生物～半兽人／杀手', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439161&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d9011be-05f8-4376-8617-991a55399b12', 'multiverseId': 439161}, 'multiverseid': 439161}]", "[{'name': 'ミシュラのガラクタ', 'text': '{T}, ミシュラのガラクタを生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。次のターンのアップキープの開始時に、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '「アーカムなど愚かな子供に過ぎん！ファイレクシアの技術こそ我らの最高の祝福。例えば、この愉快な装具を見るがよい……。」 ――霧氷風の使い手、ハイダー', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439036&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fadbb31d-8eb6-4df9-b1de-e201a5fff758', 'multiverseId': 439036}, 'multiverseid': 439036}, {'name': '米斯拉的饰品', 'text': '{T}，牺牲米斯拉的饰品：检视目标牌手的牌库顶牌。在下回合维持开始时抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '「阿肯真是爱唠叨的蠢材！非瑞克西亚的技术是上天送来的宝贵礼物。比如这精致的饰品. . .」 ～霜风会首领亥达', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439285&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34e035c1-f70d-4423-bc02-9f242713f10a', 'multiverseId': 439285}, 'multiverseid': 439285}]", "[{'name': 'ラクドスのドレイク', 'text': '飛行\\n解鎖（あなたはこのクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出してもよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドレイク', 'flavor': 'ラクドスの暴徒は血にまみれたドレイクの鼻面に見立てた彩色を顔に施す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438918&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6b08854-881d-4a7d-9281-a83d3234c7a1', 'multiverseId': 438918}, 'multiverseid': 438918}, {'name': '拉铎司龙兽', 'text': '飞行\\n脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能进行阻挡。）', 'type': '生物～龙兽', 'flavor': '拉铎司暴乱者会在脸上涂抹油彩，扮成龙兽满嘴鲜血的样子。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439167&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '513b10cd-89bb-4b59-8623-0d7c232f4ce8', 'multiverseId': 439167}, 'multiverseid': 439167}]", "[{'name': 'ラクドスの肉儀場', 'text': 'ラクドスの肉儀場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nラクドスの肉儀場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439060&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25e8b885-50c2-432f-a1dc-124a19379e50', 'multiverseId': 439060}, 'multiverseid': 439060}, {'name': '拉铎司剜祭场', 'text': '拉铎司剜祭场须横置进战场。\\n当拉铎司剜祭场进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{B}{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439309&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e4b2ddc-953f-4557-aa02-60514ee7c8fb', 'multiverseId': 439309}, 'multiverseid': 439309}]", "[{'name': 'ラッパの一吹き', 'text': 'ターン終了時まで、攻撃クリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「サルカンよ、あれが聞こえるか？我が軍族に栄光あれ！お前が見限ったものから、俺は伝説を創りあげたのだ。」 ――マルドゥのカン、ズルゴ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438966&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e76e837b-a7db-439f-8b07-4ae95540710a', 'multiverseId': 438966}, 'multiverseid': 438966}, {'name': '号角震天', 'text': '进行攻击的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「萨坎，你听到了吗？这是部落的荣耀！我从你放弃的东西中创造了传奇。」 ～玛尔都可汗珠高', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439215&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7bbb509-2dba-422f-8fc8-0dd3b4994e92', 'multiverseId': 439215}, 'multiverseid': 439215}]", "[{'name': 'ルーンの苦役者', 'text': 'ルーンの苦役者が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '学者たちは何世紀もの間タル・テリグの遺跡に頭を悩ませてきた。その秘密はルーンの刻まれたその頭の中にずっとあったのに。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439041&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46fa687d-5477-43ae-8304-c85bc9aea162', 'multiverseId': 439041}, 'multiverseid': 439041}, {'name': '符文随侍', 'text': '当符文随侍死去时，每位牌手各抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '塔帖立遗迹让学者思索数百年却找不到解答。其秘密一直就躲在个刻着符文的头里面。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439290&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b627e9a2-f4f3-40aa-b9c3-998ca355425d', 'multiverseId': 439290}, 'multiverseid': 439290}]", "[{'name': 'ルーン傷の悪魔', 'text': '飛行\\nルーン傷の悪魔が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーからカード１枚を探してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': 'その身体に刻まれた冥府の連祷は、その暗き心臓の刻みに合わせて脈打つ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438921&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e96c1e9-67cc-45ef-90ba-7d960ab295ea', 'multiverseId': 438921}, 'multiverseid': 438921}, {'name': '符痕恶魔', 'text': '飞行\\n当符痕恶魔进战场时，从你的牌库中搜寻一张牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～恶魔', 'flavor': '他身上的地狱祷文随其黑暗之心脉动着。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439170&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa91cb94-0150-492d-be18-4d3d57728080', 'multiverseId': 439170}, 'multiverseid': 439170}]", "[{'name': 'ヴァルカスの災い魔', 'text': '飛行\\nヴァルカスの災い魔か他のドラゴンが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。その戦場に出たクリーチャーは、それにＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているドラゴンの総数に等しい。\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、ヴァルカスの災い魔は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438960&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1af492dd-a7f3-404b-b8ae-babf858d8e5e', 'multiverseId': 438960}, 'multiverseid': 438960}, {'name': '伐卡兹祸害', 'text': '飞行\\n每当伐卡兹祸害或另一个龙在你的操控下进战场时，它对目标生物或牌手造成X点伤害，X为由你操控的龙数量。\\n{R}：伐卡兹祸害得+1/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439209&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f84283b-50e4-40c4-9157-bcae6ffecf0d', 'multiverseId': 439209}, 'multiverseid': 439209}]", "[{'name': 'ヴィズコーパのギルド魔道士', 'text': '{1}{W}{B}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\\n{1}{W}{B}：このターンの間、あなたがライフを得るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれその点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439026&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ef5607a-00ef-4f28-8d49-1d57a2df7db8', 'multiverseId': 439026}, 'multiverseid': 439026}, {'name': '伟柯帕公会法师', 'text': '{1}{W}{B}：目标生物获得系命异能直到回合结束。\\n{1}{W}{B}：本回合中，每当你获得生命时，每位对手各失去等量的生命。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439275&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2811ad51-e7b5-4520-9e97-6dc463d5031b', 'multiverseId': 439275}, 'multiverseid': 439275}]", "[{'name': 'ヴィズコーパの血男爵', 'text': '絆魂、プロテクション（白）、プロテクション（黒）\\nあなたのライフが30点以上で、いずれかの対戦相手のライフが10点以下であるかぎり、ヴィズコーパの血男爵は＋６/＋６の修整を受けるとともに飛行を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439010&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8bc7934-bf62-4afc-9f5a-54c612eaa838', 'multiverseId': 439010}, 'multiverseid': 439010}, {'name': '伟柯帕血爵', 'text': '系命，反白保护，反黑保护\\n只要你的总生命为30或更多，且某对手的总生命为10或更少，伟柯帕血爵便得+6/+6且具有飞行异能。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439259&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98f25455-c184-4fcf-8ed9-c51154c8b05c', 'multiverseId': 439259}, 'multiverseid': 439259}]", "[{'name': '不可思の一瞥', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを10枚自分の墓地に置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '我らの建前を見抜けるどんな鋭い者がいたとしても、ディミーア家の真実に対する構えはまったくできていないだろう。 ――ザデック', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439015&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8bfd518-13b8-4f82-a97a-0bb9498cad1a', 'multiverseId': 439015}, 'multiverseid': 439015}, {'name': '瞥视恶念', 'text': '目标牌手将其牌库顶的十张牌置入其坟墓场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「我敢说，若是真有人能透视我们的心思，就算他理解力再强，也将完全无法承受底密尔会堂背后的真相。」 ～札戴克', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439264&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b769c9f-1da2-445a-83af-85251383011c', 'multiverseId': 439264}, 'multiverseid': 439264}]", "[{'name': '世界を支える者', 'text': '飛行\\n世界を支える者がブロックするたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋０/＋２の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '彼女の盾を打ち破ることはできるかもしれないが、彼女の気迫を打ち破ることは絶対にできない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438850&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8690e5c4-8214-429b-a0c4-34266123dab0', 'multiverseId': 438850}, 'multiverseid': 438850}, {'name': '圣域坚兵', 'text': '飞行\\n每当圣域坚兵进行阻挡时，它得+0/+2直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': '也许你能击碎她的盾，但却永远无法降伏她的灵魂。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439099&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdea7787-b84d-4879-917c-1d624903e47d', 'multiverseId': 439099}, 'multiverseid': 439099}]", "[{'name': '五制術の護法印', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n五制術の護法印が戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\n五制術の護法印が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、プロテクション（その選ばれた色）を持つ。この効果は五制術の護法印を取り除かない。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438842&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38ccc6d5-4ca6-4f17-ad26-47df8751365a', 'multiverseId': 438842}, 'multiverseid': 438842}, {'name': '伍领守护', 'text': '结附于生物\\n于伍领守护进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n当伍领守护进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的生物具有反该色保护异能。此效应不会移除伍领守护。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439091&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bcb8d3f-224a-4789-b22e-510d17409fb5', 'multiverseId': 439091}, 'multiverseid': 439091}]", "[{'name': '修復の天使', 'text': '瞬速\\n飛行\\n修復の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて天使でないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放し、その後そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438843&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3b4d5f9-7a71-40f7-b747-009e680b152f', 'multiverseId': 438843}, 'multiverseid': 438843}, {'name': '复归天使', 'text': '闪现\\n飞行\\n当复归天使进战场时，你可以放逐目标由你操控且非天使的生物，然后将该牌在你的操控下移回战场。', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439092&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '463b9ca6-2211-4d28-a96e-468081bf8f93', 'multiverseId': 439092}, 'multiverseid': 439092}]", "[{'name': '偉大なる師の指令', 'text': 'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438836&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1be0cdcd-64d5-4ad5-8675-2986affdd8a0', 'multiverseId': 438836}, 'multiverseid': 438836}, {'name': '大宗师之决断', 'text': '由你操控的生物得+2/+1直到回合结束。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439085&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caf439f8-9f52-4bc3-974b-099425aef795', 'multiverseId': 439085}, 'multiverseid': 439085}]", "[{'name': '偶像の石塚', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{B/R}, {T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}{B}か{B}{R}か{R}{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'カー＝センギアのシャーマンが言うには、日が沈むのは、崖に彫られた苦痛に満ちた視線に耐え切れないからだそうだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439052&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63228f95-f280-4ed8-8c6c-a159ad5e83b1', 'multiverseId': 439052}, 'multiverseid': 439052}, {'name': '铭刻石标', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{B/R}，{T}：加{B}{B}，{B}{R}或{R}{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '凯辛格的祭师认为太阳落下的原因，是已无法忍受这铭刻崖壁的痛苦瞪视。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439301&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19e114bd-246f-4838-a798-08536b8306c9', 'multiverseId': 439301}, 'multiverseid': 439301}]", "[{'name': '僧院の速槍', 'text': '速攻\\n果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': '戦闘での書道は、突発的に流れた血によって書かれる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438955&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40aac4a4-39c3-4e3c-9623-38bb471b1091', 'multiverseId': 438955}, 'multiverseid': 438955}, {'name': '寺院迅矛僧', 'text': '敏捷\\n灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）', 'type': '生物～人类／修行僧', 'flavor': '迅笔血迹舞就战地行书。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439204&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e3dc444-7454-498e-ba04-cb3111730e34', 'multiverseId': 439204}, 'multiverseid': 439204}]", "[{'name': '光輝の泉', 'text': '光輝の泉が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '「疲れ果てた旅人が安心して水を飲める場所は、すべての者にとっての宝である。」 ――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439059&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33e6b659-37d5-4b32-9df8-491e89db7e50', 'multiverseId': 439059}, 'multiverseid': 439059}, {'name': '华光喷泉', 'text': '当华光喷泉进战场时，你获得2点生命。\\n{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '「每个人都重视疲惫的旅人能安心喝水的地方。」 ～金鬃阿耶尼', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439308&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'deeeb950-6f2a-4829-9a5c-2b9e7416ac34', 'multiverseId': 439308}, 'multiverseid': 439308}]", "[{'name': '冠角獣', 'text': 'トランプル\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれている各クリーチャーはそれぞれトランプルを持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — サイ', 'flavor': '荒れ狂う角獣をなだめる一番の方法は、そいつが自然死を迎えるまで待つことだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438973&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6153d48-79e9-419f-ad45-ca798f837df7', 'multiverseId': 438973}, 'multiverseid': 438973}, {'name': '冠角龙', 'text': '践踏\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有践踏异能。', 'type': '生物～犀牛', 'flavor': '想让一头暴怒的角龙静下来，最好的办法是等它自然死亡。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439222&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f42cbfb-a642-4bf3-beb6-46373c07acfc', 'multiverseId': 439222}, 'multiverseid': 439222}]", "[{'name': '刃の翼の虜', 'text': 'あなたがドラゴンをコントロールしているかぎり、刃の翼の虜は飛行を持つ。\\nドラゴンが１体戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたの墓地から刃の翼の虜を戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': '栄光の残滓を追い求める生命の影。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438896&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b65d9c0-ec12-4028-b721-cd3284ab54da', 'multiverseId': 438896}, 'multiverseid': 438896}, {'name': '锋翼尸奴', 'text': '只要你操控龙，锋翼尸奴便具有飞行异能。\\n当任一龙进战场时，你可以将锋翼尸奴从你的坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '生物～灵俑', 'flavor': '追寻荣耀空壳的生命阴影。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439145&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e875c12-7fa8-42a7-b58f-fcfd47f77ec8', 'multiverseId': 439145}, 'multiverseid': 439145}]", "[{'name': '剣を鍬に', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ごく小さい後悔の種が救済の花を咲かせる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438851&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b390ae00-794d-46ae-8623-037f3e346413', 'multiverseId': 438851}, 'multiverseid': 438851}, {'name': '化剑为犁', 'text': '放逐目标生物。其操控者获得等同于其力量的生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '再小的悔恨种子也能开出救赎之花。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439100&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47d0da36-3f22-40f7-9f82-1f31778fcd54', 'multiverseId': 439100}, 'multiverseid': 439100}]", "[{'name': '勇気の道', 'text': 'あなたのライフ総量があなたの初期ライフ総量以上であるかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体以上攻撃するたび、あなたは攻撃クリーチャーの総数に等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438841&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93717d2a-52f2-433a-80e2-70c2044a29d3', 'multiverseId': 438841}, 'multiverseid': 438841}, {'name': '勇行之途', 'text': '只要你的总生命大于或等于你的起始总生命，由你操控的生物便得+1/+1。\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物攻击时，你获得若干生命，其数量等同于进行攻击的生物数量。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439090&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ddc09249-004b-4483-9b22-84aec185b9dc', 'multiverseId': 439090}, 'multiverseid': 439090}]", "[{'name': '卑下', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{X}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。占術２を行う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「あの騒ぎが何だったのか分からないのは残念だ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438861&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27bce8dc-28b1-41b4-b8ea-d5c04ff33a29', 'multiverseId': 438861}, 'multiverseid': 438861}, {'name': '睥睨', 'text': '除非目标咒语的操控者支付{X}，否则反击之。占卜2。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「可惜我们再也看不到会有什么花样了。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439110&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61b9f63b-0af6-41fd-8c17-f6f235c2c128', 'multiverseId': 439110}, 'multiverseid': 439110}]", "[{'name': '原始のタイタン', 'text': 'トランプル\\n原始のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人', 'flavor': '自然の呼び声が聞こえたら、逃げろ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438998&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e59e202c-b861-4140-89ce-231237ffaf58', 'multiverseId': 438998}, 'multiverseid': 438998}, {'name': '太古泰坦', 'text': '践踏\\n每当太古泰坦进战场或攻击时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～巨人', 'flavor': '当大自然呼叫时，跑。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439247&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0aab26c3-55db-47b1-922d-120febad3dab', 'multiverseId': 439247}, 'multiverseid': 439247}]", "[{'name': '反逆の印', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、それをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '怒りの炎は、一度火がついたら簡単には消せない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438954&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a017228-6e25-4e7e-987b-dd221b555d3c', 'multiverseId': 438954}, 'multiverseid': 438954}, {'name': '反乱印记', 'text': '获得目标生物的操控权直到回合结束。在上面放置一个+1/+1指示物并重置它。该生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '愤怒火焰一旦燃起便难以浇熄。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439203&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c9b5a42-8578-40b4-b5cf-b5a8c8f6770f', 'multiverseId': 439203}, 'multiverseid': 439203}]", "[{'name': '叫び霊', 'text': '飛行\\n叫び霊がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚自分の墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '肉体の傷は容易く癒える。精神の傷は取り返しがつかない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438887&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc7369c1-c38b-4356-8eb4-2cc248a620d1', 'multiverseId': 438887}, 'multiverseid': 438887}, {'name': '尖鸣游魂', 'text': '飞行\\n每当尖鸣游魂对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。', 'type': '生物～精怪', 'flavor': '肉体伤口容易愈合。心灵伤口则可能永难平复。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439136&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '600d6355-c5d7-4a3f-a909-5ccad874ad91', 'multiverseId': 439136}, 'multiverseid': 439136}]", "[{'name': '吹雪の死霊', 'text': '飛行\\n吹雪の死霊がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• そのプレイヤーは自分がコントロールしているパーマネント１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n• そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。', 'type': '氷雪クリーチャー — スペクター', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439009&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06824858-b182-4497-8e66-3c6595e2ae1b', 'multiverseId': 439009}, 'multiverseid': 439009}, {'name': '暴风雪幽灵', 'text': '飞行\\n每当暴风雪幽灵对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，选择一项～\\n•该牌手将一个由其操控的永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n•该牌手弃一张牌。', 'type': '雪境生物～幽灵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439258&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fbdf1c6-eae3-4856-bd98-1e2c1fb0b3a2', 'multiverseId': 439258}, 'multiverseid': 439258}]", "[{'name': '囁く者、シェオルドレッド', 'text': '沼渡り\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\n各対戦相手のアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 法務官', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438923&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84c94a47-1184-4fdd-9fb3-71f2157808aa', 'multiverseId': 438923}, 'multiverseid': 438923}, {'name': '细语者希欧蕊', 'text': '沼泽行者\\n在你的维持开始时，将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n在每位对手的维持开始时，该牌手牺牲一个生物。', 'type': '传奇生物～魔判官', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439172&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd98d6152-e87b-4ed2-93a0-02499afa1ec9', 'multiverseId': 439172}, 'multiverseid': 439172}]", "[{'name': '国境地帯の匪賊', 'text': '国境地帯の匪賊が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '彼女は確かに恐れられているものの、実は戦いでの活躍を物語る逸話はあまり多くない。それは彼女の襲撃を生き延びることができた者がとても少ないからである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438934&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb3fc465-cb99-442c-8f72-a37de1af2136', 'multiverseId': 438934}, 'multiverseid': 438934}, {'name': '边境劫掠者', 'text': '每当边境劫掠者攻击时，它得+2/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': '虽然她确实令人畏惧，但其战斗事迹却鲜有流传，因为没人能活过她的突袭。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439183&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99c1105d-65d0-409e-80e6-31a121197030', 'multiverseId': 439183}, 'multiverseid': 439183}]", "[{'name': '地平線の梢', 'text': '{T}, １点のライフを支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}か{W}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 地平線の梢を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'その枝々の間から一日が生まれる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439055&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '645e6eae-a945-43f8-bad4-6864ffff7400', 'multiverseId': 439055}, 'multiverseid': 439055}, {'name': '遍野林冠', 'text': '{T}，支付1点生命：加{G}或{W}到你的法术力池中。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲遍野林冠：抓一张牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '林间生朝阳，曙光遍天地。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439304&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a420b5e5-288a-40d8-beb4-be09bdab8499', 'multiverseId': 439304}, 'multiverseid': 439304}]", "[{'name': '地底街のトロール', 'text': '高名１（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これが高名でない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。これは高名になる。）\\n{2}{G}：地底街のトロールを再生する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トロール', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439003&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd49ef1e2-a9b7-4687-97b3-7d461c2caf5e', 'multiverseId': 439003}, 'multiverseid': 439003}, {'name': '地底城巨魔', 'text': '铭勇1（当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若它未铭勇，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且它已铭勇。）\\n{2}{G}：重生地底城巨魔。', 'type': '生物～巨魔', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439252&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43bb66f2-3301-42a7-babb-f2f91216e4ae', 'multiverseId': 439252}, 'multiverseid': 439252}]", "[{'name': '堕ちたる者、オブ・ニクシリス', 'text': '上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは「そのプレイヤーは３点のライフを失う。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、堕ちたる者、オブ・ニクシリスの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': '灯を失った彼は、彼の魂を砕いたこの次元の堕落したマナへの復讐を計画している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438916&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f81c86a0-3a58-4b11-a1d0-2c7aefaeaec4', 'multiverseId': 438916}, 'multiverseid': 438916}, {'name': '堕落者欧尼希兹', 'text': '地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以让目标牌手失去3点生命。若你如此作，则在堕落者欧尼希兹上放置三个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '传奇生物～恶魔', 'flavor': '此时空的腐败法术力令他灵魂破碎，失去火花的他密谋向此时空复仇。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439165&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '416cfc12-2473-4f17-84cb-978be112f3f3', 'multiverseId': 439165}, 'multiverseid': 439165}]", "[{'name': '夕暮れ谷のワーム', 'text': 'トランプル', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ワーム', 'flavor': '「前の時は、こいつは萎れ葉を引き裂き、ミストメドウを泥穴に変え、川の水を岸へと打ち上げたんだ。良い点から言えば、我々がずっと鹿肉を食えたことだな。」 ――キンザーの主、ドナル・アロウェイ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438976&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c112a12-97b8-4f0e-bc71-172739d0ef9d', 'multiverseId': 438976}, 'multiverseid': 438976}, {'name': '暮谷亚龙', 'text': '践踏', 'type': '生物～亚龙', 'flavor': '「它上次让枯叶林天翻地覆，将雾牧地化为泥洞，使河流溃堤。从好的方面来想，我们连续几周都可享受野味。」 ～英刹园仕绅唐诺欧洛威', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439225&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d0c2f47-38cb-4c5b-a5e1-0d8fa29667c7', 'multiverseId': 439225}, 'multiverseid': 439225}]", "[{'name': '夜の子', 'text': '絆魂', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼', 'flavor': '陽の光の下ではあまりに陰惨な罪も、夜の闇の下ではより喜ばしい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438900&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07bc2546-6135-4228-a376-4a423ac36cf8', 'multiverseId': 438900}, 'multiverseid': 438900}, {'name': '暗夜之子', 'text': '系命', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼', 'flavor': '光天化日下过于恶心的罪恶，在暗夜笼罩下就显得没那么面目可憎。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439149&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28084575-94ac-4f41-b5d9-4d9bf0afbf28', 'multiverseId': 439149}, 'multiverseid': 439149}]", "[{'name': '夜の星、黒瘴', 'text': '飛行\\n夜の星、黒瘴が死亡したとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ５点のライフを失う。あなたはこれにより失われたライフに等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・スピリット', 'flavor': '夜の星が沈むとて、静かな明けの先触れではない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438910&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '377d90a6-5250-4f11-aa10-ed7d2e0f1ce6', 'multiverseId': 438910}, 'multiverseid': 438910}, {'name': '玄龙黑瘴', 'text': '飞行\\n当玄龙黑瘴死去时，每位对手各失去5点生命。你获得若干生命，其数量等同于以此法失去的生命总和。', 'type': '传奇生物～龙／精怪', 'flavor': '黑瘴降暮，玄阴笼罩，来日无宁。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439159&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7464b328-88c5-4ca4-b71f-22abafa93741', 'multiverseId': 439159}, 'multiverseid': 439159}]", "[{'name': '大いなるバジリスク', 'text': '接死', 'type': 'クリーチャー — バジリスク', 'flavor': '骨と石……飢えたバジリスクにとっては、どちらの味も似たようなもの。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438980&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b724864-e7c0-4a7f-bbf5-8dce576f3c12', 'multiverseId': 438980}, 'multiverseid': 438980}, {'name': '高大蜥怪', 'text': '死触', 'type': '生物～蜥怪', 'flavor': '白骨，石头. . . 对肚饿的蜥怪来说，味道都一样。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439229&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b70ac0a-709a-42dc-a5a6-b58c152771d7', 'multiverseId': 439229}, 'multiverseid': 439229}]", "[{'name': '大修道士、エリシュ・ノーン', 'text': '警戒\\nあなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 法務官', 'flavor': '「ギタクシア派は、異世界について仲間うちで囁いている。それが存在するなら、ファイレクシアの素晴らしさをもたらしてやらねばならぬ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438833&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f600490e-a8dd-46f4-9a2e-ef84c3a8abe5', 'multiverseId': 438833}, 'multiverseid': 438833}, {'name': '大修道士艾蕾侬', 'text': '警戒\\n由你操控的其他生物得+2/+2。\\n由对手操控的生物得-2/-2。', 'type': '传奇生物～魔判官', 'flavor': '「吉塔厦的人私下传着其他世界之流言。如果他们确实存在，我们必得向之展现非瑞克西亚的壮丽。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439082&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75e703f8-6467-4f6d-bc96-4dd4b224ef6d', 'multiverseId': 439082}, 'multiverseid': 439082}]", "[{'name': '大地の精霊', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '大地の精霊は、石のごとき永遠の強さと、山のごとき忍耐を備える。住まう大地と深く結ばれし原初よりの定めゆえ、大地の精霊は万事を長い目で見る。短命なる死すべき定めの生き物たちの衝動的な性急さなど、大地の精霊にとっては軽侮の対象でしかない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438942&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00f7db12-f2d9-4227-8bd8-c66a3d1dfad9', 'multiverseId': 438942}, 'multiverseid': 438942}, {'name': '大地元素', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '大地元素之力量如盘石，坚毅如山脉。他们自古便立基于大地，碌碌众生的莽撞急切在其眼中显得可笑之至。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439191&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12f4d0bb-2804-4949-b692-820f4368aecb', 'multiverseId': 439191}, 'multiverseid': 439191}]", "[{'name': '大型化', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋７/＋７の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。このターン、それは可能ならブロックされなければならない。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '猫にとっては普段通りの浜辺での一日に過ぎなかった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438977&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e77916ef-72d4-4485-be25-32516050b223', 'multiverseId': 438977}, 'multiverseid': 438977}, {'name': '增大', 'text': '直到回合结束，目标生物得+7/+7且获得践踏异能。它本回合若能被阻挡，则须如此作。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '在小绒爪看来，只不过又是海滩上稀松平常的一天。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439226&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b7c02e8-0dec-4651-9e9d-93f86b6c1a12', 'multiverseId': 439226}, 'multiverseid': 439226}]", "[{'name': '天使の協定', 'text': '各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンあなたが４点以上のライフを得ていた場合、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '悪魔が苦悩を嗅ぎ付けるように、天使は善行に引き寄せられる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438822&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85a6080e-719b-47c1-adf0-a562e0269611', 'multiverseId': 438822}, 'multiverseid': 438822}, {'name': '天恩相随', 'text': '在每个结束步骤开始时，若本回合中你获得了4点或更多生命，则派出一个4/4白色，具飞行异能的天使衍生生物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '正如恶魔会受痛苦吸引，天使则会受善举吸引。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439071&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86f71546-49f3-4e86-aec4-93d4b2a0dd86', 'multiverseId': 439071}, 'multiverseid': 439071}]", "[{'name': '奈落の王', 'text': '飛行、トランプル\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、奈落の王以外のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。それができないなら、奈落の王はあなたに７点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': '「我が召喚はそなたの債務の始まりと知れ、プレインズウォーカーよ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438911&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8027dde8-f4e2-4f43-b724-15ed15d24832', 'multiverseId': 438911}, 'multiverseid': 438911}, {'name': '暗渊之王', 'text': '飞行，践踏\\n在你的维持开始时，牺牲一个暗渊之王以外的生物。若你无法如此作，则暗渊之王对你造成7点伤害。', 'type': '生物～恶魔', 'flavor': '「债期从召唤我开始算起，鹏洛客。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439160&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d543f5f-cd32-4489-974f-db8817a60e77', 'multiverseId': 439160}, 'multiverseid': 439160}]", "[{'name': '孔の歩哨', 'text': '防衛\\n{1}{R}, {T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。孔の歩哨はそのプレイヤーに、あなたがコントロールしていて防衛を持つクリーチャーの総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '「ゼンディカーは大脅威に対して自らを要塞化し、空と海と石から成る衛兵を作り出した。」 ――「戦争日誌」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438968&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa4fda6f-771b-4741-97b8-6d15f932d291', 'multiverseId': 438968}, 'multiverseid': 438968}, {'name': '孔穴哨兵', 'text': '守军\\n{1}{R}，{T}：孔穴哨兵对目标牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控且具守军异能的生物数量。', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '「赞迪卡因最大威胁而武装自己，利用天空、海洋与石头作成哨兵。」 ～《战场札记》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439217&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec691766-854d-4eb0-b194-61b14e8386de', 'multiverseId': 439217}, 'multiverseid': 439217}]", "[{'name': '守護像', 'text': '守護像はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{2}：ターン終了時まで、守護像は２/２のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439031&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b24f0ea-be89-4342-b9b8-27bb5eb303f9', 'multiverseId': 439031}, 'multiverseid': 439031}, {'name': '守护者雕像', 'text': '守护者雕像须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{2}：守护者雕像成为2/2魔像神器生物直到回合结束。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439280&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eef10c5d-a0fd-4c97-b0d6-98649266ca18', 'multiverseId': 439280}, 'multiverseid': 439280}]", "[{'name': '宿命の旅人', 'text': '宿命の旅人が死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '彼は目的地に着くまで決して休まないことを誓った。それがどれだけ正しいことなのかはわかっていない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438831&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4072f5a4-bf08-4e03-ac30-1d3f4bc4d8bb', 'multiverseId': 438831}, 'multiverseid': 438831}, {'name': '注亡旅人', 'text': '当注亡旅人死去时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。', 'type': '生物～人类／士兵', 'flavor': '他发誓在抵达旅程终点之前绝不停息。他不知道自己说得那么准。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439080&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62c601e0-82da-492f-9420-b717c9d3269c', 'multiverseId': 439080}, 'multiverseid': 439080}]", "[{'name': '寄せ餌', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーをブロックできるクリーチャーはすべて、それをブロックする。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': 'それは地味なものを目立たせ、不快なものを魅力的にし、危険なものを抗い難くさせる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438990&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6982cdfb-c64a-4a19-9aae-bdc8fabbd92e', 'multiverseId': 438990}, 'multiverseid': 438990}, {'name': '诱饵', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所有能够阻挡所结附之生物的生物皆须阻挡之。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '它让微贱变得出色，可憎化成炫惑，致命转为吸引。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439239&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '519e22d7-88c5-49f5-a261-cef6a0071619', 'multiverseId': 439239}, 'multiverseid': 439239}]", "[{'name': '寛大な拷問者', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げるか３点のライフを支払わないかぎり、あなたはカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': '提供した奉仕の対価として、苦悩の約束は十分すぎるほどである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438909&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '984ae70d-4271-476e-bdfb-2421df6506f2', 'multiverseId': 438909}, 'multiverseid': 438909}, {'name': '放纵拷问魔', 'text': '飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，除非目标对手牺牲一个生物或支付3点生命，否则你抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～恶魔', 'flavor': '对痛苦的承诺足以成为服务的报酬。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439158&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1abfab68-c43b-488c-be25-43124898efa2', 'multiverseId': 439158}, 'multiverseid': 439158}]", "[{'name': '尊い祖霊', 'text': '防衛\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。このターン、それに与えられるダメージを次の１点軽減する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '扉は薄っぺらで鍵も情けないほどの小ささだが、ジョスリの一家は夜など全然怖くない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438827&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb5cd149-7b3f-45ae-a4a0-15284d66e41d', 'multiverseId': 438827}, 'multiverseid': 438827}, {'name': '善心祖灵', 'text': '守军\\n{T}：于本回合中，防止接下来将对目标生物或牌手造成的1点伤害。', 'type': '生物～精怪', 'flavor': '乔苏里一家虽只有薄薄的门板与袖珍的门锁，却从没因入夜而担忧过。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439076&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '582d79df-e0a0-4e90-8207-dcc42c4c60a5', 'multiverseId': 439076}, 'multiverseid': 439076}]", "[{'name': '屍体屋の脅威', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが１個以上置かれるなら、代わりに、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをその２倍の個数置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ファンガス', 'flavor': 'そもそも大群は弱点という概念とは無縁だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439012&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd3d3a12-6609-4114-a92c-3b37b66332f8', 'multiverseId': 439012}, 'multiverseid': 439012}, {'name': '占尸威逼', 'text': '如果将会在某个由你操控的生物上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物，则改为在其上放置该数量两倍的+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～真菌', 'flavor': '软弱非群落的天性。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439261&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43e1c883-6371-4875-9f8b-92a6526c1b58', 'multiverseId': 439261}, 'multiverseid': 439261}]", "[{'name': '希望の天使アヴァシン', 'text': '飛行、警戒、破壊不能\\nあなたがコントロールしている他のパーマネントは破壊不能を持つ。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '黄金の光が獄庫から天空へとらせん状に伸びていった。巨石のごとき銀塊が轟音とともに砕け散り、囚われのアヴァシンはついに解放された。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438826&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c14765fe-e669-44c5-ac9e-397435ea20d9', 'multiverseId': 438826}, 'multiverseid': 438826}, {'name': '希望天使艾维欣', 'text': '飞行，警戒，不灭\\n由你操控的其他永久物具有不灭异能。', 'type': '传奇生物～天使', 'flavor': '金色螺旋自狱窖疾升入空。巨大银体在惊雷爆炸中碎裂，艾维欣终于自牢狱中脱困。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439075&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71ce5d6f-e137-4957-89a1-ea62b83a349b', 'multiverseId': 439075}, 'multiverseid': 439075}]", "[{'name': '帰ってきた刃の翼', 'text': '飛行\\n帰ってきた刃の翼が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からドラゴン・パーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\\n{B}{R}：ターン終了時まで、ドラゴン・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ゾンビ・ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439008&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1229865a-560d-4951-9ec8-5b9bc48fca62', 'multiverseId': 439008}, 'multiverseid': 439008}, {'name': '复生者锋翼', 'text': '飞行\\n当复生者锋翼进战场时，你可以将目标龙永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n{B}{R}：龙生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。', 'type': '传奇生物～灵俑／龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439257&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7549c38f-f4bb-4a69-af0e-a2ff08a9c421', 'multiverseId': 439257}, 'multiverseid': 439257}]", "[{'name': '幻影の天使', 'text': '飛行\\n幻影の天使は、このターンあなたが他の呪文を唱えていたときにのみ唱えられる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使・イリュージョン', 'flavor': '「朦朧とする意識のなか、目が覚めて戦場を見ると、そこで私の夢が敵を蹴散らしている信じがたい光景が繰り広げられていた。」 ――ある兵士からの手紙', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438874&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '374f4dff-31a9-4081-a5a6-d5957af3c954', 'multiverseId': 438874}, 'multiverseid': 438874}, {'name': '虚幻天使', 'text': '飞行\\n只能于你已施放过其他咒语的回合中施放虚幻天使。', 'type': '生物～天使／虚影', 'flavor': '「朦胧之中，我醒转过来，茫然地看着战场周遭的一切；我敢发誓是我的迷梦在对敌人大开杀戒。」 ～士兵的来信', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439123&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f10fe185-244d-4681-8c67-29c04279a63d', 'multiverseId': 439123}, 'multiverseid': 439123}]", "[{'name': '幻影の虎', 'text': '幻影の虎は、＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n幻影の虎にダメージが与えられるなら、そのダメージを軽減する。幻影の虎の上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・スピリット', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438996&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acc2b101-b75c-4954-9d8b-fc9ca10faef7', 'multiverseId': 438996}, 'multiverseid': 438996}, {'name': '幽魅虎', 'text': '幽魅虎进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n如果幽魅虎将受到伤害，则防止该伤害。从幽魅虎上移去一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～猫／精怪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439245&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44e83830-7774-4c44-b56b-1e5f2f60b8a0', 'multiverseId': 439245}, 'multiverseid': 439245}]", "[{'name': '幻影獣', 'text': '飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — イリュージョン', 'flavor': '微かな記憶の混合、うろ覚えの夢の投影。どちらにしても落ち着かない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438884&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41b47a65-c00f-43e9-b881-26bb8aa4a06b', 'multiverseId': 438884}, 'multiverseid': 438884}, {'name': '幻象怪兽', 'text': '飞行', 'type': '生物～虚影', 'flavor': '它是逝去记忆的综合，还是朦胧梦境的投射？两者都无法让人心安。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439133&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c7fa566-94a2-4b5c-b161-75629d020ab8', 'multiverseId': 439133}, 'multiverseid': 439133}]", "[{'name': '弱者狩り', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。その後、その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '龍たちは弱者を軽蔑する。それは同族の間であっても同じである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438982&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c014886f-2116-46fd-8ef5-b65b28bb7555', 'multiverseId': 438982}, 'multiverseid': 438982}, {'name': '猎捕弱者', 'text': '在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。然后该生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '巨龙鄙视弱者，就连同类也不放过。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439231&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cac740e7-9f20-49dc-8862-2ff1d217ec91', 'multiverseId': 439231}, 'multiverseid': 439231}]", "[{'name': '強情なベイロス', 'text': '強情なベイロスが戦場に出たとき、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力によってあなたが強情なベイロスを捨てるなら、これをあなたの墓地に置く代わりに戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438994&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ede6b6c6-38f1-4990-a558-3ab4ffa91276', 'multiverseId': 438994}, 'multiverseid': 438994}, {'name': '顽强巴洛西', 'text': '当顽强巴洛西进战场时，你获得4点生命。\\n如果由对手操控的咒语或异能使得你弃掉顽强巴洛西，则改为将它放进战场，而非置入你的坟墓场。', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439243&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f0e35be-411e-4efb-8d05-751f1cb97b3f', 'multiverseId': 439243}, 'multiverseid': 439243}]", "[{'name': '強迫', 'text': '対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中からクリーチャーでも土地でもないカード１枚を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「心配しなくていいわ。お前の秘密を全部奪うつもりはない。一番大事なやつだけよ。」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438903&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff516e55-ef1c-4fef-b13f-c0819f6f8c8c', 'multiverseId': 438903}, 'multiverseid': 438903}, {'name': '逼从', 'text': '目标对手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张非生物且非地的牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「放心。我不会把你所有的秘密都夺走。我只拿最珍贵的那个。」 ～莉莲娜维斯', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439152&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdb12650-3bb0-46ab-8714-df23f017939f', 'multiverseId': 439152}, 'multiverseid': 439152}]", "[{'name': '忌まわしい光景', 'text': 'アーティファクトでないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードをそのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい枚数自分の墓地に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「殺害現場に野次馬が集まる様子を見ろよ。それでもまだ俺達全員の頭がイカレていないって言えるのか？」 ――ジョーリ組の経営者、ジョーリ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438907&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dff20e9-e3d9-4789-aac6-65b48119e070', 'multiverseId': 438907}, 'multiverseid': 438907}, {'name': '恐怖景象', 'text': '消灭目标非神器的生物。其操控者将其牌库顶若干牌置入其坟墓场，其数量等同于该生物的力量。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「瞧瞧人们争睹谋杀现场的景象。然后再来告诉我，我们不是只有一点点疯狂而已。」 ～裘里剧团业主裘里', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439156&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8c124b8-1da7-4072-aa33-c5c4d4a1fe52', 'multiverseId': 439156}, 'multiverseid': 439156}]", "[{'name': '忌呪の発動', 'text': '忌呪の発動を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたはあなたの手札からドラゴン・カード１枚を公開してもよい。\\nプレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。忌呪の発動を唱えた時点であなたがドラゴン・カードを公開したかドラゴンをコントロールしていたなら、あなたは４点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438906&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0939d4d5-24f7-42d7-af7b-ed61003443c4', 'multiverseId': 438906}, 'multiverseid': 438906}, {'name': '秽言祝愿', 'text': '你可以从你手上展示一张龙牌，以作为施放秽言祝愿的额外费用。\\n目标牌手牺牲一个生物。如果于你施放秽言祝愿时，你展示了龙牌或操控龙，则你获得4点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439155&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3994729f-b099-4232-af91-bae948aa5713', 'multiverseId': 439155}, 'multiverseid': 439155}]", "[{'name': '忘却石', 'text': '{4}, {T}：パーマネント１つを対象とし、それの上に運命カウンターを１個置く。\\n{5}, {T}, 忘却石を生け贄に捧げる：運命カウンターが置かれていない、土地でない各パーマネントをそれぞれ破壊する。その後、パーマネントすべての上から運命カウンターをすべて取り除く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439038&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8ca6a60-06c2-4153-9450-519751ab67dd', 'multiverseId': 439038}, 'multiverseid': 439038}, {'name': '遗忘石', 'text': '{4}，{T}：在目标永久物上放置一个命运指示物。\\n{5}，{T}，牺牲遗忘石：消灭所有其上没有命运指示物的非地永久物，然后移去所有永久物上的所有命运指示物。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439287&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a188126c-cdfe-4dfe-9af1-ee1caeb137e3', 'multiverseId': 439287}, 'multiverseid': 439287}]", "[{'name': '快楽殺人の暗殺者', 'text': '接死\\n解鎖（あなたはこのクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出してもよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者', 'flavor': '虐殺少女の懸賞金が上がるにつれて、模倣犯の数も増えていった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438926&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a593004-cf2a-4460-be89-0eec26ec516a', 'multiverseId': 438926}, 'multiverseid': 438926}, {'name': '虐杀手', 'text': '死触\\n脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能进行阻挡。）', 'type': '生物～人类／杀手', 'flavor': '随着杀戮女郎的悬赏奖金变多，模仿她的人也变多了。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439175&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c830ae0-00cd-4a96-8341-8dae8c5787f2', 'multiverseId': 439175}, 'multiverseid': 439175}]", "[{'name': '思考囲い', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中から土地でないカード１枚を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーはそのカードを捨てる。あなたは２点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「すべての夢は生命あふれた収穫だ。だけど私は、古ぼけて意味ありげで、何かに取り付かれたような夢が好きだね。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438925&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c73bb319-9043-4e39-bb18-17a07c61437c', 'multiverseId': 438925}, 'multiverseid': 438925}, {'name': '攫取思绪', 'text': '目标牌手展示其手牌。你选择其中一张非地牌。该牌手弃掉该牌。你失去2点生命。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「任何眠梦都是醇厚的收获。不过，我还是偏好被时间消蚀、折磨着受苦心灵又充满含义的梦想。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439174&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '368c7823-2807-4457-b563-09615e0cdd4f', 'multiverseId': 439174}, 'multiverseid': 439174}]", "[{'name': '思考掃き', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚自分の墓地に置く。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「脳幹に臓器剤を注入すれば、痙攣性のうめき声など気にならなくなる。すぐに音楽のように聞こえるだろう。」 ――縫い師、ゲラルフ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438891&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b29a0543-91ec-4db6-a1a3-9649f04b7a06', 'multiverseId': 438891}, 'multiverseid': 438891}, {'name': '洗清思想', 'text': '目标牌手将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「将生命精华注入脑干时，别让那些断续呻吟分了心。它很快就会化作耳中美妙乐章。」 ～拼接师基拉夫', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439140&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1af0fb91-c080-4ea3-a6d5-89ef5ada2b72', 'multiverseId': 439140}, 'multiverseid': 439140}]", "[{'name': '恐血鬼', 'text': '恐血鬼ではブロックできない。\\nいずれかの対戦相手のライフが10点以下であるかぎり、恐血鬼は速攻を持つ。\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはあなたの墓地から恐血鬼を戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・スピリット', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438897&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b0e440e-a8c4-4398-8dbe-d4041c599701', 'multiverseId': 438897}, 'multiverseid': 438897}, {'name': '可怖血妖', 'text': '可怖血妖不能进行阻挡。\\n只要任一对手的总生命为10或更少，可怖血妖便具有敏捷异能。\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以将可怖血妖从你的坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼／精怪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439146&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a3e0e03-8dba-4c93-8dc7-72e0dd4e4f3d', 'multiverseId': 439146}, 'multiverseid': 439146}]", "[{'name': '悪性の強打', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに接死を得る。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438928&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b086164f-3e1b-4068-81f9-19cc522bfec0', 'multiverseId': 438928}, 'multiverseid': 438928}, {'name': '猛毒劈砍', 'text': '直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得死触异能。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439177&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7c70d6b-7286-47f2-8714-9260951e10b6', 'multiverseId': 439177}, 'multiverseid': 439177}]", "[{'name': '意外な授かり物', 'text': '各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後これによりプレイヤー１人が捨てたカードの枚数のうち最も大きいものに等しい枚数のカードを引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「富」とは相対的な言葉だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438892&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54a9d061-dc97-4e2d-b132-5ddc1f51eafd', 'multiverseId': 438892}, 'multiverseid': 438892}, {'name': '横财', 'text': '每位牌手弃掉手牌，然后各抓若干牌，其数量等同于牌手中以此法弃牌的最多数量。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「富有」只是相对的。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439141&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd5fb151-9de3-4ef6-b0a1-420d06c78a74', 'multiverseId': 439141}, 'multiverseid': 439141}]", "[{'name': '慈悲の天使', 'text': '飛行\\n慈悲の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '流す涙は不死の滴。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438821&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dca274bd-6009-41aa-82b4-060c865e511d', 'multiverseId': 438821}, 'multiverseid': 438821}, {'name': '慈悲天使', 'text': '飞行\\n当慈悲天使进战场时，你获得3点生命。', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': '每颗泪珠都是一滴不朽。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439070&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23e18724-0ec8-494d-a77d-e307edd235ec', 'multiverseId': 439070}, 'multiverseid': 439070}]", "[{'name': '憤怒の魔除け', 'text': '以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\\n• パーマネント１つか待機状態のカード１枚を対象とし、それの上から時間カウンターを２個取り除く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438945&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56de5696-c398-4626-b14d-8deddd80da2b', 'multiverseId': 438945}, 'multiverseid': 438945}, {'name': '怒火护符', 'text': '选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+1且获得践踏异能。\\n•从目标永久物或已延缓的牌上移去两个计时指示物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439194&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1558f15-11cf-4285-89f4-7bddcd0f9c77', 'multiverseId': 439194}, 'multiverseid': 439194}]", "[{'name': '戦装飾のシャーマン', 'text': 'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン', 'flavor': 'シャーマンが飾りを鳴らすのは、戦いの怒りを呼び起こすためではなく、エルドラージから逃げる者の悲鳴をかき消すためだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438932&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '091b44ea-7283-42a4-aa9b-2e88c662fedd', 'multiverseId': 438932}, 'multiverseid': 438932}, {'name': '战响祭师', 'text': '在你回合的战斗开始时，你可以使目标生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～鬼怪／祭师', 'flavor': '祭师发出的吵杂声音并不是用来激起战意，而是要盖掉那些被奥札奇吓跑者的尖叫。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439181&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0982ad9-c938-45d6-9bd7-75b053f7582b', 'multiverseId': 439181}, 'multiverseid': 439181}]", "[{'name': '戸惑い', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－０の修整を受ける。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「テフェリーが指を鳴らせば、ヴィーアシーノが鶏みたいに鳴きだしたものよ。そうね、馬鹿馬鹿しいけど、重苦しい雰囲気を吹き飛ばすのにそれが間違いなく必要だったのよ。」 ――練達の工匠、ジョイラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438858&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30f31091-83b5-4541-af16-2f4de3a4d781', 'multiverseId': 438858}, 'multiverseid': 438858}, {'name': '茫然不已', 'text': '目标生物得-3/-0直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「泰菲力一弹指，那凡尔西诺便像只鸡似地开始喀喀叫。这确实是挺蠢的，但也成功地化解了令人窒息的紧张气氛。」 ～神器大师尤依拉', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439107&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1ea1a94-266a-4a8f-baa2-741c5404bc0e', 'multiverseId': 439107}, 'multiverseid': 439107}]", "[{'name': '捕食の呪い', 'text': 'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nクリーチャーが１体エンチャントされているプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い', 'flavor': '「狩人は獲物の恐怖を糧とする。」 ――野生語りのガラク', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438974&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17cf8f73-12e9-48b3-b502-055841f98a74', 'multiverseId': 438974}, 'multiverseid': 438974}, {'name': '猎捕诅咒', 'text': '结附于牌手\\n每当一个生物攻击所结附的牌手时，在该生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '结界～灵气／诅咒', 'flavor': '「猎人以猎物的恐惧为食。」 ～召兽使贾路', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439223&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f72c6760-c9fb-4758-921a-c1d0be92f306', 'multiverseId': 439223}, 'multiverseid': 439223}]", "[{'name': '撤廃', 'text': '点数で見たマナ・コストがＸであり土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「お前の行いは無かったことにはできぬ。しかし、お前をそうすることは可能だ。」 ――アゾリウスの将軍、アゴスト', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438885&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcea118f-2c2e-4586-b158-85546826fa47', 'multiverseId': 438885}, 'multiverseid': 438885}, {'name': '撤回', 'text': '将目标总法术力费用为X的非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「你的约定不能毁弃。但你，倒是可以。」 ～俄佐立将军阿果托', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439134&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cb4e9d9-819e-47d4-827a-c57341a837f6', 'multiverseId': 439134}, 'multiverseid': 439134}]", "[{'name': '放蕩紅蓮術士', 'text': '{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。放蕩紅蓮術士はそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「どこ見てるって？灰だよ、この死人が。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438957&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfd2d502-98a4-4dfb-a537-5033c027d028', 'multiverseId': 438957}, 'multiverseid': 438957}, {'name': '放荡烈焰术士', 'text': '{T}：放荡烈焰术士对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '「我在看什么？灰烬，死人。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439206&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17a0e9d6-c306-47ec-bed1-10f38fc80c07', 'multiverseId': 439206}, 'multiverseid': 439206}]", "[{'name': '昇る星、珠眼', 'text': '飛行\\n昇る星、珠眼が死亡したとき、望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。あなたはそれらの上に５個の＋１/＋１カウンターを望むように割り振って置いてもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・スピリット', 'flavor': '昇る星の光が明日の勇者に力を与える。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438987&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f629d08-93ec-40c3-9bbe-409421c00caf', 'multiverseId': 438987}, 'multiverseid': 438987}, {'name': '碧龙珠眼', 'text': '飞行\\n当碧龙珠眼死去时，你可以将五个+1/+1指示物以任意方法分配至任意数量的目标生物上。', 'type': '传奇生物～龙／精怪', 'flavor': '珠眼腾扬，碧梧庇种，栋梁成才。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439236&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19d4e355-32d7-4e9e-bcfb-c004415214fc', 'multiverseId': 439236}, 'multiverseid': 439236}]", "[{'name': '明けの星、陽星', 'text': '飛行\\n明けの星、陽星が死亡したとき、プレイヤー１人と、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているパーマネント最大５つを対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の次のアンタップ・ステップを飛ばす。それらのパーマネントをタップする。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・スピリット', 'flavor': '明けの星の抱擁はあらゆるものを闇から解放する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438854&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41e9e45f-40f1-4d30-bb08-a987ac2b72eb', 'multiverseId': 438854}, 'multiverseid': 438854}, {'name': '辉龙阳星', 'text': '飞行\\n当辉龙阳星死去时，目标牌手略过其下一个重置步骤。横置至多五个目标由该牌手操控的永久物。', 'type': '传奇生物～龙／精怪', 'flavor': '阳星拂晨，辉光逐暗，普照众生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439103&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ca96295-4d37-4e2a-9572-ec590c64cdd9', 'multiverseId': 439103}, 'multiverseid': 439103}]", "[{'name': '明日への探索', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探して戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n待機２―{G}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{G}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを２個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439000&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6df4724-5443-496b-90f3-4923ff7c4ea5', 'multiverseId': 439000}, 'multiverseid': 439000}, {'name': '为来日探寻', 'text': '从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n延缓2～{G}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{G}并将它放逐，且上面有两个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439249&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8be9d022-8696-4f8f-86bb-bb255fdabbc2', 'multiverseId': 439249}, 'multiverseid': 439249}]", "[{'name': '星のコンパス', 'text': '星のコンパスはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、あなたがコントロールしている基本土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'それは北を指してはいない。故郷を指しているんだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439044&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20c0273d-e276-4a39-9583-c267d44a32b5', 'multiverseId': 439044}, 'multiverseid': 439044}, {'name': '繁星罗盘', 'text': '繁星罗盘须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加一点法术力到你的法术力池中，其颜色为由你操控的基本地能产生之任一颜色。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '它并不指引北方。它指引着家乡。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439293&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'defb6c7f-e1f2-49ce-9ea3-2fde09b4aa19', 'multiverseId': 439293}, 'multiverseid': 439293}]", "[{'name': '暴走の先導', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたは「その中から望む枚数のクリーチャー・カードを公開し、それらの公開したカードをあなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438988&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68ae9e1b-e4cb-479f-bde0-09b8f3e6fa03', 'multiverseId': 438988}, 'multiverseid': 438988}, {'name': '引领狂奔', 'text': '检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以展示其中任意数量的生物牌，并将所展示的牌置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439237&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e1b4774-64c8-43e6-9501-05838ea1d182', 'multiverseId': 439237}, 'multiverseid': 439237}]", "[{'name': '曲がりくねりのロシーン', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}{C}{C}{C}を加える。このマナは{X}を含むコストにのみ使用できる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 巨人・シャーマン', 'flavor': '毎夜、ロシーンは過ぎ去った陽の照る世界のことをつぶやいていたが、彼女の言葉は狂人の振る舞いとして片付けられていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439021&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40f48f9b-231b-4e2d-88b4-8139057bd481', 'multiverseId': 439021}, 'multiverseid': 439021}, {'name': '漫步人罗欣', 'text': '{T}：加{C}{C}{C}{C}到你的法术力池中。此法术力只能用来支付包含{X}的费用。', 'type': '传奇生物～巨人／祭师', 'flavor': '罗欣每晚都絮叨着某个已逝的阳光充盈世界，而每字每句都只给当成疯女人的胡言乱语。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439270&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e45ee85f-12b0-47cd-a29b-fdfd8cae8f55', 'multiverseId': 439270}, 'multiverseid': 439270}]", "[{'name': '月の大魔術師', 'text': '基本でない土地は山である。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '血染めの月の潮流は大地を捻じ曲げて縛りつけ、石柱や泥を燃え上がる宝珠へと引きずり込む。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438953&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9ff0a43-7c92-4ee9-aa32-964c1d52ddd9', 'multiverseId': 438953}, 'multiverseid': 438953}, {'name': '红月贤者', 'text': '所有非基本地都是山脉。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '腥红之月的潮汐力量扭扯大地，将一切巨石与土壤卷向这轮火红明月。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439202&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff1d1c40-bbe2-41a3-994c-a3aa35ce1946', 'multiverseId': 439202}, 'multiverseid': 439202}]", "[{'name': '有毒ドラゴン', 'text': '飛行\\n有毒ドラゴンが死亡したとき、点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': 'シルムガルの落とし子である龍たちは、獲物を口の中に入れる前にその消化を開始する。彼らが吐き出す腐食性の息にその作業を任せているのである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438915&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d30eb7e-0717-411b-94ac-9b7955cca151', 'multiverseId': 438915}, 'multiverseid': 438915}, {'name': '毒息巨龙', 'text': '飞行\\n当毒息巨龙死去时，你可以消灭目标总法术力费用等于或小于3的生物。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': '席穆嘉一脉龙群的腐蚀喷息让他们在吞下猎物之前就能将其消化大半。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439164&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cc2e623-5c7e-43b8-a6fb-984d17023b04', 'multiverseId': 439164}, 'multiverseid': 439164}]", "[{'name': '木彫りの女人像', 'text': '防衛\\n木彫りの女人像が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': 'いわゆる「古木」というものは、森が切り払われてしまったラヴニカでは珍しい。そんな木から掘り出された像は、古代の精霊の住む最後の家だという話だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438971&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec2ecf6b-7f19-4edf-a4b7-bb301925d98d', 'multiverseId': 438971}, 'multiverseid': 438971}, {'name': '女雕像柱', 'text': '守军\\n当女雕像柱进战场时，抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～精怪', 'flavor': '由于过度采伐之故，所谓的「老树」在拉尼卡已经十分罕见。据说以老树雕成的像，是用来让仅存的古老自然精怪有歇息之处。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439220&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '175b9fea-875f-41ed-b981-5d6fbe54d6da', 'multiverseId': 439220}, 'multiverseid': 439220}]", "[{'name': '材料集め', 'text': 'カードを３枚引く。その後、あなたの手札からカード１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「イモリの唾の用途はきっと見つかると思ってたんだ！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438856&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7d69171-9b47-4f8f-a54f-b2987d750eb2', 'multiverseId': 438856}, 'multiverseid': 438856}, {'name': '积聚配方', 'text': '抓三张牌，然后将一张牌从你手上置于你的牌库底。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「我就知道那些蝾螈唾液会有用处！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439105&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e8813cd-cdef-4f09-8f96-ef637dddff33', 'multiverseId': 439105}, 'multiverseid': 439105}]", "[{'name': '核の占い師、ジン＝ギタクシアス', 'text': '瞬速\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、カードを７枚引く。\\n各対戦相手の手札の上限はそれぞれ７枚少なくなる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 法務官', 'flavor': '「これは目的ではなく過程だ。完全なファイレクシアを創るための過程なのだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438877&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11d7a5fe-ef42-48c8-9174-0aff8a2a08ae', 'multiverseId': 438877}, 'multiverseid': 438877}, {'name': '核心卜算师金吉塔厦', 'text': '闪现\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，抓七张牌。\\n每位对手的手牌上限减少七张。', 'type': '传奇生物～魔判官', 'flavor': '「这不是目标，而是过程～用来创造完美的非瑞克西亚。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439126&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b28c8b9d-ad9e-4575-94c6-d47d0b60c680', 'multiverseId': 439126}, 'multiverseid': 439126}]", "[{'name': '根の壁', 'text': '防衛\\n根の壁の上に－０/－１カウンターを１個置く：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。この能力は、毎ターン１回のみ起動できる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 植物・壁', 'flavor': '「マナは植物の根のように成長し変化します。植物と同じで、世話をする必要があるのです。」 ――ニッサ・レヴェイン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439005&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8a16e58-9d93-4130-9dd0-f8b4f68f2b85', 'multiverseId': 439005}, 'multiverseid': 439005}, {'name': '根墙', 'text': '守军\\n在根墙上放置一个-0/-1指示物：加{G}到你的法术力池中。此异能每回合只能起动一次。', 'type': '生物～植物／墙', 'flavor': '「法术力如同植物根系一般，会不断成长、变化。它也如同植物一般，需要不断呵护。」 ～妮莎瑞文', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439254&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7ae15b7-f3d1-49ad-9477-df8a793e2377', 'multiverseId': 439254}, 'multiverseid': 439254}]", "[{'name': '森林地の先達', 'text': '森林地の先達が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト', 'flavor': '「火はおこせるか？鹿を追えるか？殺人樹の見分けがつくか？なら俺がいなけりゃあんたはケッシグの森で生き延びられないぜ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439002&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87742ae7-16c9-456b-a4dc-8d94efcdbeb0', 'multiverseId': 439002}, 'multiverseid': 439002}, {'name': '林地向导', 'text': '当林地向导进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～人类／斥候', 'flavor': '「你会起火吗？追踪鹿？辨识食人树？都不会的话，你在凯锡革得靠我才能活下去。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439251&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d90d39f-256c-49e7-9b20-46c2cca35e6d', 'multiverseId': 439251}, 'multiverseid': 439251}]", "[{'name': '槌手', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n槌手が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに速攻を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438947&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b708fe9f-d969-4f5d-ab5c-a887c988054a', 'multiverseId': 438947}, 'multiverseid': 438947}, {'name': '手力如锤', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当手力如锤进战场时，目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有敏捷异能。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439196&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28cfa60f-cb10-42e6-86dc-9ce4adb2eb22', 'multiverseId': 439196}, 'multiverseid': 439196}]", "[{'name': '欄干のスパイ', 'text': '飛行\\n欄干のスパイが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、土地・カードが公開されるまで自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開し、その後それらのカードを自分の墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438895&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcfe72f5-4521-4cdc-8f06-3f28511a2110', 'multiverseId': 438895}, 'multiverseid': 438895}, {'name': '栏外探子', 'text': '飞行\\n当栏外探子进战场时，目标牌手从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张地牌为止，然后将这些牌置入其坟墓场。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼／浪客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439144&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cce1ff0-83d7-4967-8aa0-80e0ed533724', 'multiverseId': 439144}, 'multiverseid': 439144}]", "[{'name': '歴戦の歩兵', 'text': '{T}：攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '「剣士らよ、俺に続け！我らの射手や魔道士を守るために、相手の戦列と交戦に入る。この任務に失敗は許されん！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438839&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b385854-e649-4cfa-a75c-e1ad6a37cb0d', 'multiverseId': 438839}, 'multiverseid': 438839}, {'name': '资深步兵', 'text': '{T}：目标进行攻击的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～人类／士兵', 'flavor': '「剑兵队，跟我上！我们必须顶上前去，掩护弓手和法师。不容有失！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439088&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c5c46b7-ad77-4e06-a774-92869c2abc60', 'multiverseId': 439088}, 'multiverseid': 439088}]", "[{'name': '死の歓楽者', 'text': '解鎖（あなたはこのクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出してもよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': 'パーティーの盛り下げ役。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438901&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96c58844-0b7d-4720-b642-12b154224fb7', 'multiverseId': 438901}, 'multiverseid': 438901}, {'name': '死亡狂欢人', 'text': '脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能进行阻挡。）', 'type': '生物～灵俑', 'flavor': '他的活力死射。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439150&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9651e7ef-5c95-4cf9-b123-cd2ad9c5871e', 'multiverseId': 439150}, 'multiverseid': 439150}]", "[{'name': '水蓮のコブラ', 'text': '上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはあなたのマナ・プールに好きな色１色のマナ１点を加えてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蛇', 'flavor': 'その鱗には何千もの蓮の花の香液が含まれている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438989&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36d2e18d-1491-4a3b-9a6b-b0c55a7a7f60', 'multiverseId': 438989}, 'multiverseid': 438989}, {'name': '莲花眼镜蛇', 'text': '地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '生物～蛇', 'flavor': '其鳞片包藏千百莲花的菁华。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439238&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '361ac524-4909-48b8-a669-e29ed22442a7', 'multiverseId': 439238}, 'multiverseid': 439238}]", "[{'name': '永遠の口渇', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、絆魂と「対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。」を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438904&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c4b7b61-92c1-4fa0-9891-a97a55eb4e3b', 'multiverseId': 438904}, 'multiverseid': 438904}, {'name': '永恒饥渴', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物具有系命异能与「每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。」', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439153&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ed49751-0d62-4012-b5c1-b442be554e49', 'multiverseId': 439153}, 'multiverseid': 439153}]", "[{'name': '河水環の曲芸士', 'text': '飛行\\n果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン・モンク', 'flavor': '河水環要塞の熟練者たちは雨の中を走り抜けても濡れることが無い。達人は雨粒を踏み石として使うことができるのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438886&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e74039e-6e1c-48b4-87fa-778fae258d28', 'multiverseId': 438886}, 'multiverseid': 438886}, {'name': '河轮舞空僧', 'text': '飞行\\n灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）', 'type': '生物～巨灵／修行僧', 'flavor': '河轮城塞武技纯熟者能穿雨而过不湿分毫；炉火纯青者则能踏雨而上直入云霄。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439135&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b4826cad-b9a9-4d33-a15e-777417044e13', 'multiverseId': 439135}, 'multiverseid': 439135}]", "[{'name': '泡立つ大釜', 'text': '{1}, {T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\n{1}, {T}, 「ただれたイモリ」という名前のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：各対戦相手はそれぞれ４点のライフを失う。あなたはこれにより失われたライフに等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439028&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b273a07-2e92-494f-85ae-3557b3eb29c7', 'multiverseId': 439028}, 'multiverseid': 439028}, {'name': '冒泡鼎镬', 'text': '{1}，{T}，牺牲一个生物：你获得4点生命。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲一个名称为腐臭水蝾的生物：每位对手各失去4点生命。你获得若干生命，其数量等同于以此法失去的生命总和。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439277&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64a62b1a-6ae0-4478-9f43-c3763825f736', 'multiverseId': 439277}, 'multiverseid': 439277}]", "[{'name': '泥沼煎じの魔女', 'text': '{2}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから「ただれたイモリ」か「泡立つ大釜」という名前のカード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「正しい材料を見つけるのが一番大変なのさ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438898&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61be8fcf-af00-491a-ac81-78fb186e771e', 'multiverseId': 438898}, 'multiverseid': 438898}, {'name': '沼炼巫师', 'text': '{2}，{T}：从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为腐臭水蝾或冒泡鼎镬的牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '「最困难的部份是找出正确的原料。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439147&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97d22752-6be8-40ad-bcd2-20da88e029b4', 'multiverseId': 439147}, 'multiverseid': 439147}]", "[{'name': '消えない賛歌', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を捨てる。あなたがこの呪文をあなたのメイン・フェイズ中に唱えたなら、代わりにそのプレイヤーはカード４枚を捨てる。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '賛歌の旋律はトーラックの頃から変わらないが、その詩は聞いた者たちに恐怖を呼び起こすように変えられている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438908&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87d97710-95f8-48f1-91b8-95d7cde73a70', 'multiverseId': 438908}, 'multiverseid': 438908}, {'name': '乱心赞歌', 'text': '目标牌手弃两张牌。如果你在你的行动阶段施放此咒语，则改为该牌手弃四张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '这赞歌的旋律自妥拉克的时代以来都没变过，但词句则经历多次修改，藉以挑起听闻者最深的恐惧。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439157&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c21099e2-728e-45c6-9557-cd24911afd64', 'multiverseId': 439157}, 'multiverseid': 439157}]", "[{'name': '涙の川', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}を加える。あなたがこのターンに土地をプレイしたなら、代わりにあなたのマナ・プールに{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '西の民は嘆き、その涙はうねる川となって世界の頬へとそそいだ。 ――独り唄のグレム、「コロンの起源」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439061&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a2034fe-439d-4648-a196-f5d8d4598280', 'multiverseId': 439061}, 'multiverseid': 439061}, {'name': '清泪长河', 'text': '{T}：加{U}到你的法术力池中。如果本回合中你使用过地，则改为加{B}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '「西方居民落下眼泪，泪水在世界的脸颊上汇流成河。」 ～独行诗人葛兰，《寇隆溯源》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439310&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43fa44a7-2761-460b-b550-0269809b3211', 'multiverseId': 439310}, 'multiverseid': 439310}]", "[{'name': '深淵の迫害者', 'text': '飛行、トランプル\\nあなたはこのゲームに勝利できず、対戦相手はこのゲームに敗北できない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': '彼の奴隷は、自由を求めるよりも死を望んでいる。彼はそのどちらも許さない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438893&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8dedf3f6-cfe8-4bd8-ad7a-f324f67f33a7', 'multiverseId': 438893}, 'multiverseid': 438893}, {'name': '深渊虐魔', 'text': '飞行，践踏\\n你这盘游戏不会赢，对手也不会输。', 'type': '生物～恶魔', 'flavor': '比起希冀自由，他的奴隶还更渴求一死。但他两者都不许。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439142&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45046677-3e8f-4c6c-946b-ff574c10a3fa', 'multiverseId': 439142}, 'multiverseid': 439142}]", "[{'name': '清純のタリスマン', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。あなたは１点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '「道具や職人は失われます。だけど、創造の行いは犯されません。」 ――エルズペス・ティレル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439040&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2ce206a-29e6-457f-a7fa-06c6c991b7c9', 'multiverseId': 439040}, 'multiverseid': 439040}, {'name': '纯净饰符', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。你获得1点生命。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '「工具与工匠可能会毁灭，但创作此行为将生生不息。」 ～艾紫培提瑞', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439289&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '702f3283-8fe8-4885-9661-96dc0fc18178', 'multiverseId': 439289}, 'multiverseid': 439289}]", "[{'name': '溜め込むドラゴン', 'text': '飛行\\n溜め込むドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーからアーティファクト・カード１枚を探し、それを追放し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n溜め込むドラゴンが死亡したとき、あなたはその追放されたカードをオーナーの手札に加えてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438949&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cceefdd-9f4f-4978-8288-0478212191ac', 'multiverseId': 438949}, 'multiverseid': 438949}, {'name': '贮宝巨龙', 'text': '飞行\\n当贮宝巨龙进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张神器牌，将它放逐，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n当贮宝巨龙死去时，你可以将所放逐的牌置于其拥有者手上。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439198&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e265290-0eb5-4c63-862e-62148523851b', 'multiverseId': 439198}, 'multiverseid': 439198}]", "[{'name': '潮の星、京河', 'text': '飛行\\n潮の星、京河が死亡したとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それのコントロールを得る。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・スピリット', 'flavor': '潮の星の誘引は永遠に君臨する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438878&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '967f343e-9ae2-41f7-a92d-d9c624bd935f', 'multiverseId': 438878}, 'multiverseid': 438878}, {'name': '苍龙京河', 'text': '飞行\\n当苍龙京河死去时，获得目标生物的操控权。', 'type': '传奇生物～龙／精怪', 'flavor': '京河引潮，苍海翻腾，牵引万物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439127&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69fd9973-9bf5-4d26-994a-71bc85025137', 'multiverseId': 439127}, 'multiverseid': 439127}]", "[{'name': '潰瘍化', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－３の修整を受ける。あなたは３点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「単に致命的であるのなら、それだけで充分事足りるわ。それが与える苦しみを最大化する事こそが、美学なの。」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438927&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa6925ab-ec41-4d82-9e65-25d08deaceb7', 'multiverseId': 438927}, 'multiverseid': 438927}, {'name': '溃烂', 'text': '目标生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。你失去3点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「如果目的仅在于致命，这就够了。但这门技艺是要使它造成的痛苦达到最大。」 ～莉莲娜维斯', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439176&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bf8cb74-8d09-4e13-a7b9-69bca382bfaa', 'multiverseId': 439176}, 'multiverseid': 439176}]", "[{'name': '濃霧の層', 'text': '防衛、飛行\\n濃霧の層に与えられる戦闘ダメージとこれが与える戦闘ダメージをすべて軽減する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 壁', 'flavor': '「海と空とが溶け合えば理想的な防壁となる。」 ――空召喚士ターランド', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438871&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e5f0f08-fdfd-400d-a760-56d6d19d583c', 'multiverseId': 438871}, 'multiverseid': 438871}, {'name': '浓雾堤防', 'text': '守军，飞行\\n防止浓雾堤防将受到与造成的所有战斗伤害。', 'type': '生物～墙', 'flavor': '「海天交融，为我们提供了完美庇护。」 ～空召师陶岚', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439120&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5edb708-bf8f-4deb-8e85-7d8f770b3cd1', 'multiverseId': 439120}, 'multiverseid': 439120}]", "[{'name': '火のるつぼ', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているドラゴン・クリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '「龍とは、力とそれを用いる意思との完璧な融合だ。」 ――サルカン・ヴォル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438937&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f25ed95c-0dc8-4c0b-b3a5-a407143ad7e1', 'multiverseId': 438937}, 'multiverseid': 438937}, {'name': '火焰锤炼', 'text': '由你操控的龙生物得+3/+3。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '「巨龙是力量与愿运用它之意志的完美结合。」 ～萨坎沃', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439186&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92512a7f-ffa9-4b64-8c37-efc6eead8fd0', 'multiverseId': 439186}, 'multiverseid': 439186}]", "[{'name': '火の玉', 'text': '望む数のクリーチャーやプレイヤーを対象とする。火の玉は、それらにＸ点を均等に割って端数を切り捨てた点数のダメージを与える。\\n火の玉を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}多くなる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'その呪文は、古えの死に満ちたドラゴンのように群集に降り注いだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438943&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01532753-732d-40d0-ac63-4830abe3ab82', 'multiverseId': 438943}, 'multiverseid': 438943}, {'name': '火球', 'text': '火球对任意数量的目标生物和／或牌手造成伤害，其数量为「将X平均分配给所有目标，小数点后舍去」。\\n火球在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{1}来施放。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '一记古老咒语从天而降，有如远古恶龙现身。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439192&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82e4f3e9-e79b-4577-9b30-65eda1f2ae25', 'multiverseId': 439192}, 'multiverseid': 439192}]", "[{'name': '火柱', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。火柱はそれに２点のダメージを与える。このターン、これによりダメージを与えられたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「価値ある者が祝福された眠りのうちに永遠を過ごさんことを。邪な者が忘却という平和を見出さんことを。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438956&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3aebdc4-f4cf-4442-8bd8-81aea8a85a01', 'multiverseId': 438956}, 'multiverseid': 438956}, {'name': '火焰柱', 'text': '火焰柱对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到伤害的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「愿善人在受福安眠中得享永恒。愿恶人在湮没遗忘中获得安息。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439205&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6351cf4d-f57f-4533-b4e5-f58960d39a12', 'multiverseId': 439205}, 'multiverseid': 439205}]", "[{'name': '炎まといの天使', 'text': '飛行、先制攻撃\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、炎まといの天使があなたの墓地か戦場にある場合、あなたは１点のライフを得てもよい。\\n{6}{R}{R}{W}{W}：あなたの墓地から炎まといの天使を戦場に戻す。この能力は、あなたのアップキープの間にのみ起動できる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439014&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa52673f-1d80-4f78-8ccd-86b5b311ee15', 'multiverseId': 439014}, 'multiverseid': 439014}, {'name': '炎鬃天使', 'text': '飞行，先攻\\n在你的维持开始时，若炎鬃天使在你的坟墓场中或战场上，则你可以获得1点生命。\\n{6}{R}{R}{W}{W}：将炎鬃天使从你的坟墓场移回战场。只能于你的维持中起动此异能。', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439263&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20ba352f-694f-463e-9602-d0506b28eed4', 'multiverseId': 439263}, 'multiverseid': 439263}]", "[{'name': '無傷の発現', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。色１色を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、それはプロテクション（その選ばれた色）を得る。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438834&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74b33866-778f-49d7-a735-c56b0fb9da5e', 'multiverseId': 438834}, 'multiverseid': 438834}, {'name': '挣脱困境', 'text': '选择一种颜色。目标由你操控的生物获得反该色保护异能直到回合结束。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439083&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d6198ad-5379-4d38-a132-1326a589b5b1', 'multiverseId': 439083}, 'multiverseid': 439083}]", "[{'name': '焼炉の仔', 'text': '飛行\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、焼炉の仔は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': 'ドラゴンの子供には、人間とは何なのか理解できない。殺されるのがいやなら、なんで彼らは肉と宝物でできてるんだろう？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438944&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa0e4fc9-431b-4dbe-861e-e4418c16b98d', 'multiverseId': 438944}, 'multiverseid': 438944}, {'name': '熔炉幼龙', 'text': '飞行\\n{R}：熔炉幼龙得+1/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': '幼龙无法了解人类这种生物～既然不想被杀，那他们又为什么是用肉跟宝藏做的？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439193&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88d732a1-2da8-46ce-af65-8f4eae0b2e25', 'multiverseId': 439193}, 'multiverseid': 439193}]", "[{'name': '熱光線', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。熱光線はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「確かにあれは叫び声です。ただ、口があったかどうかはわかりませんね。」 ――アクーム探検協会のサチャー', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438948&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d576969-c2b7-4bd3-9246-c28a1e7dd6e3', 'multiverseId': 438948}, 'multiverseid': 438948}, {'name': '热射线', 'text': '热射线对目标生物造成X点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「先前确实听到尖叫声。但我不确定哪边是嘴。」 ～阿库姆探险队的莎琦儿', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439197&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b339aea6-f892-4ddd-b47e-ef8711f83637', 'multiverseId': 439197}, 'multiverseid': 439197}]", "[{'name': '燃え柳の木立ち', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{G}を加える。各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを得る。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '木立ちが最も美しい季節は春だ。燃えさしの蕾から若葉が開き、火の子の流れを生み出すのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439053&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4be2c99c-5f51-4c37-be43-23b00bff29e0', 'multiverseId': 439053}, 'multiverseid': 439053}, {'name': '焰柳树丛', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}到你的法术力池中。每位对手各获得1点生命。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '春天是树丛最美的季节，新叶争相从焰红叶芽探出，有如遍地野火。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439302&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd76102d1-ff89-4bda-af01-f9b6bbedb378', 'multiverseId': 439302}, 'multiverseid': 439302}]", "[{'name': '狙い撃ち', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を得る。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「祖神よ、この手に力を与えたまえ。この剣を導きたまえ。」 ――遊牧の民の戦役祈祷師', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438838&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f64178a9-478a-41d6-9ed0-0d8d8af204f7', 'multiverseId': 438838}, 'multiverseid': 438838}, {'name': '神助一击', 'text': '直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+0且获得先攻异能。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「愿圣祖灵强健吾臂，引导吾剑。」 ～游牧人战场祷文', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439087&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3623d2db-c67f-487d-b706-9ef90ec5c076', 'multiverseId': 439087}, 'multiverseid': 439087}]", "[{'name': '狩り立てる群れ', 'text': '緑の４/４のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438983&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a44105e-b829-4285-aa87-8f5a1a349160', 'multiverseId': 438983}, 'multiverseid': 438983}, {'name': '行猎兽群', 'text': '派出一个4/4绿色野兽衍生生物。\\n风暴（当施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439232&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6eff7081-9f09-4220-bf4a-2b9d70924828', 'multiverseId': 439232}, 'multiverseid': 439232}]", "[{'name': '狼狽の嵐', 'text': 'インスタントかソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。あなたは新たにそれらのコピーの対象を選んでもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438870&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5c1cc1c-1ad2-4ac9-b190-01e34d3894ee', 'multiverseId': 438870}, 'multiverseid': 438870}, {'name': '躁乱风暴', 'text': '除非目标瞬间或法术咒语的操控者支付{1}，否则反击之。\\n风暴（当施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439119&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2b11938-362b-4a6f-8b6e-116d44eb5490', 'multiverseId': 439119}, 'multiverseid': 439119}]", "[{'name': '猛り狂うベイロス', 'text': 'トランプル\\n上陸 ― 土地が１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは緑の４/４のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': '「大地が怒ってるなら、そいつらもそうよ。」 ――ニッサ・レヴェイン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438999&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b95b0482-b4ee-4f21-a92e-93159097434f', 'multiverseId': 438999}, 'multiverseid': 438999}, {'name': '莽闯巴洛西', 'text': '践踏\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以派出一个4/4绿色野兽衍生生物。', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': '「当大地发怒，他们也闹脾气。」 ～妮莎瑞文', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439248&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36a606ef-837f-4d83-8383-7c6f63c55825', 'multiverseId': 439248}, 'multiverseid': 439248}]", "[{'name': '現実離れした回顧', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からインスタント・カード１枚を無作為に選び、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438963&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fecd4c78-1bba-4f12-a304-ec6e5d8aca48', 'multiverseId': 438963}, 'multiverseid': 438963}, {'name': '虚幻回忆', 'text': '随机将一张瞬间牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439212&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0387f35-2299-40a8-8bc9-9b3eee2194bb', 'multiverseId': 439212}, 'multiverseid': 439212}]", "[{'name': '生き残りの隠し場所', 'text': 'あなたは２点のライフを得る。その後、あなたのライフがいずれかの対戦相手よりも多いなら、カードを１枚引く。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438849&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e698d567-b52c-4012-99dc-e850fc40a0ae', 'multiverseId': 438849}, 'multiverseid': 438849}, {'name': '避难密储', 'text': '你获得2点生命。然后如果你的总生命比某位对手多，则抓一张牌。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439098&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81a7204d-2345-4280-a5e5-6c82617f98b5', 'multiverseId': 439098}, 'multiverseid': 439098}]", "[{'name': '目潰しの魔道士', 'text': '{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「私がもたらすのは真実の光だ。それに盲いらされた者を哀れんではいけない。彼らには元々見る目など無かったのだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438828&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55d163c6-ec94-472b-ba20-dcebd1253305', 'multiverseId': 438828}, 'multiverseid': 438828}, {'name': '眩目法师', 'text': '{W}，{T}：横置目标生物。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '「真理光芒与我同行。毋须同情因其盲目者，他们的眼睛本就看不到。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439077&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2593e6c-36d8-4434-8a2c-de743989af8a', 'multiverseId': 439077}, 'multiverseid': 439077}]", "[{'name': '砂岩の予言者', 'text': '飛行\\n砂岩の予言者が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーの手札のカードの枚数があなたより多いなら、その差に等しい枚数のカードを引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — スフィンクス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439042&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c17ec66-acb3-432c-97cb-bffc0d1d3845', 'multiverseId': 439042}, 'multiverseid': 439042}, {'name': '砂岩先知', 'text': '飞行\\n当砂岩先知进战场时，选择一位对手。若该牌手的手牌数量比你多，则抓等同于该差距数量的牌。', 'type': '神器生物～史芬斯', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439291&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16dcd367-bed5-4a41-a154-d65a68d898b8', 'multiverseId': 439291}, 'multiverseid': 439291}]", "[{'name': '破滅の刃', 'text': '黒でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '虚無は存在はしないが、鋼のように切り裂く。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438902&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '055d03fb-840f-4ed1-a3ae-57a02f11d327', 'multiverseId': 438902}, 'multiverseid': 438902}, {'name': '送终刀锋', 'text': '消灭目标非黑色的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '虚空中无一物，却锐利似铁。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439151&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b1f42a3-e21e-4e2d-8173-d5efc8be7026', 'multiverseId': 439151}, 'multiverseid': 439151}]", "[{'name': '確固たるエイヴン', 'text': '飛行\\n高名１（このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これが高名でない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。これは高名になる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438847&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bb534c0-a06c-42ee-b28a-f38b5aeb2467', 'multiverseId': 438847}, 'multiverseid': 438847}, {'name': '壮硕艾文', 'text': '飞行\\n铭勇1（当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若它未铭勇，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且它已铭勇。）', 'type': '生物～鸟／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439096&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c53870f8-ed98-40ed-a9d4-4f401cddee5d', 'multiverseId': 439096}, 'multiverseid': 439096}]", "[{'name': '祖先の幻視', 'text': '待機４―{U}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、{U}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを４個置いた状態でこれを追放する。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）\\nプレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを３枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438857&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3f22deb-92fc-4009-ba5d-4c307d214ce1', 'multiverseId': 438857}, 'multiverseid': 438857}, {'name': '先人的预视', 'text': '延缓4～{U}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你能支付{U}并将它放逐，且上面有四个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。）\\n目标牌手抓三张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439106&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5671466-cd6c-4ee4-ba17-133fcd3b0394', 'multiverseId': 439106}, 'multiverseid': 439106}]", "[{'name': '神々の憤怒', 'text': '神々の憤怒は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。このターン、これによりダメージを与えられたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '祈る必要はどこにもなかった。神々の裁定はすでに下っていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438931&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c969280e-f99c-4e45-b30c-1a9069110972', 'multiverseId': 438931}, 'multiverseid': 438931}, {'name': '众神之怒', 'text': '众神之怒对每个生物各造成3点伤害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到伤害的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '祈祷已了无意义。因为这就是天意。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439180&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bdb70eed-32a1-4503-935c-21a479db5013', 'multiverseId': 439180}, 'multiverseid': 439180}]", "[{'name': '神出鬼没の呪拳士', 'text': 'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、神出鬼没の呪拳士は＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに、このターン、これはブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': '「新たな視点から障害を見ることを覚えよう。たとえば、その真下からとか。」 ――オジュタイの僧、チャンイ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438869&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4bfa8e3-19b2-461f-8338-d01dcd4959f9', 'multiverseId': 438869}, 'multiverseid': 438869}, {'name': '匿迹咒拳僧', 'text': '每当你施放非生物咒语时，匿迹咒拳僧得+1/+0直到回合结束，且本回合不能被阻挡。', 'type': '生物～人类／修行僧', 'flavor': '「学着从新的角度来看障碍。比如说，从下面。」 ～欧祝泰族修行僧禅益', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439118&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d567cae-6e54-43c2-a2de-34e818a19238', 'multiverseId': 439118}, 'multiverseid': 439118}]", "[{'name': '稲妻のらせん', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。稲妻のらせんはそれに３点のダメージを与え、あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「怒りは答とならない。怒りにふさわしい復讐が伴えば、それが答だ。」 ――黄金のたてがみのアジャニ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439019&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4e8d811-6881-4db3-89f2-8033602c0dbf', 'multiverseId': 439019}, 'multiverseid': 439019}, {'name': '闪电螺旋', 'text': '闪电螺旋对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害，且你获得3点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「怒火不是回应。怒火之后的复仇才是回应。」 ～金鬃阿耶尼', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439268&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34c46428-4883-4f1b-8f29-b9088ff60b30', 'multiverseId': 439268}, 'multiverseid': 439268}]", "[{'name': '空中捕食', 'text': '飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'サーモク木立の背の高い木々とそれを守る捕食者の中で、ラヴニカの自然は力を取り戻した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438969&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4afa5bb-9578-4c21-857c-24df7f87ff9b', 'multiverseId': 438969}, 'multiverseid': 438969}, {'name': '空中猎捕', 'text': '消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。你获得2点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '在耸立的撒莫林树木以及守护这些树木的掠食者之间，拉尼卡的瀚力已复归。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439218&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a497d905-191f-4a91-a68a-f18b5b061dc6', 'multiverseId': 439218}, 'multiverseid': 439218}]", "[{'name': '空智の教え', 'text': 'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは{1}{U}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、飛行を持つ青の２/２のジン・モンク・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': 'オジュタイの言葉に含まれる英知をその学徒たちが学び取るには、まずそれを龍詞から翻訳しなければならない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438888&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e46eb3a-e28f-4c72-a0e8-ee68ad70c378', 'multiverseId': 438888}, 'multiverseid': 438888}, {'name': '穹慧教诲', 'text': '每当你施放非生物咒语时，你可以支付{1}{U}。若你如此作，则派出一个2/2蓝色，具飞行异能的巨灵／修行僧衍生生物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '欧祝泰的教导必须先从龙语转译，才能让其学生领悟其间智慧。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439137&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c772ade-ab27-41a2-95ed-1b12bc3eb0fb', 'multiverseId': 439137}, 'multiverseid': 439137}]", "[{'name': '穿孔の刃', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーは、土地・カードが公開されるまで自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは、これにより公開したカード１枚につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。そのプレイヤーは、それらの公開したカードを自分の墓地に置く。\\n装備{2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439046&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcaa8cad-825f-424d-9c4f-ae5eb408ed07', 'multiverseId': 439046}, 'multiverseid': 439046}, {'name': '环锯锋刃', 'text': '每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，防御牌手从其牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张地牌为止。每以此法展示一张牌，该生物便得+1/+0直到回合结束。该牌手将所展示的牌置入其坟墓场。\\n佩带{2}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439295&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fe77c7d-7e9a-4e77-ac5c-0ef663605ebd', 'multiverseId': 439295}, 'multiverseid': 439295}]", "[{'name': '突撃陣形', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、パワーではなくタフネスに等しい点数の戦闘ダメージを割り振る。\\n{G}：防衛を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは防衛を持たないかのように攻撃できる。\\n{2}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋０/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438970&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed2a268f-ba06-4aa6-97a7-f1e88671bd25', 'multiverseId': 438970}, 'multiverseid': 438970}, {'name': '突袭阵型', 'text': '由你操控的每个生物皆依照其防御力来分配战斗伤害，而不是依照力量。\\n{G}：目标具守军异能的生物于本回合中能视同不具守军异能地进行攻击。\\n{2}{G}：由你操控的生物得+0/+1直到回合结束。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439219&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d7fcd84-90e9-451d-b622-1cefcbdf077c', 'multiverseId': 439219}, 'multiverseid': 439219}]", "[{'name': '窯の悪鬼', 'text': 'あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、窯の悪鬼は＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・ビースト', 'flavor': 'それは石の皮膚の下に爆発物を閉じ込めている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438952&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '826128cc-1344-47ab-8fa1-36665e64c0b5', 'multiverseId': 438952}, 'multiverseid': 438952}, {'name': '火炉邪鬼', 'text': '每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，火炉邪鬼得+3/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～元素／野兽', 'flavor': '它将爆发力包在石般坚硬的皮肤内。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439201&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd01c2d45-9176-41c8-bf52-f8739bc488b6', 'multiverseId': 439201}, 'multiverseid': 439201}]", "[{'name': '第６管区のワイト', 'text': '第６管区のワイトは、すべての対戦相手の墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': '迷える者やアンデッドでさえ、庇護者を必要としている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438929&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '024a0689-a365-410c-a73d-72a34649c6d5', 'multiverseId': 438929}, 'multiverseid': 438929}, {'name': '第六城区老妖', 'text': '所有对手的坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，第六城区老妖便得+1/+1。', 'type': '生物～灵俑', 'flavor': '就算堕落者和不死生物也需要保护者。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439178&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cac97be9-c9a6-42f7-a2f2-cc7452d12e51', 'multiverseId': 439178}, 'multiverseid': 439178}]", "[{'name': '精神ねじ切り', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがアーティファクト・カード１枚を捨てないかぎり、そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を捨てる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '頭が千切れる瞬間には、どんな音がするのだろう？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438930&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '149d3ded-72fd-4734-8fe6-de2f448c4537', 'multiverseId': 438930}, 'multiverseid': 438930}, {'name': '猛绞心灵', 'text': '除非目标牌手弃一张神器牌，否则他弃两张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '把头打断的声音会是怎样？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439179&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d5944a8-bb1b-4ff3-83ba-c12aa920dec9', 'multiverseId': 439179}, 'multiverseid': 439179}]", "[{'name': '精神クランク', 'text': '対戦相手が１人ライフを失うたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からその失った点数に等しい枚数のカードを自分の墓地に置く。（ダメージによりライフは失われる。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '「お前の記憶を放ち、生まれ変わらせよ。」 ――銀白の刻文、第106板、第27節', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439035&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7093420-5c34-43ab-8a27-182266577729', 'multiverseId': 439035}, 'multiverseid': 439035}, {'name': '凿灵钻', 'text': '每当任一对手失去生命时，该牌手将其牌库顶等量的牌置入其坟墓场。（伤害会导致失去生命。）', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '「抛下你的回忆，拥抱重生。」 ～《银蚀圣典》106片27段', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439284&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd903fb3b-5502-4d3c-a4be-387288640f06', 'multiverseId': 439284}, 'multiverseid': 439284}]", "[{'name': '精神石', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」 ――練達の工匠、ジョイラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439034&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8dd1bf6a-8440-4a21-aaf6-c4e50530954e', 'multiverseId': 439034}, 'multiverseid': 439034}, {'name': '心灵石', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲心灵石：抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '「法术力是尚无定形的理念，那这无穷的可能性又是什么？」 ～神器大师尤依拉', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439283&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '046977ee-f35f-4a30-9deb-eb5d20d85e34', 'multiverseId': 439283}, 'multiverseid': 439283}]", "[{'name': '統率の取れた突撃', 'text': 'クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらはそれぞれ＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '胸に投げ槍が突き刺さった状態で「盾をあげよ！」と叫ぶのは難しい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438936&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '753e68c3-2e82-48f8-b792-39a1bdab353f', 'multiverseId': 438936}, 'multiverseid': 438936}, {'name': '协同突击', 'text': '直到回合结束，至多两个目标生物各得+1/+0且获得先攻异能。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '当胸前插着标枪时，很难喊出「举盾！」。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439185&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '389f2f08-01ce-4f7c-ae8b-0117349aa5aa', 'multiverseId': 439185}, 'multiverseid': 439185}]", "[{'name': '網投げ蜘蛛', 'text': '到達\\n網投げ蜘蛛が飛行を持つクリーチャーを１体ブロックするたび、ターン終了時まで、網投げ蜘蛛は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛', 'flavor': 'それは群れからはぐれた個体を間引くことに長けている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438993&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '041d2849-9b40-48ea-aede-728407551d70', 'multiverseId': 438993}, 'multiverseid': 438993}, {'name': '撒网蜘蛛', 'text': '延势\\n每当撒网蜘蛛阻挡一个具飞行异能的生物时，撒网蜘蛛得+2/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～蜘蛛', 'flavor': '它擅长扑杀离群落单者。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439242&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42d365cb-ec98-44fb-a6a9-8a204e30bb23', 'multiverseId': 439242}, 'multiverseid': 439242}]", "[{'name': '縮退', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは１/１になる。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '飼い猫から逃げている間は獰猛さが薄らいでいるようだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438865&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd582c958-1ee0-4a8c-834b-500ccf910772', 'multiverseId': 438865}, 'multiverseid': 438865}, {'name': '缩小', 'text': '目标生物的基础力量与防御力为1/1直到回合结束。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '当沦落到在家猫面前东躲西藏的时候，原本的威风早已荡然无存。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439114&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '769f5f1b-e66b-4f6d-b362-4df4ac2be31d', 'multiverseId': 439114}, 'multiverseid': 439114}]", "[{'name': '翼の破片', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは攻撃クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。あなたは新たにそれらのコピーの対象を選んでもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438853&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37aa4bcf-ce4e-4383-85b4-bb86d00baf91', 'multiverseId': 438853}, 'multiverseid': 438853}, {'name': '翎羽飞射', 'text': '目标牌手牺牲一个进行攻击的生物。\\n风暴（当施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439102&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f7640bf-19c9-4abb-82d3-2efbf8562ff2', 'multiverseId': 439102}, 'multiverseid': 439102}]", "[{'name': '聖別されたスフィンクス', 'text': '飛行\\n対戦相手がカードを１枚引くたび、あなたはカードを２枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スフィンクス', 'flavor': 'ジン＝ギタクシアスの手による祝福をうけたもの。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438862&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f538d87a-8973-4fd3-807a-8f56f7bcca7f', 'multiverseId': 438862}, 'multiverseid': 438862}, {'name': '祝圣史芬斯', 'text': '飞行\\n每当任一对手抓一张牌时，你可以抓两张牌。', 'type': '生物～史芬斯', 'flavor': '由金吉塔厦亲手祝福。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439111&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc5ae34d-7b0c-460b-adee-99e493706638', 'multiverseId': 439111}, 'multiverseid': 439111}]", "[{'name': '聖遺の騎士', 'text': '聖遺の騎士は、あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{T}, 森１つか平地１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから土地・カード１枚を探して戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': '「バントの地勢や廃墟に関する知識は、侵略者には理解し得ない武器なのです。」 ――エルズペス・ティレル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439018&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82e33b66-c81b-4c77-865d-59fefb8fd81b', 'multiverseId': 439018}, 'multiverseid': 439018}, {'name': '圣物骑士', 'text': '你的坟墓场中每有一张地牌，圣物骑士便得+1/+1。\\n{T}，牺牲一个树林或平原：从你的牌库中搜寻一张地牌，将之放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～人类／骑士', 'flavor': '「若能熟知班特的地势与废墟，对抗入侵者时就会成为无上利器。」 ～艾紫培提瑞', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439267&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8560442a-63b6-4c41-a310-279d2be28d80', 'multiverseId': 439267}, 'multiverseid': 439267}]", "[{'name': '腐敗喰いの蛆', 'text': '腐敗喰いの蛆が戦場に出たとき、墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。あなたはそのカードのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': 'それは食物連鎖の一番上に位置するのだろうか？それとも一番下なのだろうか？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438920&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d2eff81-3a8e-48b2-bbf3-529ef659340b', 'multiverseId': 438920}, 'multiverseid': 438920}, {'name': '餮腐蛆', 'text': '当餮腐蛆进战场时，将目标生物牌从坟墓场放逐。你获得等同于该牌防御力的生命。', 'type': '生物～昆虫', 'flavor': '它究竟在食物链的顶端还是底端？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439169&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '433e7042-5df7-46d8-9e63-b68c5108660c', 'multiverseId': 439169}, 'multiverseid': 439169}]", "[{'name': '自然の要求', 'text': 'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは４点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「時間と疲れを知らぬ自然の咢が、いずれ我々をすべて飲み込むであろう。」 ――オムゥの工匠、シルダーク', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438992&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '351ce2fd-edb4-4a51-a00a-6c245ddc1473', 'multiverseId': 438992}, 'multiverseid': 438992}, {'name': '还诸自然', 'text': '消灭目标神器或结界。其操控者获得4点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「大自然永无止境的胃口总有一天会将我们全数吞噬。」 ～欧穆城神器师西尔达', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439241&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b0cc972-87fc-4a2b-9d16-ad3a472d53d8', 'multiverseId': 439241}, 'multiverseid': 439241}]", "[{'name': '至高の評決', 'text': '至高の評決は打ち消されない。\\nクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'レオノスは何のためらいもなく廃絶布告を発した。彼は雲行きが怪しくなるなか、立ち退くよう警告を発しつつスカイルーンを去った。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439025&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbcfc052-fab0-46c6-b176-c01137b018cf', 'multiverseId': 439025}, 'multiverseid': 439025}, {'name': '最高裁决', 'text': '最高裁决不能被反击。\\n消灭所有生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '雷诺兹毫不犹豫地下令彻底破坏。他已放出天符文作为驱逐令，尽管当时是阴天。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439274&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0dd478d-49bb-4d1d-a039-a76859cfb3d6', 'multiverseId': 439274}, 'multiverseid': 439274}]", "[{'name': '苦しめる声', 'text': '苦しめる声を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカードを２枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「不愉快な思考が私の精神を圧迫する。これは私の狂気によるものなのか、それとも誰か別の者の囁きなのか？」 ――サルカン・ヴォル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438965&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffd0c398-b91e-4418-bb4b-5c7919d5afde', 'multiverseId': 438965}, 'multiverseid': 438965}, {'name': '折磨幽声', 'text': '弃一张牌，以作为施放折磨幽声的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「讨厌的想法在我脑海中挥之不去。这是我自己的疯狂，还是他者的细语？」 ～萨坎沃', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439214&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cc2e9c1-d31a-4ff7-91db-7e372ab9b663', 'multiverseId': 439214}, 'multiverseid': 439214}]", "[{'name': '英雄たちを破滅させるもの', 'text': '英雄たちを破滅させるものは、＋１/＋１カウンターが４個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{G}{G}：英雄たちを破滅させるものの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。Ｘはこれのパワーに等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ハイドラ', 'flavor': '旅人たちのうわさ話によれば、ハイドラはより強くなるために、自らの首を噛み切り落とすらしい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438981&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb7f7766-2d61-4af1-8cb8-2860cfaf1662', 'multiverseId': 438981}, 'multiverseid': 438981}, {'name': '英雄灾祸', 'text': '英雄灾祸进战场时上面有四个+1/+1指示物。\\n{2}{G}{G}：在英雄灾祸上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为其力量。', 'type': '生物～多头龙', 'flavor': '旅人间相传着：多头龙会咬掉自己的头，以便变得更致命。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439230&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0de35320-63ba-48c7-ba1a-5e7b56a6959c', 'multiverseId': 439230}, 'multiverseid': 439230}]", "[{'name': '英雄の記録者', 'text': '英雄の記録者が戦場に出たとき、あなたが＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれたクリーチャーをコントロールしているならカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・ウィザード', 'flavor': '彼女は言葉を用いて絵を描くが、すべての絵が真実を表しているわけではない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439011&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d178b8f-de1a-48ca-a59c-b74ac8e6809e', 'multiverseId': 439011}, 'multiverseid': 439011}, {'name': '英雄年代史家', 'text': '当英雄年代史家进战场时，如果你操控其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，则抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～半人马／法术师', 'flavor': '她以言语描绘史诗画卷，但并非每幅画作都是历史写照。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439260&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d33c4e9-55fa-42bf-ad7a-d28944e7e7eb', 'multiverseId': 439260}, 'multiverseid': 439260}]", "[{'name': '草茂る胸壁', 'text': '防衛\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしていて防衛を持つクリーチャー１体につき、あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 壁', 'flavor': '「我々の敵は、すなわち全ての生命の最期だ。味方が足りなくなることは無い。」 ――戦争日誌', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438995&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '117deeef-26c7-40b3-8a87-3eaa882613a6', 'multiverseId': 438995}, 'multiverseid': 438995}, {'name': '蔓生城垛', 'text': '守军\\n{T}：你每操控一个具守军异能的生物，便加{G}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '生物～墙', 'flavor': '「我们的敌人一心要消灭所有生灵。别妄想能与之订立盟约。」 ～《战场札记》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439244&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5453e64f-f25a-4271-9696-c253f5e17ed0', 'multiverseId': 439244}, 'multiverseid': 439244}]", "[{'name': '血なまぐさい結合', 'text': 'あなたがライフを得るたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはその点数に等しい点数のライフを失う。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '「血は一定だ。我が一滴飲むためには、誰かが流さねばならぬ。」 ――吸血鬼の夜侯、ヴラディーン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438922&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edb0146e-ec6b-4765-8064-ebb2d5510057', 'multiverseId': 438922}, 'multiverseid': 438922}, {'name': '血色羁绊', 'text': '每当你获得生命时，目标对手失去等量的生命。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '「血量是个定数。我喝的每滴血都流自别人身上。」 ～暗夜吸血鬼法迪', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439171&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '341277c9-c0fd-4840-a1ec-5a667ad94ff9', 'multiverseId': 439171}, 'multiverseid': 439171}]", "[{'name': '血清の粉末', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\nあなたがマリガンを行えてあなたの手札に血清の粉末があるときならいつでも、あなたはあなたの手札からカードをすべて追放し、その後その数に等しい枚数のカードを引いてもよい。（マリガンの手順に加えてこれを行える。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439043&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b57a125-236c-44f1-8ee6-13284a96bb20', 'multiverseId': 439043}, 'multiverseid': 439043}, {'name': '浆液粉末', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n如果你处于能够再调度的时机，且浆液粉末在你手上，你可以放逐你手上的所有牌，然后抓等量的牌。（你除了再调度之外，也可以如此作。）', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439292&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a83eaba-083a-4168-a77a-e1b64d79cc80', 'multiverseId': 439292}, 'multiverseid': 439292}]", "[{'name': '裂け目の稲妻', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。裂け目の稲妻はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n待機１―{R}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{R}を支払うとともに時間カウンターを１個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438958&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ebd190b-c574-480d-bb29-1eee89cc5217', 'multiverseId': 438958}, 'multiverseid': 438958}, {'name': '时缝之雷', 'text': '时缝之雷对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\\n延缓1～{R}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{R}并将它放逐，且上面有一个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439207&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52693751-fd23-412a-b811-a48ae7fe4e5c', 'multiverseId': 439207}, 'multiverseid': 439207}]", "[{'name': '解体者の歓び', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋０の修整を受けるとともに絆魂を得る。それを再生する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '戦望によって、膝裂きは自分が龍より大きくなっていると考えていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438899&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d99668b-f1d6-4446-bb3e-cb077f09b6ad', 'multiverseId': 438899}, 'multiverseid': 438899}, {'name': '屠夫之喜', 'text': '直到回合结束，目标生物得+3/+0且获得系命异能。将它重生。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '渴战之愿让砍膝一族觉得自己雄壮如巨龙。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439148&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89f5f533-b906-4af7-8676-b9e9fdc3ad43', 'multiverseId': 439148}, 'multiverseid': 439148}]", "[{'name': '解呪', 'text': 'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「悪の道具は物に過ぎぬ。物すべてと同じく、永遠には存在できぬ。」 ――「万物の歌」、詩編八八一', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438830&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07ad1383-1dbc-4ae1-b378-3834854a3a17', 'multiverseId': 438830}, 'multiverseid': 438830}, {'name': '消除魔障', 'text': '消灭目标神器或结界。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「邪器也不过是凡物。就同其他事物一般，不会永存于世。」 ～《万物之歌》，881节', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439079&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4aac8c0f-4962-46af-9c35-d5b8d2a6f6e0', 'multiverseId': 439079}, 'multiverseid': 439079}]", "[{'name': '解消', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。占術１を行う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「お前を止めることができるのは神々だけ、とでも思ったのか？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438866&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ee82a51-9512-4730-b476-b0e892104fc0', 'multiverseId': 438866}, 'multiverseid': 438866}, {'name': '消融', 'text': '反击目标咒语。占卜1。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「你以为只有神才能阻止你吗？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439115&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b32077ee-a7a4-4972-8334-21815d5ecf9c', 'multiverseId': 439115}, 'multiverseid': 439115}]", "[{'name': '記憶の壁', 'text': '防衛\\n記憶の壁が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 壁', 'flavor': '「これは追憶を増補するの。何も難しいことは言ってないはずよ？」 ――哲人ペリソフィア', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438882&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ba340ab-5bdc-4cc6-9009-b7367d888adb', 'multiverseId': 438882}, 'multiverseid': 438882}, {'name': '记忆墙', 'text': '守军\\n当记忆墙进战场时，你可以将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '生物～墙', 'flavor': '「但有此物，记忆久而弥新。这有什么难懂的？」 ～哲人珀里索菲娅', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439131&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fa22b02-f675-4e6c-8371-32a97af70c08', 'multiverseId': 439131}, 'multiverseid': 439131}]", "[{'name': '謎めいた命令', 'text': '以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n• 呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\\n• パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n• 対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーをすべてタップする。\\n• カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438863&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f10ad024-5ac4-48d4-a2c0-e327fbeaea40', 'multiverseId': 438863}, 'multiverseid': 438863}, {'name': '地下指命', 'text': '选择两项～\\n•反击目标咒语。\\n•将目标永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n•横置所有由对手操控的生物。\\n•抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439112&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62e5a1da-a680-405c-9298-32b197bf2391', 'multiverseId': 439112}, 'multiverseid': 439112}]", "[{'name': '護符破りの小悪魔', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはあなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。\\nあなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、護符破りの小悪魔は＋４/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デビル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438935&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac969ef7-d65a-47e6-9c9c-a95cd3f1bceb', 'multiverseId': 438935}, 'multiverseid': 438935}, {'name': '断符魔鬼', 'text': '在你的维持开始时，随机将一张瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，断符魔鬼得+4/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～魔鬼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439184&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22b2e5e7-58c9-485b-916b-9758ccddd208', 'multiverseId': 439184}, 'multiverseid': 439184}]", "[{'name': '護衛の任務', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは防衛を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '「並の武器じゃないかよ。俺が並の人間に見えるのか？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438837&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca723fcd-a401-4d5b-9c18-503c5a996e19', 'multiverseId': 438837}, 'multiverseid': 438837}, {'name': '卫哨职责', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物具有守军异能。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '「据说这是普通问题。你觉得我很普通吗？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439086&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8299c71f-1e62-4a05-8d98-959b2df38458', 'multiverseId': 439086}, 'multiverseid': 439086}]", "[{'name': '質素な命令', 'text': '以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクトをすべて破壊する。\\n• エンチャントをすべて破壊する。\\n• 点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。\\n• 点数で見たマナ・コストが４以上のクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438825&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0eb47e5-64ed-4d04-b61f-5cbbc553636a', 'multiverseId': 438825}, 'multiverseid': 438825}, {'name': '严峻指命', 'text': '选择两项～\\n•消灭所有神器。\\n•消灭所有结界。\\n•消灭所有总法术力费用等于或小于3的生物。\\n•消灭所有总法术力费用等于或大于4的生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439074&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51bbf8b2-217e-4c51-8e39-a3a946d883fd', 'multiverseId': 439074}, 'multiverseid': 439074}]", "[{'name': '起源のハイドラ', 'text': 'あなたが起源のハイドラを唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚公開する。あなたはその中から、点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下で土地でないパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。その後、残りをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\\n起源のハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 植物・ハイドラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438978&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34982cc0-5874-4df3-bddb-50b34d39944c', 'multiverseId': 438978}, 'multiverseid': 438978}, {'name': '创生多头龙', 'text': '当你施放创生多头龙时，展示你牌库顶的X张牌。你可以将其中一张总法术力费用等于或小于X的非地永久物牌放进战场。然后将其余的牌洗入你的牌库。\\n创生多头龙进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～植物／多头龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439227&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '195470c1-bf7b-4d66-9c54-a48c98a0f2d9', 'multiverseId': 439227}, 'multiverseid': 439227}]", "[{'name': '起源の波', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚公開する。あなたはその中から、望む枚数の、点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下であるパーマネント・カードを戦場に出してもよい。その後、これにより公開し戦場に出さなかったカードをすべてあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438979&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db03a406-dedd-4ac8-af02-aa720fb5c50c', 'multiverseId': 438979}, 'multiverseid': 438979}, {'name': '创生浪潮', 'text': '展示你牌库顶的X张牌。你可以将其中任意数量总法术力费用等于或小于X的永久物牌放进战场。然后将所有以此法展示且未放进战场的牌置入你的坟墓场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439228&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae69f67e-e116-48ab-ae6e-264eb2cae788', 'multiverseId': 439228}, 'multiverseid': 439228}]", "[{'name': '超音速のドラゴン', 'text': '飛行、速攻\\nあなたはソーサリー・呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': '「我が種のなかでも未発達なこの個体でさえ、圧倒的だ。」 ――ニヴ＝ミゼット', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439016&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e585a713-619c-4411-80f5-d37da866589d', 'multiverseId': 439016}, 'multiverseid': 439016}, {'name': '极音速巨龙', 'text': '飞行，敏捷\\n你可以将法术咒语视同具有闪现异能地来施放。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': '「就连我族中这最原始的族类也都这么了不起。」 ～尼米捷', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439265&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f89f8fef-81c1-4fad-8d3c-3a755686dbc8', 'multiverseId': 439265}, 'multiverseid': 439265}]", "[{'name': '跳ね散らす凶漢', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n解鎖（あなたはこのクリーチャーを、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出してもよい。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているかぎり、これではブロックできない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '仮面は彼の正体を隠すためのものではない。臓物が目に入らないようにするためのものだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438961&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9be6f8e-4d3e-40c3-a8c2-ad43f65c8665', 'multiverseId': 438961}, 'multiverseid': 438961}, {'name': '溅血刺客', 'text': '先攻\\n脱缰（你可以让此生物进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。只要其上有+1/+1指示物，它就不能进行阻挡。）', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': '面具不是用来隐藏他的身分。这是用来不让内脏喷到他眼睛。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439210&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd476ea38-b80e-4f1e-a1b5-3db252da6479', 'multiverseId': 439210}, 'multiverseid': 439210}]", "[{'name': '進化する未開地', 'text': '{T}, 進化する未開地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '大地の回復力は尽きることはない。たとえ死しても、それは再び蘇る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439050&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2979b0e3-2a57-4aeb-951e-2490c2b77018', 'multiverseId': 439050}, 'multiverseid': 439050}, {'name': '成形野地', 'text': '{T}，牺牲成形野地：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '大地坚韧不息；即使死去，也必重生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439299&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b373ffbb-441c-4dc0-9f76-04761adc76e6', 'multiverseId': 439299}, 'multiverseid': 439299}]", "[{'name': '道の探求者', 'text': '果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nあなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、道の探求者は絆魂を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': '「どこで運命と巡り会うのかはわからないが、少なくともここでないことは確かだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438844&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d77673d-31c7-4b06-89c4-18a0224d161a', 'multiverseId': 438844}, 'multiverseid': 438844}, {'name': '灵道探求者', 'text': '灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\\n每当你施放非生物咒语时，灵道探求者获得系命异能直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': '「我也不知道我命属何方，但一定不在这。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439093&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a596da8-b753-4e9c-ad95-2920d304aa95', 'multiverseId': 439093}, 'multiverseid': 439093}]", "[{'name': '酒場の詐取師', 'text': '{T}, ３点のライフを支払う：コイン投げをする。あなたがコイン投げに勝ったなら、あなたは６点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': 'ラクドスの狂信者は彼女の一番の上客だ。彼らは痛みに臆することがなく、ほとんどの場合まともに計算ができない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438924&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bdb2a76-f070-4da3-91e5-afea21ff7868', 'multiverseId': 438924}, 'multiverseid': 438924}, {'name': '酒馆骗子', 'text': '{T}，支付3点生命：掷一枚硬币。如果你赢得此掷，你获得6点生命。', 'type': '生物～人类／浪客', 'flavor': '拉铎司教徒是她最好的顾客。他们不会因痛苦而退却，也很少擅于算术。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439173&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67d7fc08-bc7d-4eae-802c-9bb277e70d50', 'multiverseId': 439173}, 'multiverseid': 439173}]", "[{'name': '野生の寸法', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '大きさ二倍、臭いは四倍。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439006&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11963964-9dab-46f4-b6db-e7ecfadad1e6', 'multiverseId': 439006}, 'multiverseid': 439006}, {'name': '加大尺寸', 'text': '直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+2且获得践踏异能。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '尺寸变成两倍，体味变成四倍。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439255&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de18fe15-ef90-43d9-9326-746bf05fb509', 'multiverseId': 439255}, 'multiverseid': 439255}]", "[{'name': '野蛮生まれのハイドラ', 'text': '二段攻撃\\n野蛮生まれのハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}{R/G}：野蛮生まれのハイドラの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ハイドラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439022&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac8c7f57-c217-4dd8-818e-7176e209be5d', 'multiverseId': 439022}, 'multiverseid': 439022}, {'name': '蛮生多头龙', 'text': '连击\\n蛮生多头龙进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{R/G}：在蛮生多头龙上放置一个+1/+1指示物。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。', 'type': '生物～多头龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439271&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3217dbe8-c147-43d7-9217-3f42f49a0579', 'multiverseId': 439271}, 'multiverseid': 439271}]", "[{'name': '錯覚の伏兵', 'text': '瞬速\\n錯覚の伏兵にダメージが与えられるたび、その点数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・イリュージョン', 'flavor': '「それが求める餌とは暴力である。その覚悟があるのなら、与えてみるがよい。」 ――北風島の導師、ドリエル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438873&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27d0cca4-d2c0-4111-acb9-1d6c991a2184', 'multiverseId': 438873}, 'multiverseid': 438873}, {'name': '伏击猫影', 'text': '闪现\\n每当伏击猫影受到伤害时，抓等量的牌。', 'type': '生物～猫／虚影', 'flavor': '「暴力是它的口粮。够胆就去喂它吧。」 ～西北风屿导师多瑞尔', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439122&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f3016ff-3c4b-4835-862e-78a8d71edd3f', 'multiverseId': 439122}, 'multiverseid': 439122}]", "[{'name': '鏡割りのキキジキ', 'text': '速攻\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしていて伝説でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。そのトークンは速攻を持つ。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438951&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cc74130-80d8-46b5-9baf-ab5729b56126', 'multiverseId': 438951}, 'multiverseid': 438951}, {'name': '裂镜奇奇几奇', 'text': '敏捷\\n{T}：派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标由你操控且非传奇的生物之复制品。该衍生物具有敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。', 'type': '传奇生物～鬼怪／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439200&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38d8947c-94a1-424e-88ca-facd4b97ef10', 'multiverseId': 439200}, 'multiverseid': 439200}]", "[{'name': '門衛', 'text': '防衛\\n{2}{U}, {T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚自分の墓地に置く。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしている防衛を持つクリーチャーの総数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ホムンクルス', 'flavor': '鋭く一瞥するだけで、盗っ人はたいていよそへ行ってしまう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438868&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c21e842-31f0-4e69-b803-40c41325bc09', 'multiverseId': 438868}, 'multiverseid': 438868}, {'name': '守门妖', 'text': '守军\\n{2}{U}，{T}：目标牌手将其牌库顶的X张牌置入其坟墓场，X为由你操控且具守军异能的生物数量。', 'type': '生物～造妖', 'flavor': '狠狠一瞪通常就足以让盗贼知难而退。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439117&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff97a16f-76ef-4f7d-9b1d-4e4c0133d7d0', 'multiverseId': 439117}, 'multiverseid': 439117}]", "[{'name': '閉所恐怖症', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n閉所恐怖症が戦場に出たとき、エンチャントされているクリーチャーをタップする。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438860&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e294549-64cc-4aa8-81ec-ae7c1193150a', 'multiverseId': 438860}, 'multiverseid': 438860}, {'name': '幽闭恐怖症', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当幽闭恐怖症进战场时，横置所结附的生物。\\n所结附的生物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439109&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69707eb8-49b7-45a0-927b-3068606720b9', 'multiverseId': 439109}, 'multiverseid': 439109}]", "[{'name': '降る星、流星', 'text': '飛行\\n降る星、流星が死亡したとき、これは飛行を持たない各クリーチャーにそれぞれ５点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・スピリット', 'flavor': '降る星の先にあるのは破滅のみ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438959&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97741358-72d6-47ff-986c-c8efceaaf3d3', 'multiverseId': 438959}, 'multiverseid': 438959}, {'name': '赤龙流星', 'text': '飞行\\n当赤龙流星死去时，它对每个不具飞行异能的生物各造成5点伤害。', 'type': '传奇生物～龙／精怪', 'flavor': '流星急坠，赤火蔽天，粉碎一切。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439208&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7852dc8b-b4f6-46d4-9141-8628035bf848', 'multiverseId': 439208}, 'multiverseid': 439208}]", "[{'name': '隠れしウラブラスク', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーはタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 法務官', 'flavor': 'ミラディン人の抵抗勢力が到来したとき、炉に住む者はウラブラスクに導きを求めた。その彼の命じは他を凍りつかせた。「成すがままにさせよ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438967&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6faa5cbc-527c-4653-86a6-1a30e22d5c80', 'multiverseId': 438967}, 'multiverseid': 438967}, {'name': '隐匿者洼巴司', 'text': '由你操控的生物具有敏捷异能。\\n由对手操控的生物须横置进战场。', 'type': '传奇生物～魔判官', 'flavor': '当秘罗志士出现，熔炉居民等着洼巴司下命令。他的命令震慑了所有人：「随他们来。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439216&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7694c26d-f7fa-46f4-b1c0-98ccf2495f41', 'multiverseId': 439216}, 'multiverseid': 439216}]", "[{'name': '雨雲の迷路', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}を加える。この能力は、あなたが島をコントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}を加える。この能力は、あなたが平地をコントロールしているときにのみ起動できる。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'その中心を探すことは、それ自身を探すこと。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439057&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85f9e862-b759-4863-9ea6-5072f313872c', 'multiverseId': 439057}, 'multiverseid': 439057}, {'name': '玄云迷宫', 'text': '{T}：加{C}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}：加{W}到你的法术力池中。只能于你操控海岛时起动此异能。\\n{T}：加{U}到你的法术力池中。只能于你操控平原时起动此异能。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '若想找到中心，你得先搞清身在何处。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439306&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df09b8d6-061b-474b-a5df-fbf11caa6fde', 'multiverseId': 439306}, 'multiverseid': 439306}]", "[{'name': '雷口のヘルカイト', 'text': '飛行、速攻\\n雷口のヘルカイトが戦場に出たとき、これは対戦相手がコントロールしている飛行を持つ各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。それらのクリーチャーをタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438964&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f30f27c-a9b0-4b40-a0fa-3c47b7a2dc46', 'multiverseId': 438964}, 'multiverseid': 438964}, {'name': '雷喉残虐者', 'text': '飞行，敏捷\\n当雷喉残虐者进战场时，它向由对手操控且具飞行异能的每个生物各造成1点伤害。横置这些生物。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439213&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b52edf8-279c-44b6-acf8-0a29ff1484f6', 'multiverseId': 439213}, 'multiverseid': 439213}]", "[{'name': '電解', 'text': 'クリーチャーやプレイヤー、１つか２つを対象とする。電解はそれらに、２点のダメージを望むように分割して与える。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'イゼット団は、自らが教える事々から何かを学んでいる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439013&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28352686-324a-4a01-8fa4-9c87d74c4a8b', 'multiverseId': 439013}, 'multiverseid': 439013}, {'name': '电解', 'text': '电解对一个或两个目标生物和／或牌手造成共2点伤害，你可以任意分配。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '伊捷总能从自己教授的课程中学到些什么。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439262&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77d0b537-d996-4c03-b7a2-f6e36140b659', 'multiverseId': 439262}, 'multiverseid': 439262}]", "[{'name': '霊気の薬瓶', 'text': 'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは霊気の薬瓶の上に蓄積カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\\n{T}：あなたはあなたの手札から、点数で見たマナ・コストが霊気の薬瓶の上に置かれている蓄積カウンターの個数に等しいクリーチャー・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439027&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a985bcc7-fee6-49d4-bd47-af42463bd421', 'multiverseId': 439027}, 'multiverseid': 439027}, {'name': '乙太精瓶', 'text': '在你的维持开始时，你可以在乙太精瓶上放置一个充电指示物。\\n{T}：你可以将一张生物牌从你手上放进战场，其总法术力费用须与乙太精瓶上的充电指示物数量相同。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439276&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd4c7202-2bf4-429b-a1fb-0f61bd7e84c4', 'multiverseId': 439276}, 'multiverseid': 439276}]", "[{'name': '霊気化', 'text': '攻撃クリーチャーをすべてオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「少し礼儀というものを学んでから出直すんだな。それに、肉体を再構成する方法も見つけたほうがいい。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438855&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aedd13e3-8b26-47fd-ac16-6cd7bf498cf8', 'multiverseId': 438855}, 'multiverseid': 438855}, {'name': '乙太化', 'text': '将所有进行攻击的生物移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「等你学会礼貌，想出如何重构你的形体后就可以回来。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439104&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a433cfe-96f8-4fd4-bd9f-36481345c06e', 'multiverseId': 439104}, 'multiverseid': 439104}]", "[{'name': '霜のオオヤマネコ', 'text': '霜のオオヤマネコが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。そのクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・猫', 'flavor': 'それはより大型の獲物を積極的に襲う。それが反撃できないことを知っているのである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438872&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62263103-a3a9-496d-9a54-ef8ad78ce2d2', 'multiverseId': 438872}, 'multiverseid': 438872}, {'name': '冰霜山猫', 'text': '当冰霜山猫进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。该生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。', 'type': '生物～元素／猫', 'flavor': '得知对方无从反击之后，它便跃跃欲试准备捕猎更大的猎物。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439121&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cb0b15c-20b0-40cd-a71d-dc53c2fb37da', 'multiverseId': 439121}, 'multiverseid': 439121}]", "[{'name': '飢餓の声、ヴォリンクレックス', 'text': 'トランプル\\nあなたがマナを引き出す目的で土地をタップするたび、その土地が生み出したいずれかのタイプのマナ１点をあなたのマナ・プールに加える。\\n対戦相手がマナを引き出す目的で土地をタップするたび、その土地はそれのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 法務官', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439004&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c6bd082-008f-44e4-9eca-3f32c3f96376', 'multiverseId': 439004}, 'multiverseid': 439004}, {'name': '饥饿之声弗霖凯', 'text': '践踏\\n每当你横置一个地以产生法术力时，加一点该地已产生的类别之法术力到你的法术力池中。\\n每当任一对手横置地以产生法术力时，该地于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。', 'type': '传奇生物～魔判官', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439253&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c927428b-6e40-4b8a-83c7-9ddf12f1efe0', 'multiverseId': 439253}, 'multiverseid': 439253}]", "[{'name': '餌食の復讐', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。あなたの次のアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438997&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91ca12aa-8f2d-4bdf-b5a6-a05fc83a0359', 'multiverseId': 438997}, 'multiverseid': 438997}, {'name': '猎物复仇', 'text': '目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不须支付其法术力费用。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439246&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff602ac5-2159-4e27-a839-55288e6bcc24', 'multiverseId': 439246}, 'multiverseid': 439246}]", "[{'name': '魂の裏切りの夜', 'text': 'クリーチャーはすべて－１/－１の修整を受ける。', 'type': '伝説のエンチャント', 'flavor': '「如何にして我らが自らとの戦に臨めるか？我らが魂たる神に我らが挑まばどうなるか？答えは単純なり。臨むあたわずして、我らは死す。この戦に勝ち目はなし。」 ――密師範より君主今田への手紙', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438914&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ceaa608b-79d1-4b9e-9aae-0fa0b05eae51', 'multiverseId': 438914}, 'multiverseid': 438914}, {'name': '叛魂之夜', 'text': '所有生物得-1/-1。', 'type': '传奇结界', 'flavor': '「我们怎能向自身宣战？若自己灵魂之神与我们作对，又会如何？我的答案很简单：不行。我们会死。这场战争不会有胜利者。」 ～密师范致今田城主', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439163&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2cb26a49-c5d4-433f-9c5d-9266a4e70762', 'multiverseId': 439163}, 'multiverseid': 439163}]", "[{'name': '魂売り', 'text': '魂売りがクリーチャー１体にダメージを与えるたび、魂売りの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n{B}：魂売りを再生する。\\n{G}：色１色を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、魂売りはその選ばれた色になる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439024&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a6819e2-daef-4c26-b3a0-90c915ed3a71', 'multiverseId': 439024}, 'multiverseid': 439024}, {'name': '心灵贩子', 'text': '每当心灵贩子对任一生物造成伤害时，在心灵贩子上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{B}：重生心灵贩子。\\n{G}：选择一种颜色，心灵贩子成为该色直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439273&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84e9240a-9a21-4105-bfb0-2671625b1f5a', 'multiverseId': 439273}, 'multiverseid': 439273}]", "[{'name': '魂裂き', 'text': 'パワーが３以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「この目で実際に見るまでは、お前に魂があるなんて確信が持てなかったのよ。」 ――リリアナ・ヴェス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438919&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af09fea9-8e45-4591-a945-cbe33b37d737', 'multiverseId': 438919}, 'multiverseid': 438919}, {'name': '裂魂术', 'text': '消灭目标力量等于或小于3的生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「在我亲眼看到之前，我无法确信你是否有灵魂。」 ～莉莲娜维斯', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439168&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db5c40e4-cd3f-4be7-8449-c507752d1fe0', 'multiverseId': 439168}, 'multiverseid': 439168}]", "[{'name': '鼓舞する呼び声', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体につき、カードを１枚引く。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「時は来た。務めを果たすのだ。家族のため、勝利のために、突撃！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438984&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '371dcfa2-39b3-4e77-9b0d-a3cca6ddb8f5', 'multiverseId': 438984}, 'multiverseid': 438984}, {'name': '振奋呼号', 'text': '你每操控一个其上有+1/+1指示物的生物，便抓一张牌。这些生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「时机就在眼前。眼前只有荣誉。为了胜利与家人～前进！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439233&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '894ca340-51e4-433c-9dee-a70aa9b78ac0', 'multiverseId': 439233}, 'multiverseid': 439233}]", "[{'name': '龍の大嵐', 'text': '飛行を持つクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\\nドラゴンが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのドラゴンは、それにＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているドラゴンの総数に等しい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438940&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c8f7221-c76f-4121-9128-0841fdb4ba0f', 'multiverseId': 438940}, 'multiverseid': 438940}, {'name': '龙袭风暴', 'text': '每当一个具飞行异能的生物在你的操控下进战场时，它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\\n每当一个龙在你的操控下进战场时，它对目标生物或牌手造成X点伤害，X为由你操控之龙的数量。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439189&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9edcd697-a9fb-4561-a410-7f6f0521a718', 'multiverseId': 439189}, 'multiverseid': 439189}]", "[{'name': '龍屋の偶像', 'text': 'あなたがドラゴンをコントロールしているかぎり、龍屋の偶像は＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに飛行とトランプルを持つ。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ガーゴイル', 'flavor': 'この偶像は、龍がタルキールを支配し、人々が５体の龍王に従うようになった「カンの凋落」の時代に造られたものである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439030&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5c92c0f-3a35-49c2-8db7-078cf8e73dc4', 'multiverseId': 439030}, 'multiverseid': 439030}, {'name': '浮龙雕像', 'text': '只要你操控龙，浮龙雕像便得+1/+1且具有飞行与践踏异能。', 'type': '神器生物～石像鬼', 'flavor': '巨龙重回鞑契巅峰，人民转而侍奉五大龙王～这尊铸于可汗衰亡时期的雕像，正是彼时芸芸众生的最佳见证。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439279&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07de59f3-b7fb-4b38-90de-1697251bf52d', 'multiverseId': 439279}, 'multiverseid': 439279}]", "[{'name': '龍王の召使い', 'text': 'あなたがドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン', 'flavor': 'アタルカに仕えるゴブリンたちは、空腹なご主人様が彼らを食事のメニューに付け加えるのを思いとどまってくれることを期待して、自らの体に有害な薬草を練り込んだ油脂を塗りたくっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438941&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fa08c51-8198-4356-a095-365157b00c2b', 'multiverseId': 438941}, 'multiverseid': 438941}, {'name': '龙王仆役', 'text': '你施放的龙咒语减少{1}来施放。', 'type': '生物～鬼怪／祭师', 'flavor': '服侍安塔卡的鬼怪在身上涂满加了毒草的油脂，希望他们永无餍足的主人不会拿他们加菜。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439190&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ff8bdb8-52c0-41ba-9114-dfa8daba814a', 'multiverseId': 439190}, 'multiverseid': 439190}]", "[{'name': '龍詞の咆哮', 'text': '龍詞の咆哮を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたはあなたの手札からドラゴン・カード１枚を公開してもよい。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。龍詞の咆哮はそれに３点のダメージを与える。龍詞の咆哮を唱えた時点であなたがドラゴン・カードを公開したかドラゴンをコントロールしていたなら、龍詞の咆哮はそのクリーチャーのコントローラーに３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438938&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3a183f1-ad58-44fe-83de-205405df3ffc', 'multiverseId': 438938}, 'multiverseid': 438938}, {'name': '龙语怒吼', 'text': '你可以从你手上展示一张龙牌，以作为施放龙语怒吼的额外费用。\\n龙语怒吼对目标生物造成3点伤害。如果于你施放龙语怒吼时，你展示了龙牌或操控龙，则龙语怒吼对所影响之生物的操控者造成3点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439187&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a93eabd-2ce1-412c-acc8-ea81ff8dd88a', 'multiverseId': 439187}, 'multiverseid': 439187}]", "[{'name': '龍鐘の僧兵', 'text': '警戒\\n果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク', 'flavor': '龍の到来を示す僅かな兆候をとらえるため、彼は長年に渡ってその眼と耳を鍛えてきた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=438832&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '563504a9-ed7c-4730-94c6-4e12f10e83dc', 'multiverseId': 438832}, 'multiverseid': 438832}, {'name': '龙钟护僧', 'text': '警戒\\n灵技（每当你施放非生物咒语时，此生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）', 'type': '生物～人类／修行僧', 'flavor': '他长年锻炼明目聪耳，以觉察巨龙压境的任何风吹草动。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=439081&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5789cde1-7b12-458e-aca1-619637f23206', 'multiverseId': 439081}, 'multiverseid': 439081}]"]
