 'TSR', 'UDS', 'ULG', 'UMA', 'USG', 'V09', 'V10', 'V11', 'V12', 'V13', 'V15', 'VIS', 'VMA', 'VOC', 'VOW', 'W16', 'W17', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOE', 'WOT', 'WTH', 'WWK', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNE', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['All creatures get -1/-1.', 'Anger of the Gods deals 3 damage to each creature. If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn, exile it instead.', "As an additional cost to cast Draconic Roar, you may reveal a Dragon card from your hand.\\nDraconic Roar deals 3 damage to target creature. If you revealed a Dragon card or controlled a Dragon as you cast Draconic Roar, Draconic Roar deals 3 damage to that creature's controller.", 'As an additional cost to cast Foul-Tongue Invocation, you may reveal a Dragon card from your hand.\\nTarget player sacrifices a creature. If you revealed a Dragon card or controlled a Dragon as you cast Foul-Tongue Invocation, you gain 4 life.', 'As an additional cost to cast Tormenting Voice, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards.', 'As long as you control a Dragon, Dragonloft Idol gets +1/+1 and has flying and trample.', 'As long as your life total is greater than or equal to your starting life total, creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever one or more creatures you control attack, you gain life equal to the number of attacking creatures.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may have target creature get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'At the beginning of each end step, if you gained 4 or more life this turn, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, return an instant or sorcery card at random from your graveyard to your hand.\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Charmbreaker Devils gets +4/+0 until end of turn.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a charge counter on Aether Vial.\\n{T}: You may put a creature card with converted mana cost equal to the number of charge counters on Aether Vial from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Azorius Chancery enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Azorius Chancery enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {W}{U} to your mana pool.", "Bladewing's Thrall has flying as long as you control a Dragon.\\nWhen a Dragon enters the battlefield, you may return Bladewing's Thrall from your graveyard to the battlefield.", "Bloodghast can't block.\\nBloodghast has haste as long as an opponent has 10 or less life.\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you may return Bloodghast from your graveyard to the battlefield.", "Boros Garrison enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Boros Garrison enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{W} to your mana pool.", "Choose one —\\n• Creatures you control gain lifelink until end of turn.\\n• Draw a card.\\n• Put target attacking or blocking creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.\\n• Remove two time counters from target permanent or suspended card.', "Choose two —\\n• Counter target spell.\\n• Return target permanent to its owner's hand.\\n• Tap all creatures your opponents control.\\n• Draw a card.", 'Choose two —\\n• Destroy all artifacts.\\n• Destroy all enchantments.\\n• Destroy all creatures with converted mana cost 3 or less.\\n• Destroy all creatures with converted mana cost 4 or greater.', 'Counter target instant or sorcery spell unless its controller pays {1}.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}. Scry 2.', "Counter target spell. At the beginning of your next main phase, add an amount of {C} to your mana pool equal to that spell's converted mana cost.", 'Counter target spell. Scry 1.', 'Create a 4/4 green Beast creature token.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', 'Creatures you control get +2/+1 until end of turn.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Creatures you control have haste.\\nCreatures your opponents control enter the battlefield tapped.', 'Deathtouch', "Deathtouch\\nUnleash (You may have this creature enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it. It can't block as long as it has a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'Defender, flying\\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by Fog Bank.', 'Defender\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.', 'Defender\\nPut a -0/-1 counter on Wall of Roots: Add {G} to your mana pool. Activate this ability only once each turn.', 'Defender\\nWhen Carven Caryatid enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Defender\\nWhen Dragon Egg dies, create a 2/2 red Dragon creature token with flying. It has "{R}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'Defender\\nWhen Jungle Barrier enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Defender\\nWhen Mnemonic Wall enters the battlefield, you may return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Defender\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Vent Sentinel deals damage to target player equal to the number of creatures with defender you control.', 'Defender\\n{2}{U}, {T}: Target player puts the top X cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard, where X is the number of creatures with defender you control.', 'Defender\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool for each creature with defender you control.', 'Defender\\n{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. Its controller gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target creature with flying. You gain 2 life.', 'Destroy target creature with power 3 or less.', "Destroy target nonartifact creature. Its controller puts a number of cards equal to that creature's power from the top of his or her library into his or her graveyard.", 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', "Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{B} to your mana pool.", 'Double strike\\nSavageborn Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{RG}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Savageborn Hydra. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery.', 'Dragon creatures you control get +3/+3.', 'Dragon spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Draw a card for each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it. Those creatures gain indestructible until end of turn.', 'Draw three cards, then put a card from your hand on the bottom of your library.', "Each creature you control assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power.\\n{G}: Target creature with defender can attack this turn as though it didn't have defender.\\n{2}{G}: Creatures you control get +0/+1 until end of turn.", 'Each player discards his or her hand, then draws cards equal to the greatest number of cards a player discarded this way.', 'Electrolyze deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two target creatures and/or players.\\nDraw a card.', 'Enchant creature\\nAll creatures able to block enchanted creature do so.', "Enchant creature\\nAs Pentarch Ward enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\nWhen Pentarch Ward enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nEnchanted creature has protection from the chosen color. This effect doesn't remove Pentarch Ward.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has defender.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has lifelink and "Whenever a creature an opponent controls dies, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature."', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Claustrophobia enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", "Enchant creature\