 be blocked this turn.", 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, you may pay {1}{U}. If you do, create a 2/2 blue Djinn Monk creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Guttersnipe deals 2 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Kiln Fiend gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you gain life, target opponent loses that much life.', "Whenever you gain life, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Ajani's Pridemate.", "Wight of Precinct Six gets +1/+1 for each creature card in your opponents' graveyards.", 'You gain 2 life. Then if you have more life than an opponent, draw a card.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', '{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 4 life.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature named Festering Newt: Each opponent loses 4 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.', '{1}{W}{B}: Target creature gains lifelink until end of turn.\\n{1}{W}{B}: Whenever you gain life this turn, each opponent loses that much life.', '{2}, {T}: Search your library for a card named Festering Newt or Bubbling Cauldron, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', '{4}, {T}: Put a fate counter on target permanent.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Oblivion Stone: Destroy each nonland permanent without a fate counter on it, then remove all fate counters from all permanents.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} or {W} to your mana pool.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Horizon Canopy: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 3 life: Flip a coin. If you win the flip, you gain 6 life.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', "{T}, Sacrifice Mishra's Bauble: Look at the top card of target player's library. Draw a card at the beginning of 